  <para style="h">Luuka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luuka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luuka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luuka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Aza bəgyé ɓa kwú əɓahni ga ɓai ka aɓo nyadokwu, n ɓa kwu nu fyi ń əyi atasni nyi, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />n ɓwasnu shi ɓa ɓə gwo anabagyi ye ń aza yi ń ɓa ɓə kwú ɓa gyewye n əɓa awyei nyi, ń əɓa nu ɓə zhni Shekwoyi ɓəda atnutnuyi n kpmisnui, jesnu əɓa nu ɓə gwo kwo ga yi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ntucenu, Tiyofyilus əza yaakwo, shikwonyi əmihni ce mi la ɓəhoɓəhoi pmigye pəceye ń əkwo ayayaba, mi lá bwugba dna ma ka nyadokwu ye ga ho n vyido, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />nabai ń ho ɓá myi ha kpe gaiciyanunui ye ń a kwu wu ho nyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəwyegye ntu Yohana batizimazhniyi mama ɓó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Dna ń Hiridusu Yahudiya əsu əbegyi əsa, pirisiti ɓə nyi ai yi wo nge Zakariya, wo ɓə gbmi ń Abyija pirisiti okwu nu; əwo nyikwo Alizebətu cè, wo ɓə gbmi ń Haruna ofye nu. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Əɓa ń ngwnu-aba, ɓa ɓə zhni aɓəfyeceyi nu ń Shekwoyi awyeba, ɓai shi Dagayi aɓəgbetu ɓwa n awyidnai ǹ tnaɓətu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ama ɓa to ɓə n əɓyii m, ntuge Alizebətu ɓə zhni làma nu, jesnu ɓa ɓəə kwu kwo n mwa kwokwo.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />N əwyihoi əsa ń Zakariya ofye ɓə dna ń tnutnuzhni, jesnu əwoi nu dna woi zhni pirisiti tnutnu gnyi n Shekwoyi abye, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />əba kwa knyi wo, ngye shi apirisiti tnutnu kwnunu ɓə nyi, nabai wa lodna n Dagayipwuwa wa kpe nyasnidaí əná. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />She anyasnidaí ənakpe əsa ɓə la si, amwamwagayi vnyanya ɓə yezhi n əbmyi ɓai zhniaduwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Nlonu, maləka Dagayi nya wa kpeya da wo n gnyiagnyi gnyi ń bəgədi anyasnidaí ənakpe nya ń ɓwaizhe ɓwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />She Zakariya ɓə gye wo əwye, wa kwu jeje, jesnu wa vnyi n ədnai. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ama maləka wa gna wo: “To wodna m, Zakariya; a kwu əho aduwa wo. Əho nyikwo Alizebətu wo ɓə ma əɓyinugbai ga ho, ho ɓə tu wo əye ge Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Wo ɓə la zhni agbmada n bwugba bwuibwuii n əfye aba, jesnu bəgyé ɓə nya agbmada ntu əwo mama ɓo, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />ntuge wo ɓə la zhni əza yaakwo ń Dagayi abye. Wo to ɓə sni əje, kwo ənya n kwo zhni əza wa kwu jeje m, nanyinanyi; jesnu a ɓə la wo nu n Zafnu Gyigyiyii to ai ma wo m. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Wo ɓə jezeɓe n Israila aza bəgyei ń əɓa Dagayi Shekwoyi aba. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Jesnu wo ɓə la gyilo ń Dagayi abye, dna ń Zafnu kalá Iliya nya, wo ɓə pmyi azamayi adu lo ncei n əɓa aɓyi aba, jesnu atna-ɓəvyiyi ɓai pmyilo da aɓəfyeceyi wyemwa; woi zhni aza ɓai la əɓahni ye ntu Dagayi ɓo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya wa nya maləka əɓo, “Mi ɓa kpe ń wunanu nge gaiciya nu n ɓəyei a? Mi zhni zakwoi nu jesnu əmi nyikwo wo la kwo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Maləka wa gna wo, “Əmi nu zhni Gəbiri. Əmi nu gnyiagnyi gnyi ń Shekwoyi awyeba, a tnu mi tnutnu nu ma daɓo n hoi, jesnu ma gna ho nabagyi manai ye. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ama nsaiye, əgbe ɓaa ho nyí to ha shna myi ń ɓəda da m, nya əwyi ń əɓo ye ɓə nu ncei, ntuge ho to ga əmi aɓəda gaiciya, n kwo ɓə nu ń əsai n a cei tu nyi m.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Aza ɓə ɓwazhi ɓai pmi Zakariya, cei wo ɓa, əɓo n kwo zhni wonyi la mwasa lonu dna ń Dagayipwuwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />She wo ɓə gbmiɓe, to wa myi ń ɓəda da n ɓai m. Ɓa kwu kpe nge wo kwu ɓəwyegye gye dna n Dagayipwuwa, ntuge wo ɓə gnyi woi wu ɓa aɓo n aɓwai nu, to wa shna myi ń ɓəda da m.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />She əwo tnutnuzhni əsa ɓə kwu nu, wa jezelo əwo pwuwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />N dəye avnu, əwo nyikwo Alizebətu, wa la nubwo jesnu waa əwohni ɓwudna apya ngwnu-atnu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Wa gna, “Dagayi nu ń kwu dəye zhni ga mi. Wo kwu əwo bmyashi wu mi dna ń anyipyei ye jesnu wo la vnyinkwo kpma mi dna ń aza.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəwyegye ntu Yeisu mama ɓó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Dna ń əpya tnanyii she Alizebətu ɓə la nubwo, Shekwoyi wa tnu maləka Gəbiri wa lo Nazereti əzhi ń Gəlili, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />lo da ɓyinyikwoyi kwului ń a ɓəə la wo dù nabai wa so ənu n a ɓə zhni ai yi wo ge Yusufu nyi, Dawuda yawyi. Əɓyinyikwoi kwului əye ɓə nyi Mariyamwu nu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Maləka wa lo əwo aba wa gna wo, “Mi ɓyi ho əgna lo, əho ń ho la bmyashi yaakwo ɓwa nyi! Dagayi n kwnusnu lo n hoi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariyamwu wa kwu jeje ntu maləka ɓəda ɓo, cei wó wo, kwo knyi gnaɓyii pya nu nyi a? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ama maləka wa gna wo, “To wodna m, Mariyamwu, ho la bmyashi ɓwa n Shekwoyi aba. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ho ɓa la nubwo jesnu ho ɓə ma əɓyinugbai, ho ɓə yi əwo ge, Yeisu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Wo ɓə la zhni əza yaakwo jesnu ai yi wo ge Əza Duduyi Nugwnu. Dagayi Shekwoyi ɓə ga wo əbeshnikpegye əwo dada nya; Dawuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Wo ɓə gyi əbe tu ń Yakwuɓwu pwuwa nyalonyalo; əwo əbegyi to ɓə shna zo m.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariyamwu wa nya maləka əɓo, “Dəye ɓə yezhni n wunanu, shikwonyi mi ye zhni ɓyinyikwoi kwului nu nyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Maləka wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə yakpe ho, jesnu Ikwo Əza Duduyi nya ɓə tu ho əfnu. Ntulonu əza gyigyiyi ń a ɓə ma nyi, a ɓə yi wo ge Shekwoyi Nugwnu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kwo Alizebətu əho mapwi, wo ye wa ma əɓyi nu dna n əwo kwokwo, jesnu əza ń a ɓə zhni ai gna nge wo zhni làma nyi, wo dnalo ń əwo əpya tnanyii nu n nubwoi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Ntuge ɓəda ho to lo ń kwo gbmi ń Shekwoyi aba n kwo ɓa gbakalá m.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariyamwu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi zhni Shekwoyi tnutnuyi nu, fa əho ɓəda n ha da n mii nyi kwa nu.” Nlonu maləka wa laka n əwo aba.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariyamwu lo Alizebətu gnaɓyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Nsayii, Mariyamwu wa ye əwohni wolowolo, wa lo əzhi ń kwo kpe n Yahuda əpe kwnukwnù, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />wa lodna ń Zakariya pwuwa, wa ɓyi Alizebətu gna. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />She Alizebətu ɓə wo Mariyamwu gnaɓyi, əɓyi n kwo ɓə dna n Alizebətu nubwo nyi, kwa jeashna n agbmadai jesnu Alizebətu waa nu n Zafnu Gyigyiyii. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Wa sáwyi n bəgye yaakwoi wa gna: “Anabəlikada nu n hoi dna ń anyikwo aje atasni, jesnu anabəlikada nu ń əɓyii ń ho ɓə ma nyi! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />To, knyiyi nu naa zhni minyi la bmyashi ɓwa ń snulai a, nge əmi Dagayi əya woi ɓe əmi aba a? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Əsa ń əho gnaɓyi kwa lo əmi atnubwa ncei, əɓyi ń kwo dna ń əmi nubwo nyi, waa jeashna n agbmadai. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Anabəlikada nu n nyikwozai ń wo la gaiciyaga tu ənya n Dagayi wo kwu gna wo nge kwo ɓa zhni nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariyamwu anyí</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mariyamwu wa gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Əmi wyewyeyi kwo lá Dagayi tu lo,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />jesnu əmi zafnu kwo dagbma lo dna n Shekwoyi əmi Gnyiyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ntuge wo pá əwo tnutnuyi tukwogbayi ɓo lo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo n abyei, cala vnyanya ɓə yi mi nge anabəlikada,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ntuge Shekwoyi Duduyi Ikwoda wo kwu aɓo ayaakwo zhni ga mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">əwo əye zhni gyigyiyi nu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Əwo snusnugye lo aza yi aba ń ɓa wó əwo ədna nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">kwoi laka ń cala gbmanyi kwoi lo cala ədo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wo kwu ikwo aɓo zhni n əwo ɓwagbmai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">wo la aza gnamyi n ɓa ń tukwomwai fyi n əɓa bwugba aɓənubwozhni.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Wo la abegyiyi kazhi n əɓa abeshnikpegye, wonyi ce wo la atukwogbayi kwu kpe.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wo kwu anya amanaii ga amyikwnuyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ama wo la anyaɓwayi nyaya n aɓwa gbəloii.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Wo kwu Israila əwo tnutnuyi bmazhni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">woi pá woi wu snusnugye<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />ga Ibrahim ɓədo n əwo ayawyii nyalonyalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">n ɓwasnu shi wo ɓə ga əyi azakwoyi ɓəgbeshi nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariyamwu waa dna n Alizebətui ngye apya ngwnu-ata wa kpe jezelo əwo əzhi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana batizimazhniyi mama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />She əsa ɓə la si n Alizebətu ɓá kágna, wa ma əɓyinugbai. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />She əwo akwnuzhiyi ɓədo n əwo əbyei ɓə wo nge Dagayi kwu snusnugye yaakwo wu wo, ɓa bma wo agbmada nya.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Dna n nyipyei nyimwanyimwai, ɓa ɓe ntuge ɓa zhni wo nyaznu ɓo, ɓai ye ɓa tu wo əwo dada əye, Zakariya; <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />ama əwo əya wa daɓo wa gna, “Aawo! A ye a yi wo nge Yohana nu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Ɓa gna wo ge, “Əzaho to lo n əfye əbyé ń a yi wo n əye yei m.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ntulonu ɓa nya əwo dada əɓo n aɓwai, ɓá kpe əye ye n wo ncei pma a tu əwo əɓyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Wa nya ənya kakpe nya ɓo, wa ka tu: “Əwo əye: Yohana nu.” Kwaa zè ɓəwowoi ga zahozahoyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Nsayisayii əwo əgbe kwa gwuya, əwo nyitala kwa loya jesnu wa ya ɓəda da woi ci Shekwoyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Əɓa akwnuzhiyi ɓa kwu nu n ɓəwowoi, ń Yahuda əpe kwnukwnù vnyanya, aza ɓa da aɓo ye vnyanya əɓo. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Zahozahoyi ń wo ɓə kwu əɓo ye wo, waa nu gnyi n ɓənubwozhnii, woi nyaɓo, “Əɓyi ye ɓə mwa wa zhni nyikado pya nu a?” Ntuge Dagayi əɓwa kwnusnu lo n woi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakariya anyí</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Əwo dada Zakariya, ń nunui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, wa da sheɓəgwogna:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Latu kwo la zè Dagayi nya, Israila Shekwoyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">ntuge wo la ɓe əwo aza aba, wonyi la ɓa shna.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Wo la gnyignyi mwayí la wu yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">dna n Dawuda əwo tnutnuyi pwuwa<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />(shi wo ɓə da dna ń əwo sheaɓəgwognayi agyigyiyi agbe ń aye bəgyé avnu nyi),<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />gnyignyi ń əyi anuwnuyi akwnu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">jesnu n aza aba vnyanya ń ɓa wnunu n əyii nyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Wa wu əyi azakwoyi snusnugye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">jesnu wa pá əwo ɓəgbeshi gyigyiyi ɓo,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />nyasí ń wo ɓə si ga əyi zakwoi Ibrahim nyi:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Wa gwo yi ya n əyi anuwnuyi akwnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">jesnu wa bma yi zhni ya zhni əwo tnutnu ntna ədna<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />dna ń gyigyi ɓəzhni n ɓəfyecezhnii zhi n əwo abye ń əyi anyipyei anyìgyi nya vnyanya.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Njesnu əho, əmi əɓyi, a ɓa yi ho ge sheɓəgwognayi Əza Duduyi Vnyanya nya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ntuge əho nu ɓə lá gyilo ń Dagayi abye, hoi zhni zokwo ga wo,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />wa ga əwo aza gnyignyi ɓəyekpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ntu əɓa aleifyi zo ɓo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />ntu əyi Shekwoyi yeye snusnugye nya ɓo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">n əkwo nu ɓə zhni nyipyei kpəkpəi kwoi gbmi ń əshemi kwoi ɓe da yi<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />kwa ga bwuznagna ga aza yi n ɓa fyilo ń wyegbma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">jesnu ń aza yi ń ɓa n apitai kpe n əfyi agbemi, kwa zhni əyi apita fyi ń zokwo awogye bwugbafu nya.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Nlonu əɓyi yi wa mwa waa kalá dna n zafnu; wa gyianyì dna n zhabwikawu, nya əwyi n wo ɓə wu əwohni pəipəi n Israila.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu Mama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Fyi ń anyipyei yii, Kaisa Agwotusu wa ga ɓəgbetu nge a bà aza ń Roma əknyi vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />(Dəye nu ɓə zhni azaba kpmisnui əsa ń Kwurinus ɓə zhni gwomna tu n Siriya nyi.) <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Zahozahoyi wa jezelo əwo əzhi nabai wa lo aa ka əwo əye.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Ntulonu Yusufu cè, wa fa Nazereti dna n Gəlili, wa gwnulo Baitalamyi ń Yahudiya əknyi ń Dawuda əzhi, ntuge wo ɓə gbmi ń əbyé yi nu. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Wo ɓə lo əzhi yi aa ka əwo əye nu ɓədo n Mariyamwui ń a ɓə la wo dù, wa pamwula n woi nyi, jesnu əwo əɓyima sa ɓə la gá kwa si. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Əsa ń ɓa ɓə fyi ncei n ɓo, əsa kwa si ń wo ɓa ma əɓyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Wa ma əwo əɓyi kpmisnui, əɓyinugbai. Waa wo kpmidna n aje, wa wo ya dna ń anyakpa nyagyibwe, ntuge azhiɓeyi əgbe to ɓə ye nyi ntu n əɓa ɓo m.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Njesnu aknyiknayi ɓə zhi ń zhabwi vyivyiwyi, ɓai gwu əɓa aknyi n sukwoi. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Maləka Dagayi nya wa kpeya da ɓa, latu Dagayi nya kwa bmyana fyi ɓa n shegwnu, jesnu ədna kwa wo ɓa n mwa kwokwo. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ama maləka wa gna ɓa, “Fye to wodna m. Mi ɓe fye n anabagyi manai nu, n kwo ɓa ɓe n agbmada yaakwoi, n aza vnyanya aba. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Nnaiye dna ń Dawuda əzhi, a la Gnyiyi ma ga fye; əwo nu zhni Kirisiti, Dagayi. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Dəye nu ɓaa fye zhni əznù: Fye ɓə gye əɓyi n kpmidna ń aje n yadna ń anyakpa nyagyibwe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />N əsagbmanyii, deeji yaakwo əshemi nya ɓa kpmiyazhi n kwnusnu n amaləkai, ɓai ci Shekwoyi ɓai gna,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Latu zhni Shekwoyi nya nu dna n əshemi asnada duduyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">n kasnu dna n əknyi bwugbafu ga aza yi ń ɓa kwu əwo bmyashi ɓwa nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />She amaləka ɓəə kwu ɓa fa zhi jesnu ɓai kwu lofyi ń əshemi, aknyiknayi ɓa gna aje, “Fye ɓe ya lo Baitalamyi yii gye əɓo ye ń kwo kwu zhni nyi, ədo ń Dagayi wo kwu əkwo əɓo gna yi nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ntulonu, ɓa kwuka lo wolowolo jesnu ɓa lo ɓa gye Mariyamwu n Yusufui, ɓədo n əɓyipwutui, ń a ɓə n woi yadna ń anyakpa nyagyibwe nyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />She ɓa ɓə kwu wo gyewye, ɓa ya anabagyi gnamyi ntu ɓəda ɓo ń a ɓəə kwu gna ɓa ntu əɓyi ye ɓo nyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə wo əɓo ń aknyiknayi ɓə da nyi, ca wo ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ama Mariyamwu wa kwu aɓo ye vnyanya wnakna jesnu woi zhni ɓa nubwo fyi ń əwo ədu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Aknyiknayi ɓa jezezhi ɓai lá Shekwoyi tu jesnu ɓai ci wo, ntu aɓo vnyanya ɓo, ń ɓa ɓə kwu wo jesnu ɓai kwu gyewye nyi, n ɓwasnu shi a ɓə gna ɓa nyi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />N nyipyei nyimwanyimwayii, she əsa ɓə la si a znu əɓyi ənya, a tu wo əye ge Yeisu, əye ń maləka ɓə ga tunyi, to ai la əwo nubwo nyi m.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gaga dna n Dagayipwuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />She əɓa əbmyikwnu anyazhnazhna kwnunu əsa ɓə la si, ngye shi Mwusa owa ncei da, Yusufu n Mariyamwui, ɓa la wo lo ncei ń Urishelima, ɓa lo ɓəə dna wo ń Dagayi akwnu <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(ngye shi kwo kafyilo n Dagayi owa, “Əɓyinugbai kpmisnui dəhodəhoi a ɓaa wo knyignyi ga Dagayi”), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />jesnu a ga nyagbmi, ntuge a nu Dagayi owa n kwa gna: “Alukpe ngwnu-aba kwo alukwukwu ɓyii ngwnu-aba.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Nsayii, əzaho ɓə dna ń Urishelima ai yi wo ge Simyiyon, wo ɓə zhni ɓəfyeceyi nu jesnu n wyenyiyi ń Shekwoyi vyi. Wo ɓə gnyi woi pmi atnazhni Israila nya nu, jesnu Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə kwnusnu n woi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓəə kwu gna wo nge wo taa fyí, to woi gye Dagayi Kirisiti əwye m. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Zafnu wa to wo ədu əɓwa, kwa zhni wo wa lo Dagayipwuwa. She azamayi ɓə loɓe n Yeisui nabai ɓa nu əɓo n owa n cei znutu nyi, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simyiyon wa gwo wo shi ń əwo akwnu, wa ci Shekwoyi woi gna:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Dagayi Duduyi vnyanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">shi ho ɓə lá ɓəgbeshi shi nyi, nsaiye kwu əho tnutnuyi gnami wa lo n bwugbafui.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ntuge əmi awye ɓa kwu əho gnyignyi gyewye,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />n ho kwu kwo zhni ń abye vnyanya awye nyi:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />bwuznagna ntu ɓəwyegye ɓo ga Abyedo jesnu ntu Israila əho aza latu ɓo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Əɓo n a ɓə da tu ń əɓyi yi tukwo nyi; ca wo əɓyi dada n əwo əyai. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Nlonu Simyiyon wa tu ɓa anabəlika wa gna Mariyamwu əwo əya: “Əɓyi ye ń wonyi, əwo ɓətukwo ge, wa zhni aza bəgyé ɓa myiya nu; azaho ɓa kwukazhi ń Israila, jesnu wo ɓaa zhni əznù nu, ń a ɓa daɓo tu n əkwo tukwo, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />nabai ń a ɓa kpmi adu bəgyé ɓənubwozhni ya wu. Jesnu əbeyaakwo ɓa fnyi əhohni wyewyeyi ce.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Njesnu sheɓəgwognayi ɓə dna n ɓo ce, Ana Pyenuwel nyigwnu, woi gbmi n Asha əbyé. Wo ɓəə la kwo dəidəi; wo ɓəi gyianyì n əwo əɓai aye tnaaba nu ɓwasnu dna n amwula, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />jesnu n dəye avnu, waa zhni nyigbayi nya aye shiinyimwanyimwa-ceanyi. Wo to ɓə gbmiya ń Dagayipwuwa m, ama wa ce woi ga Shekwoyi mwamwa ń sukwoi ń nyipyei n əgbewnai ɓədo n aduwazhnii. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Wa laka ɓe da ɓa n əsayii, wa sa Shekwoyi ami, jesnu wa daɓo tu ń əɓyi yi tukwo ga aza vnyanya, n ɓa ɓə zhi ń əwyei tu n Urishelima shnashná əɓo nyi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />She Yusufu n Mariyamwui ɓə kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi zozhni ngye shi Dagayi owa ncei znutu, ɓa jezelo Gəlili ɓa lo Nazereti əɓa əzhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Nlonu əɓyi yi wa mwa waa kalá dna; wo ɓə nunui n wyemwai, jesnu shebmyashi Shekwoyi nya ɓə kpe n wo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓyinugbai nawyii Yeisu dna n Dagayipwuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Əye dəhodəhoi əwo azamayi ɓə zhni ɓa lo Urishelima ntu Paska Awyefna ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />She wo ɓə kwu aye ɓwa awoceaba, ɓa lo awyefna n kwnusnu, ngye shi əɓa kwnunu nyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Shi awyefna ɓə kwu zo fna, əsa ń əwo azamayi ɓə zhi ɓai jezelo apyi, ɓyinugbai nawyi Yeisu, waa kpedna ń Urishelima, ntna əɓa akpe. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Əwo azamayi ɓa zhninubwo nge wo kwnusnu lo n ɓai nu, ɓa znazna nyipyei ɓwugyi. Nlonu ɓa ya wo znashni n əɓa azaje aba ɓədo n anugwnudoi. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />She ɓa to ɓə gye wo əwye m, ɓa jezelo Urishelima ɓa lo ɓəə zna wo shni. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />N anyipyei ngwnu-ata avnu, ɓa gye wo əwye dna ń Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, n sase dna ń anyawuyi atasni, woi kna ɓa tnubwa jesnu woi nya ɓa aɓo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Zahozahoyi ń wo ɓə kwu əwo ɓəda wo, ce ɓə kwu wo wo ntu n əwo awyega ɓo ɓədo n əwo ɓəgbednai. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />She əwo azamayi ɓə gye wo əwye, ca wo ɓa. Əwo əya wa gna wo, “Nugwnu, knyiyi nu na zhni honyi zhni əɓo kpe yi n wu nlai a? Əho dada n mii, yi kwu laɓa yii zna ho shni n aɓəsai.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Wa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu ɓə zhni fyei zna mi shni a? Fye ta kpəlo ge kwo ɓə zhni ɓəshishi nu maa dna n əmi Dada pwuwa m?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ama ɓa to ɓə ɓwa awyega əɓo n wo ɓə gnyi woi gna ɓa nyi m.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Nlonu wa shnilo Nazereti n kwnusnu n ɓai jesnu wa vyi əɓa ɓəda. Ama əwo əya wa kwu aɓo ye vnyanya sofyi n əwo ədu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Jesnu Yeisu wa mwa dna n wyemwa, n nayii, n bmyashii n Shekwoyi aba ɓədo n azanyikwocii.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yohana batizimazhniyi zhni zokwo ga Dagayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Dna ń əye awocei tnuuyi Tiberiyas Kaisa əbegyi nya; əsa n Byilatusu Pwontus ɓə zhni gwomna tu n Yahudiya, Hiridusu woi gyibe tu ń Gəlili, əwodo Fyilibwus woi gyibe tu ń Ituriya ɓədo n Tarakwonitisii, Lisaninyas woi gyibe tu ń Abyileni; <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />əsa ń Anas ɓədo n Kayafasii ɓa ɓə zhni apirisiti adnagbmai, Shekwoyi ɓədagbma kwa ɓə da Yohana Zakariya nugwnu dna ń zhabwikawu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Wa zna laɓa n azhigba vnyanya n ɓa ɓə she Urudu gwnu, woi zhni waazi batizima abwuye nya ntu n aleifyi zo ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ngye shi kwo kafyilo n aɓədagbma pafyi sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya nya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Əza bəgye dnawyi lo dna ń zhabwikawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Zhni zokwo ga Dagayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">la awogye tacé ceewo ntu n əwo ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Dnabminu dəhodəhoi á ɓə kwu kwo nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ape n atutului, ai la ɓa ɓaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Azokwo aknaknai ai laɓa tacé,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ai kwu azokwo ɓwokwnu nu.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Azanyikwoci vnyanya ɓa ɓəə gye Shekwoyi gnyignyi əwye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana wa gna deeji ń ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe nge wa zhni ɓa batizima nyi, “Əfye agbezhi aɓyi! Nyika nu na kwnù fye nge fye bwusi n Shekwoyi minagyi napyei n kwo ɓe lo nyi a? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Fye wu alu abwiye nya. Jesnu fye to gna əfyehni, ‘Yi n Ibrahim lo n zhni əyi dada m.’ Ntuge əmi nu gna fye nge, Shekwoyi ɓa myi wa kwu aɓyi kala zhi ga Ibrahim n akwuta ye. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />A la gbakwnu lu la tu ń ashnuwna gbegye, shnuwna dəhodəhoi ń kwo to ga gyigyi manai m, a ɓə znu kwo ya shi, jesnu ai la kwo sheya dna n əná.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Deeji kwa nyaɓo, “To knyiɓei nu n yi ɓa zhni a?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohana wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əza n wo n ajei lo ngwnu-aba, wo knyi ga əza n wo to ncei lo m, jesnu əza n wo n nyagyii lo, wo ce ga əza n wo to ncei lo m.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Agədu gwoyi ce, ɓa ɓe nge a zhni ɓa batizima. Ɓa nyaɓo, “Nyawuyi, knyiɓei nu n yi ɓa zhni a?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Wa gna ɓa, “Fye to gwo n dutu shi a gna fye gwo m.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nlonu akwnuyi ho ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Əyihni ce, yi zhni n wunanu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye to fna aza gyiwye n akalái kwo fya kpe aza aɓo akatá nya m; əfye apyáshe-gyiwye ɓa kwu fye kwnuagbma.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Aza ɓə zhi ɓai pmi n awyetui, jesnu əɓa vnyanya ɓai saaɓo fyi n əɓa adu; kwo a ɓa kwu gye ge Yohana nu zhni Kirisiti. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohana wa dnaɓəgbe ga əɓa vnyanya, “Mi zhni fye batizima n nuwnai nu. Ama əzado ɓəə ɓe n wo du mi lo n kalá, əwo abwada abma mi to kwnuce lo ma lo ɓa ya m. Əwo nu ɓəə zhni batizima n Zafnu Gyigyiyii ɓədo ənái. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Əwo fnyitala àpmana pyeya nya, kwo dnalo ń əwo akwnu, wa zhni əvye aba, jesnu wa ye alikama fyi n əwo dobwi, ama wo ɓə dna əsní əná n ənái n kwo taa shna wnu m.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nlonu n aɓədagbma ajei n mwa, Yohana wa myì aza zhi jesnu wa zhni ɓa waazi nabagyi manai nya.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ama she Yohana ɓə gnaknyi Hiridusu, gwomna, ntu əwo mwulapa ɓo n Hiriduya əwodo nyikwo, ɓədo n aɓənukwoi ajei vnyanya n wo ɓəə kwu zhni nyi, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hiridusu waa aɓo ye yegwnuaje vnyanya: wa wna Yohana, waa wo gwudna n zhalu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu batizimazhni n əwo əbyé ofyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />She a ɓə gnyi ai zhni aza vnyanya batizima, a kwu batizima zhni Yeisu cè. Jesnu shi wo ɓə gnyi woi zhniaduwa, əshemi kwa gwuya <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Zafnu Gyigyiyi wa shnizhi tu n Yeisu ngye lukpe. Jesnu a wo bəgye kwa gbmiɓe n əshemi: “Əho nu zhni əmi Nugwnu, əza n mi ye wo; n əhoi nu n mi ɓwa agbmada.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />N əsa ye, Yeisu n əwohni tukwo, wo ɓəə kwu aye ɓwa ngye shiita nu, əsa ń wo ɓə ya əwo ɓəvyitnutnu nyi. A ɓə zhninubwo nge wo ɓə zhni Yusufu nugwnu nu, Heli nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Matati nugwnu, Levyi nugwnu, Melki nugwnu, Janai nugwnu, Yusufu nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Matatiyas nugwnu, Amosu nugwnu, Nahum nugwnu, Elsi nugwnu, Naggai nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Maati nugwnu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:26">Matatiyas nugwnu, Semein nugwnu, Josek nugwnu, Joda nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Jowana nugwnu, Resa nugwnu, Zerubabel nugwnu, Shetiya nugwnu, Neri nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Melki nugwnu, Addi nugwnu, Kosam nugwnu, Elmadam nugwnu, Er nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Joshuwa nugwnu, Eliyaza nugwnu, Jorim nugwnu, Matati nugwnu, Levyi nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Simyiyon nugwnu, Yahuda nugwnu, Yusufu nugwnu, Jonam nugwnu, Eliyakim nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Meliya nugwnu, Mena nugwnu, Matata nugwnu, Natan nugwnu, Dawuda nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Jesse nugwnu, Obedi nugwnu, Bowaz nugwnu, Salmon nugwnu, Nashon nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Aminadab nugwnu, Ram nugwnu, Hezron nugwnu, Perez nugwnu, Yahuda nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yakwuɓwu nugwnu, Ishakwu nugwnu, Ibrahim nugwnu, Tera nugwnu, Nahor nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Serug nugwnu, Riyu nugwnu, Peleg nugwnu, Əba nugwnu, Shela nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Kanan nugwnu, Arpazod nugwnu, Shem nugwnu, Nuhu nugwnu, Lamek nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Metusela nugwnu, Enok nugwnu, Jared nugwnu, Mahalaliye nugwnu, Kenan nugwnu, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Enos nugwnu, Seti nugwnu, Adamwu nugwnu, Shekwoyi nugwnu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu mwumwu dna n zhabwikawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yeisu, ń nunui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, wa fa Urudu jesnu Zafnu wa lo n woi ń zhabwikawu, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />aba ń Shetam ɓə mwu wo, anyipyei shiinyi. Wo to ɓə gyi nyaho fyi ń anyipyei yi m, jesnu shi anyipyei yi ɓə kwu zo, myikwnu kwaa wo gwnu.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shetam wa gna wo, “Ngye ho zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu, akpəge ho gna kwuta ye nge kwo la zè biledi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo kafyilo: ‘Zanyikwoci taa gyianyì n nyagyii nu gbmanyi m.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Shetam wa la wo gwnulo ncei ń aba asnada, wa wu wo anyì abemi vnyanya n əsagbmanyii. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Njesnu wa gna wo, “Mi ɓa kwu əɓa ikwo ga ho vnyanya ɓədo n əɓa bmyabmyai, ntuge a kwu ɓa ga mi, jesnu mi ɓa myi ma ga zahozahoyi n mi ncei pma. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ngye ho ɓa ga mi mwamwa, əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓá kwu zè əho nya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo kafyilo: ‘Mwa Dagayi əho Shekwoyi, jesnu əwo nu ɓwasnu n ho ɓa zhni wo tnutnu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Shetam wa lo n woi ń Urishelima, jesnu waa wo knyitu ń Dagayipwuwa àsna duduyi shé. Wa gna, “Ngye ho zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu, she əhohni ya shi ń əknyi tu n ya. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ntuge kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">“ ‘Wo ɓa ga amaləka gbetu tu ń əho tukwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">ɓa gwu ho pəceye;<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />ɓa ɓə la ho lawu dna n əɓa aɓwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">nabai n ho to ɓə znu pita n kwuta m.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “A ncei da lo: ‘To dna Dagayi əho Shekwoyi n mwumwu m.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />She Shetam ɓə la pwo əwo mwumwu ye ɓo vnyanya, wa fa wo, woi pmi əsado n wo ɓə je ɓwa wa mwi wo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Yeisu aɓəna n Nazereti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yeisu wa jezelo Gəlili dna n Zafnu kalá, əwo nabagyi kwa lapwi ń əknyii azhigba vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Wo ɓə gnyi woi wunya dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu, jesnu zahozahoyi wa ci wo.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Wa lo Nazereti, aba n wo ɓə mwa dna nyi, jesnu n Sibyiwyii wa lodna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu shi əwo kwnunu ɓə nyi. Wa laka gnyi wa ba ənya, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />a ga wo əpa nyakashi kpmikpmii sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya nya. Wa lo kwo ya, wa gye aba n kwo ncei kafyilo:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Dagayi Zafnu kpəlo n mi, ntuge wo la mi knyi ma da anabagyi manai ga asnayi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wo ɓə tnu n mii ma dnawyi loloya nya ga aza n ɓa fyilo n zhalu, jesnu wyebagye ga wyebwayi, ma kwnu aza ya n snuwna, <verse eid="LUK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />ma dnawyi əyé bmyashi Dagayi nya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Nlonu wa kpmi əpa nyakashi kpmikpmii, waa kwo je əkwo aknawnayi ga jesnu waa sase. Zahozahoyi n wo ɓə dna ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, ɓa kwu awye byece wo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Wa gna ɓa, “N naiye, nyakagyigyiyi ye kwo la nu fyi ń fye atnubwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Aza vnyanya ɓa daɓo manai tu n əwo tukwo, ca wo ɓa ntu aɓəda shebmyashi nya ɓo n ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe n əwo əgbe nyi. Ɓa nyaɓo ge, “Əza ye nu to zhni Yusufu nugwnu m?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Ɓəhnihni fye ɓa si mi ɓəsisi ye: ‘Shigbeda ka əhohni gna!’ Jesnu fye ɓa gna mi ge, ‘Zhni aɓo dna ń əhohni əzhi ye, ənya ń yi kwu wo nge ho kwu zhni dna ń Kapanam nyi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Wa gwodu, “Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, sheɓəgwognayi dəhodəhoi to lo n a gwo wo ń əwohni əzhi m. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Mi gna fye gaiciya nu, nge anyigbayi bəgyé ɓə fyi n Israila ń Iliya anyipyei, əsa ń a ɓə lá əshemi gwù aye ngwnu-ata n tokwnui, jesnu myikwnu nazhii kwa gwnù n əknyii vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Dudulonu, a to ɓə tnu n Iliyai ń əzaho aba n ɓa m, ama a tnu n əwoi lo da nyigbayi n Zarefat ń Sidon əknyi. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nlonu ń nayiwnu anyasnai ɓə mwa bəgyé fyi n Israila ń sheɓəgwognayi Elisha əsa, dudulonu əzaho to ɓə nyi dna n ɓa ń wo ɓə ɓwa kágna m, akpəge Naaman Siriyayi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə fyi ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu nyi, she ɓa ɓə wo ɓəye ɓa gyi minagyii napyei. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Ɓa kwukala zhi, ɓa gbmi wo ya n əzhi, ɓa lo n woi ń agəgyigəgyi əpe kwnukwnù nya n əzhi ɓə mi kpe ń əkwo nu nyi, nabai ɓa ce wo aɓwaya shni n agəgyigəgyii. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ama wa znazna dnalo ncei n deeji atasni, wa wna əwo zokwo.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gbmi zafnu ajegbmii ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Nlonu wa shnilo Kapanam, əzhi n Gəlili əknyi, jesnu n Sibyiwyii, wa wu aza ənya. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Əwo nyawu kwaa wo aza, ntuge əwo aɓədagbma ɓə n ikwoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu, əzaho ɓə dna ń wo ɓə n əsei, n zafnu ajegbmiyi, wa sáwyi n bəgye kalái, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Laka n ya! Ho ye knyiyi nu n əyi a, Yeisu Nazeretiyii? Ha ɓe ha zhni yi agbma nu? Mi kpe əza əye lo n wo gnyi n hoi; Gyigyiyida, Shekwoyi nya!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yeisu wa gnaknyi kwo n əwyei bmyibmyii. “La cepyi! Gbmiya n wo!” Nlonu əse nukwoi kwa she əza yi ya shi n əɓa awyeba vnyanya, jesnu kwa gbmiya to kwa tu wo əci m.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ca wo aza vnyanya, jesnu ɓa gna aje, “Knyi aɓədagbma nu nyi a? N ikwoi ɓədo n kalái woi ga azafnu ajegbmiyi əgbe jesnu ɓai kwnuya!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Jesnu əwo anabagyi kwaa lapwi n shegwnu n səpa yi vnyanya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza bəgyé kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yeisu wa fa Ayahudiyibwokwnu wa lo Sima pwuwa. N əsayii Sima yezhi nyikwozada ɓə dna n nayi-nagwnu yaakwoi, jesnu ɓa gna Yeisu nge wo bma wo zhni. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ntulonu wa ya gnyi ń wo aba, wa gnaknyi nayi-nagwnu yi jesnu kwa fa wo. Wa laka gnyi n əsagbmanyii wa ya ɓa ɓəvyi. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />N nyipyei-shniɓwai, aza ɓa ɓe Yeisu n azai vnyanya, n ɓa ɓəə n anyasnai gbowogbowo, jesnu wa kpe zahozahoyi əwo aɓwa, wa ka ɓa gna əɓa vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Gbowo n aɓo yei, ase ɓa kwnuya ń aza bəgyé ɓai ɓəwyi, “Əho nu zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu!” Ama wa gnaknyi ɓa jesnu to wa ye nge ɓa daɓo m, ntuge ɓa ɓəə kpe nge əwo nu zhni Kirisiti.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />N əfyegyizhii, Yeisu wa gbmiya lo aba pyipyipyiyi. Aza ɓa laɓa ɓai zna wo shni, jesnu she ɓa ɓə si aba n wo ɓə gnyi, ɓa zhni wo atna nge wo to fa ɓa m. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ama wa gna ge, “Ɓəshishi nu ma lo mii zhni waazi nabagyi manai Shekwoyi əbemi nya, ń azhi aje cè, ntuge a tnu n mii nce nu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Njesnu wa gwodu woi zhni waazi fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu amwutuyi kpmisnui yiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />N əwyihoi shi Yeisu ɓə gnyiagnyi gnyi n Genezareti nuwna-znudna əgbe, n deejii shegwnu wo zhi ɓai kna Shekwoyi ɓədagbma tnubwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Wa gye aya ngwnu-aba n kpe ń nuwnagbe, ń abmyawnayi n ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai zhna əɓa asa nyi, ɓəə ncei yakpe. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Wa lodna ń əya gbmanyi, ədo n kwo ɓə zhni Sima nya nyi, wa gna wo nge, wo la kwo ceta ya fyewyi ń ədnagbe kwa lo əmi ɓwa. Nlonu wa wunya n sase dna ń əya.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />She wo ɓəə kwu ɓəda zo da, wa gna Sima, “Ye lo nuwna loloi ɓwa, ha shé əsa ya fyi ha wna abmya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Sima wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi, ya kwu tnutnu zhni n əwyei bmyibmyi dna n sukwo ye vnyanya, to ya wna nyahonyahoi m. Ama shikwonyi ho kwu gna lonu, mi ɓa shé əsa ya fyi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />She ɓa ɓəə kwu zhni nlonu, ɓa wna abmya n mwa bəgyé, kwa zhni əɓa asa kwa ya kwoi gbeya. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ntulonu ɓa yi əɓa azabayi ń ɓa ɓə fyi ń əya baayi nyi, nge ɓa ɓe ɓa bma ɓa zhni, jesnu ɓa ɓe ɓa kwu aya ngwnu-aba nu n abmyai, kwa zhni aya yi ɓa ya ɓai shnì.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />She Sima Byitusu ɓə gye dəye, wa ceakwokwo shi ń Yeisu apita aba wa gna, “Dagayi, la laka n əmi aba; ntuge mi zhni əza leifyida nu!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ntuge əwo n əwo azajei, ce ɓə kwu wo ɓa, ntu abmya bəgyé ɓo n ɓa ɓəə wna nyi, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />jesnu nlonu, ca wo Sima atnutnu kwnuzhniyi, Jemyis n Yohanai Zebədi anugwnu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Nsayi Yeisu wa gna Sima, “To wodna m; ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo n abyei nyi, ho ɓa wna azanyikwoci nu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ntulonu she ɓa ɓə kwu əɓa aya gyikpe n əkpma, ɓa fa anya vnyanya ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká nayiwnu nyasnai gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yeisu woi ye dna ń əzhi ho, əzaho wa vyi wo lo, n wo ɓə n nayiwnu nyasnai n kwnukpe ń əwo nayi vnyanya. She wo ɓə gye Yeisu, wa ceakwokwo jesnu wa ɓa wo, “Dagayi, ngye ho ɓa ye, ho ɓa myi ha ga mi kágna.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yeisu wa ta əwo əɓwa ya wa to wo əɓwa. Wa gna, “Əmi ɓəye nu, gwo kágna!” Nsayisayii, nayiwnu nyasna kwa fa wo.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Nlonu, Yeisu wa tu wo əgbe, “To gna zahozahoyi m, ama lo, ho wu əhohni tukwo n Pirisiti aba jesnu ha ga anya n Mwusa ɓə tugbe, ntu n əfye pmyapmya ɓo nyi, kwaa zè ɓəgbmi ga ɓa”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Dudulonu, əwo anabagyi kwa gna lalapwi nu, kwa zhni deeji yaakwo ɓa yezhi ɓa kna əwo ɓəda tnubwa jesnu wa ká ɓa gna n əɓa anyasna. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ama, Yeisu ɓə zhni waa wyiya, ciici woi lo zhabwi woi zhniaduwa ga Shekwoyi.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu zo nayifyiyi aleifyi jesnu woi ká wo gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />N əwyihoi Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi wunya, Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii ɓə sase kpe ń ɓo. N ɓa ɓə kwnuɓe ń azhigba dəhodəhoi n Gəlili n Yahudiyai n Urishelimai. Jesnu Dagayi kalá ɓə kwnusnu ń Yeisui ntuge wa ká anyasnai gna. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Azanugbai ho ɓa ɓe ń əzai nayi-fyifyiyidai latu ń pəce, ɓa zna aba shni, ɓa lo ɓe n woi ń pwuwa yi, ɓa ya wo shi ń Yeisu abye. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />She ɓa to ɓə ɓwa zokwo ń ɓa ɓá zhni nlonu m, ntu deeji ɓo, ɓa gwnukpe ń nyakwnushe, ɓa kpe nyakwnushe ya jesnu ɓa shni wo lo ncei ń tu əwo pəce, shì ń deeji atasni jesnu ń Yeisu abye gaaga.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />She Yeisu ɓə gye əɓa gaiciyaganunui, wa gna, “Nugwnudo, a kwu əho aleifyi zo ho.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii ɓa ya ɓai zhni ɓənubwo fyi n əɓa mi, “Nyika nu gnyi ń əza yei woi da atukwopmi ɓo a? Nyika nu ɓa myi wa zo aleifyi ń Shekwoyi nu to ɓwasnu ma a?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yeisu ɓə kpe əɓo n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai zhninubwo ncei jesnu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei zhni aɓo ye nubwo fyi n əfye adu a? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Knyidei nu gna wo lo faafa: a gna, ‘A kwu əho aleifyi zo ho,’ kwo a gna, ‘Laka gnyi ha znazna a?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ama mi ncei pmalo fya kwu kpe nge Əza Nugwnu n ikwoi lo dna ń anyì wa zo aleifyi.” Ntulonu, wa gna əza ń nayi ɓə n woi fyifyiyi nyi ge, “Mi gna ho, laka gnyi, kwu əho apəce, ha lo əho pwuwa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />N əsayisayii, wa laka gnyiagnyi ń əɓa abye, wa kwu ənya ń wo ɓə yatu n kwo nyi jesnu wa lo əwo pwuwa woi ci Shekwoyi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ca wo zahozahoyi jesnu ɓa ci Shekwoyi. Ɓa kwu nu zhi n ɓəwowoi jesnu ɓa gna, “Yi kwu aɓoawowoi gyewye nnaiye.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu yi Levyi jesnu wa gyi nyagyi n aleifyizhniyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />N dəye avnu, Yeisu wa gbmiya lo əbmyi wa gye gədugwoyi, n sasetu ń agədu gwo aba, ai yi wo nge Levyi. Yeisu wa gna wo, “Vyi mi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Levyi wa laka gnyi, wa fa nyahonyahoi jesnu wa vyi wo.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Nlonu Levyi wa pa nyagyigyi agbmada yaakwo nya, ntu Yeisu ɓo, dna ń əwo pwuwa, jesnu agədu gwoyi bəgyé n azajei ɓa kwnu nyagyi gyi n ɓai. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ama Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyi n ɓa ɓəə fyi ń əɓa okwu nyi, ɓa ɓe n awyicei, ń əwo amwutuyi aba nge, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei gyi jesnu fyei sni n agədu gwoyii n aleifyidai a?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yeisu wa dna ɓa ɓəgbe, “Lafyiyada ta zna shigbeda shni m, ama nyasnayi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Mi to ɓe ma yi aɓəfyeceyi nu m, ama aleifyida, ɓa ɓe ɓa yeabwi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nya Yeisu aɓo ntu əgbewna ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Ɓa gna wo, “Yohana amwutuyii wnagbe lo ciici ɓai zhniaduwa, nlonu cè n Afarisiyii amwutuyi, ama əho anya da, ɓa laɓa lo ɓai gyi, ɓai sni.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe “Fye ɓa zhni mwulaɓa anugwnudo ɓa wnagbe əsa n wo ye kwnusnu lo n ɓai? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ama əsa ɓe lo, she a ɓə la mwulaɓa la ń əɓa ɓa, fyi ń anyipyei yi ɓa ɓə wnagbe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Wa si ɓa ɓəsisi ye: “Əzaho to lo n wo sá əje woiwoi wa gwùta n əje-kwokwoi m. N wa zhni nlonu, əje woiwoi ɓə kpé n əje kwokwoi ətagwu, jesnu əje-kwokwoi ɓə la gna sasaya. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Jesnu əzaho to lo ń wo fyi anamnuwna woiwoyi ń anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu kwokwoi m. N wa zhni nlonu, anamnuwna woiwoi ɓaa anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu kwokwoi cepwo; anamnuwna ɓə la pwuya, jesnu anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu ɓə kwu zhniagbma. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Aawo, ɓəshishi nu a fyi anamnuwna woiwoi n anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu woiwoi. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Njesnu əzaho to lo, n wo kwu anamnuwna kwokwoi sni n wo ɓa ye wa sni woiwoi m, ntuge ɓa gna ge, ‘Kwokwoi gnabmya lo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu nu zhni Dagayi Sibyiwyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />N Sibyiwyi hoi, Yeisu woi duya dnalo n alikamazhni, əwo amwutuyi ɓa ya alikama atukwo bma ɓai wu abyegye ya kpe n əɓa aɓwada, ɓai gyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Afarisiyi ho ɓa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei zhni əɓo n kwo zhni owa gnanaznu n Sibyiwyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yeisu wa dna ɓa ɓəgbe, “Fye too shni ba, ənya n Dawuda ɓə zhni əsa ń myikwnu ɓə gwnu wo n əwo anugwnudoi nyi m? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Wa lodna ń Shekwoyi pwuwa wa shni biledi pmyapmyai, wa gyi, ənya ń owa ɓə zhni kwoi ɓwa apirisiti nu ye nge ɓa gyi. Nlonu wa kwu adəho ce ga əwo anugwnudo.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Əza Nugwnu nu zhni Dagayi Sibyiwyi nya.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />N Sibyiwyi hoi jesnu, wa lodna ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, woi wunya, jesnu əzaho ɓə dna n abaayi ń əwo ɓwaizhe ɓə sháshái. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii, ɓə zna əɓo nu shni n ɓa ɓá ɓwa nabai ɓa tu Yeisu, ntulonu ɓa dna wo əwye byiwuu, nabai ɓa gye kwo wo ɓa ká wo gna n Sibyiwyii. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ama Yeisu ɓə kpe əɓo əye n ɓa zhni əkwo nubwo, wa gna əɓwa sháshaída, “Laka gnyiagnyi jesnu haa gnyi ń zahozahoyi abye.” Ntulonu wa laka gnyiagnyi jesnu waa gnyi ń abaayi.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa ge, “Mi nya fye əɓo, knyiɓei nu owa ncei ye a zhni n Sibyiwyi a: a zhni əɓo manai nu kwo a zhni əɓo nukwoi, a gnyi wyewyeyi nu kwo a wu kwo a?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Wa shi ɓa awye laɓa n shegwnu vnyanya, nlonu wa gna əza yi, “Ta əho əɓwa ya.” Wa zhni lonu jesnu əwo əɓwa kwaa tace n nunui. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ama Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii, ɓa kwu zhi n pwukpe jesnu ɓa ya ɓai daɓo n ajei ənya n ɓa ɓá zhni Yeisu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atnutnuloyi ngwnu-awoceaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Fyi n anyipyei yi, Yeisu wa gbmiya lo əpe səpa wa lo wo zhniaduwa, jesnu waa gyifye dna n aduwazhni ga Shekwoyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />She əfye ɓə gyi, wa yì əwo amwutuyi zhi ga əwohni, jesnu wa tnu ɓa zhi ngwnu-awoceaba, aza n wo ɓə je ɓa əye tu nge atnutnuloyi:<verse eid="LUK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Sima (əza n wo ɓə tu əye, Byitusu) əwodo Anduru,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Jemyis,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yohana,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Fyilibwus,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Batolomyi,<verse eid="LUK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiyu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Jemyis Alfyis nugwnu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Sima n a ɓə yi wo Ziloti nyi,<verse eid="LUK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yahuda Jemyis nugwnu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">n Yahuda Iskariyotii n əwo nu ɓə ɓwu Yeisu nyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anabəlika n owii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Wa shnilo n ɓai, ɓa kwu zhi n aba apatayi. Deeji yaakwo əwo amwutuyi ɓə zhi n ɓo jesnu aza bəgyé ɓai kwnu ń Yahudiya əknyi vnyanya, n Urishelimai, jesnu ɓai kwnu ń shikwogbe Taya nya, n Sidonii, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />aza n ɓa ɓə ɓe ntuge ɓa kna əwo ɓəda tnubwa, jesnu ɓa gwo kágna ń əɓa anyasna. Aza yii n azafnu ajegbmiyi ɓə kwu gna ɓa gnagna, aa ɓa kwnuya. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Aza vnyanya ɓaa ɓahni yi ɓa to wo əɓwa, ntuge kalá ɓə zhni kwoi kwnuɓe n wo, jesnu kwoi ga ɓa kágna vnyanya.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Wa shi əwo amwutuyi awye, wa gna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Anabəlikada nu n əfyei, ń fye zhni awyekwoyi nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ntuge Shekwoyi əbemi zhni əfye nya nu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Anabəlikada nu n əfyei ń fye wo myikwnu ń nsaiye nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ntuge a ɓə fú fye nubwo. Anabəlikada nu n əfyei ń fye ciɓwi nsaiye nyi, ntuge fye ɓə masna.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Anabəlikada nu n fyei əsa ń aza wnunu n fyei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ɓai kna fye yazhi, ɓai knyi fye akpmi, jesnu ɓai na əfye aye ɓo ngye nyanukwoi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">ntu n Əza Nugwnu ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />“Fye zhni agbmada fyi ń nyipyei yi jesnu fya dagbma ntu dada ɓo, ntuge əfye gyiba zhni yaakwo nu dna ń əshemi. Ntuge nlonu nu n əɓa azakwoyi ɓə zhni kpe sheaɓəgwognayi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Ama owii n fyei ń fye zhni anyaɓwayi nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">ntuge fye la əfye agbmada pmagwo.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Owii n əfyei ń anubwo n fyei fufui lo nsaiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ntuge myikwnu ɓə gwnu fye. Owii n əfyei n fye má-asnaɓwugyi lo nsaiye, ntuge fye ɓə ɓwa bwugbazhii jesnu fyei ciɓwi.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Owii n əfyei əsa n zahozahoyi da fye əɓo manai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ntuge ń lai nu ń əɓa azakwoyi ɓə zhni kpe sheaɓəgwognayi katái.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeye wu ga anuwnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ama əfye ń fye zhi fyei kna ɓəda tnubwa nyi, mi gna fye: Fye ye n əfye anuwnuyii, fye zhni əɓo manai ga aza yi ń ɓa wnunu n fyei nyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Fye kpe aza yi anabəlika n ɓa kpe fye aknyi nukwoi nyi, fye zhniaduwa ga aza n ɓa shé fye əwyena nyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ń zaho wa ce fye agnaipmi n səpa gbmanyi, fya pmyi səpa baayi wu wo ce. N əza wa gwo fye akwokwo, fye to wo wo əjekpe əmi nya əɓyi m. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Ga zahozahoyi ənya n wa nya ho əkwo ɓo, jesnu n zahozahoyi n wa la ho ənya, to je əkwo əɓo nya ha gwo kwo m. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Zhni ga aza aɓo n ho ncei pma aza ɓa zhni ga ho.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Ngye fye ye n aza yi nu ń ɓa ye fye nyi, knyi gyibai nu n fye ɓa ɓwa a? Kwo aleifyizhniyi ɓa ye aza yi nu ń ɓa ye ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Njesnu ń ha ɓwa əɓo manai zhni ga aza yi nu n ɓa zhni ho əɓo manai nyi, knyi gyibai nu n ho ɓa ɓwa a? Kwo aleifyizhniyi ɓa zhni nlonu. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Jesnu n ha ɓwa aza yi nu nyamwi ga ń ho əwyei tu lo ɓai gba ho əta, knyi gyibai nu n ho ɓa ɓwa a? Kwo aleifyizhniyi ɓa ga aje nyamwi n awyei tu ɓai gwo n nunui. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ama fye ye n əfye anuwnuyii, fye zhni əɓo manai ga ɓa, jesnu fye ga ɓa nyamwi ntna awyetu nge ɓa ɓə gba fye əta. Nlonu nu n əfye gyiba ɓə la mwa jesnu fyei kwu zè Duduyi aɓyi, ntuge wo zhni əɓo manai ga atna-agbmadawuyi n akpizhniyii. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Fye kwu zhni asnusnugyei, shi əfye Dada zhni snusnugyeyi nyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azaje owada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Fye to da aza owa m, a taa da əfyehni owa m. Fye to znu əza əknyi m, nlonu a taa znu əfyehni əknyi ce m. Fye zo abwi, jesnu a ɓa zo əfyehni abwi ce. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ga, n kasnu a ɓa ga fye. Nyamwinya manai, n shniada, ń nunui sululu jesnu kwoi gyiya, ń a ɓə mwu ga fye, a ɓə zè fyi fye ń əjepəlu. Ntuge nyamwinya n fya zhni apma ncei, əkwo nu n a ɓə mwu ga fye ncei.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Wa ga ɓa ɓəsisi ye: “Wyebwayi ɓa wu wyebwayi ədo zokwo? Əɓa ngwnu-aba, ɓa taa kaya fyi n ɓwokwnu m? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Nyamwutuyi to du əwo nyawuyi m, ama zahozahoyi ń a la wo ta ń nunui n nyawu, wo ɓə la zè ngye əwo nyawuyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Knyiyi nu zhni hoi gye shnuwna pisəloi n kwo dna ń əhozado əwye, ama to hoi zewye ń shnuwna kwnunù n kwo dna ń əhohni əwye ma a? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ho ɓa gna əhozado n wunanu ge, ‘Əmido, fa ma gbmi shnuwna pisəloi ya n əho əwye,’ Əsa ń əhohni ɓwugyi too gye shnuwna kwnunù n kwo dna ń əho əwye nyi ma a? Əho kwocednayi, kpmisnuyi la shnuwna kwnunu gbmiya n əhohni əwye kpa, nlonu ho ɓa gyewyeba dəidəi ha gbmi shnuwna pisəloi ya n əhozado əwye.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shnuwna n əkwo gyigyiyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Shnuwna manai dəhodəhoi to lo n kwo ga gyigyi nukwoi m, kwo shnuwna nukwoi dəhodəhoi n kwo ga gyigyi manai m. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />A kpé shnuwna dəhodəhoi əye n əkwo gyigyi nu. A ta ka əgbà ń knawui m, kwo anam gyigyi ń lagbaí m. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Əza manai zhni wa kwnu anya amanai ɓe ncei ń anya manai nu n wo ncei sofyi ń əwo ədu, n kasnu əza nukwoi zhni wa kwnu anya nukwoi ɓe ncei ń anya anukwoi nu ń wo ncei sofyi ń əwo ədu nyi. Ntuge əgbe da ənya nu n kwo nu fyilo n ədu.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyamiyi acecei n amamai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Knyiyi nu zhni fyei yi mi, ‘Dagayi, Dagayi,’ ama to fyei zhni əɓo n mi gna fye nyi ma a? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Zahozahoyi ń wo ɓe da mi, woi wo əmi aɓədagbma jesnu woi zhni apma n ɓai, mi ɓa wu fye shi ɓa wulo. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ɓa wulo ngye əza nu ń wo gnyi woi mi nyakwnu, ń wo ɓə la əkwo shnipa nyì n loloi, jesnu wa shì nyakwnu tu ń apma. She nuwna ɓeɓei ɓə kwnu-akpma n anuwnadokwoi, kwa sheknyi nyakwnu yi, ama to kwa jeashna m, ntuge kwo ɓə la bmya mi. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ama əza ń wo wo əmi aɓədagbma lo to woi shi ɓa ɓwa m, wo wulo ngye əza nu ń wo ɓə mi nyakwnu tu ń əknyi ntna shnipa shii. Əsa ń nuwna-adokwo ɓə sheknyi nyakwnu yi, kwaa vyiya jesnu əkwo agbmazhni ɓə nyi kpeekpe nu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bəzhetagyida gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />She Yeisu ɓə la pwo aɓo ye da ɓo vnyanya ga aza n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai knatnubwa nyi, wa lodna ń Kapanam. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />N abaayi, bəzhetagyida tnutnuyi, əza ń əwo dagayi ɓə n əwo apmai dəidəi, wo ɓə shi n nyasnai, n shi n əfyi əgbe. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Bəzhetagyida, wa wo Yeisu əɓo, wa tnu n Ayahudiyi abyedai n əwo aba, ɓa gyiwye nge wo ɓe wa ká əwo tnutnuyi gna. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />She ɓa ɓə si Yeisu aba, ɓa ɓa wo n əwyei bmyibmyii, “Əza ye n kwnuce lo ha zhni wo əɓo ye, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />ntuge wo ye lo n əyi əknyii jesnu wo lá Ayahudiyibwokwnu mi yi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ntulonu, Yeisu wa kwnulo n ɓai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Wo to ɓə ye mwakpa n pwuwa yii m, bəzhetagyida wa tnu n əwo anugwnudoi ɓa lo ɓə gna wo: “Dagayi, to gna əhohni gnagna m, ntuge mi to kwnuce lo ha ɓe əmi pwuwa m. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Cenu naa zhni to mi nyi gye əmihni kwnuce ma ɓe da ho m. Ama da ɓədagbma, jesnu əmi tnutnuyi ɓa ɓwa kágna. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ntuge əmi n mihni, mi zhni ikwoda nu, n akwnuyii fyi n əmi akwnu. Mi gna əza ye, ‘Lo,’ wa lo; əza yi, ‘Ɓe,’ wa ɓe. Mi gna əmi tnutnuyi, ‘Zhni ɓəye,’ wa zhni kwo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />She Yeisu ɓə wo əɓo ye, ca wo wo, jesnu wa pmyiawye shi bəgyé n kwo ɓə ɓe kwoi vyi wo nyi, wa gna, “Əmi nu gna fye, mi too ɓwa gaiciyaganunui yaakwo ye pya kwo dna ń Israila m.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Nlonu aza ń a ɓə tnu ɓa tnutnu nyi, ɓa jezelo apyi ɓa gye tnutnuyi wo la kágna ɓwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu lá nyigbayi nugwnu kala n əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ń əkwo avnu, əsa fyewyi, Yeisu wa lo əzhi ń a yi kwo nge Nenyi nyi, əwo amwutuyi ɓədo n deeji yaakwoi ɓa kwnulo n woi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Shi wo ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n əzhi yi adubai, a ɓə gnyi ai gbmiya lo n zafyii nu; əɓyinugbai, əwo əya ɓyigba, jesnu əwo əya ɓə zhni nyigbai nu. Deeji yaakwo ɓai kwnu ɓe n əzhi yi n kwnusnu n woi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />She Dagayi ɓə gye wo, əwo snusnu kwa wna wo, jesnu wa gna wo ge, “To ciɓwi m.”<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Nlonu wa yegwu, wa to zafyi acakpa ɓwa, ń ɓa ɓə n woi tu nyi; jesnu əwo ashiyi ɓa kwu kpezhi pyi. Wa gna ge, “Əɓyikasa, mi gna ho, laka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Zafyi yi wa laka tu ń ase, wa ya ɓəda da, jesnu Yeisu waa wo ga əwo əya.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa kwu nu zhi n ɓəwowoi jesnu ɓa ci Shekwoyi. Ɓa gna, “Sheɓəgwognayi yaakwo ń la kpeyaɓe dna ń əyi atasni. Shekwoyi wo la ɓe wa bma əwo aza zhni.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Yeisu nabagyi ye, kwaa lapwi fyi ń Yahudiya n azhii ń ɓa shegwnu kwo nyi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu n Yohana batizimazhniyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Yohana amwutuyi ɓa kwu aɓo ye gna wo vnyanya. She wo ɓə yi əɓa ngwnu-aba, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />wa tnu ɓa tnutnu lo ncei n Dagayi aba, ɓəə nya wo əɓo, “Əho nu zhni əza n wo ɓəlo nyi, kwo yi tuwye n əzado nu gbowo a?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />She ɓa ɓə ɓe Yeisu aba ɓa gna, “Yohana Batizimazhniyi nu naa tnu ń yii ya nya ho əɓo, ‘Əho nu zhni əza n wo ɓe lo nyi, kwo yi tuwye n əzado nu gbowo a?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Dna ń əsayi, Yeisu wa ká bəgyé gna ń ɓa ɓə n agwnumai, n anyasnai ɓədo n azafnu nukwoi, jesnu waa awyebwayi bəgyé kágna n əɓa awyebwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ntulonu wa dna atnutnuyi ɓəgbe, “Fye jezelo fye gna Yohana aɓo ń fye kwu gyewye jesnu n fye kwu wo: Awyebwayi ɓai gyewyeba, azabmazhi ɓai znazna, anayiwnuyi ɓai ɓwa kágna, atnubwagwunayi ɓai wo atnubwaɓo, ai kwu azafyí kala, jesnu ai da nabagyi manai ga asnayi. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Anabəlikada nu n zahozahoyii ń wo to cebwonyi ntu əmi ɓo m.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Əsa ń Yohana atnutnuyi ɓəi kwuka, Yeisu wa ya ɓəda n deejii ntu Yohana ɓo: “Fye ɓə lo zhabwikawu fye gye knyiyi nu a? Anuwnaje nu ń əse pmyi ɓa laɓa nyi? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ngye nlonu to m, fye ɓə kwnuya lo fyei gye knyiyi nu a? Əza nu n aje amanai kpe? Aawo, aza yi ń ɓa kpe aje anakwoi jesnu ɓai ye agbmada nyi, ɓa fyilo ń agalukwo nu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ama knyiyi nu n fye ɓə kwnuya lo fyee gyewye a? Sheɓəgwognayi nu? Əə, əmi nu gna fye, jesnu n du sheɓəgwognayi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Əza nu nyi ń aa n ənyai kafyilo tu ń əwo tukwo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“ ‘Mi ɓə tnú n əmi tnutnudayii, woi la gyilo ń əho abye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">əwo nu ɓə zhni əho zokwo hoi ɓe ɓo.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Mi gna fye, fyi ń aza yi ń anyikwoza ɓə ma nyi, əzaho to lo n du Yohana ń əɓa mi m; dudulonu, əza ń əwo nu gnagbagbai lo dna ń Shekwoyi əbemi wo du wo lo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Aza vnyanya, kwó du n agədu gwoyii, shi ɓa ɓə wo Yeisu ɓədagbma, ɓaa kwo gwo nge Shekwoyi zokwo nu zhni manai, ntuge Yohana nu ɓə zhni ɓa batizima. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ama Afarisiyi ń owa aɓəyekpeyii, ɓaa Shekwoyi ɓəmwi aɓəna, ntu əɓahni ɓo, ntuge Yohana nu to ɓə zhni ɓa batizima m.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yeisu wa gwodu wa gna, “To, mi ɓa mwi cala ye do n knyiyi nu a? Ɓa wulo n wunanu a? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ɓa wulo ngye aɓyi nu ń ɓa sase kpe ń adubayaakwo ɓai yi aje:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">“ ‘Yi kwu mwayí bye ga fye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">to fya nyanya m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">ya kwo aka-anyí,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">to fya zhni bwugbazhii m.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ntuge Yohana batizimazhniyi ɓə ɓe to woi gyi nyagyi kwo woi sni anamnuwna m, fya gna, ‘Wo n asei lo.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe woi gyi, woi sni, fya gna ge, ‘Fnanada nu gnyi ń ya, ɓədo n nyasniyii, agədu gwoyi nugwnudo n aleifyizhniyii.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ama a kpe wyemwa bmyabmya əye n əkwo aɓyi nu vnyanya.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyikwoza leifyizhniyi pmya Yeisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />She zaknayi ń Afarisiyi ɓə yi Yeisu wyeshenyagyi gyi, wa lo Farisiyii pwuwa, waa sasetu n myima n tebwul. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Nyikwoza ho ń əzhi yi, ń wo ɓəə kwu anyìgyi dna n leifyizhni, ɓə kwu kpe ge Yeisu dnalo woi gyi nyagyi ń Farisiyi pwuwa, ntulonu wa ɓe abaayi n alabasta lúulúu ɓyiyi əmisnidaí shi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Shi wo ɓə gnyi ń əwo avnu ń əwo apita aba woi ciɓwi, she wo ɓə ya, wa kwu Yeisu apitabwada bwudo n əwo awyenyii. Nlonu wa wnu ɓa ya n əwo tukwoyii, wa to Yeisu apitabwada n əwo əgbei, jesnu wa zè əmisnidaí kpe n ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />She Farisiyi ń wo ɓə yi wo nyagyi gyi nyi ɓə gye dəye, wa da fyi ń əwo əmi, “Ngye əza ye ɓə gna wo zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu, wo ɓə ɓa kwu əza kpeye n wo to wo əɓwa nyi, jesnu nyikwoza pya n wo zhni; nge wo zhni leifyizhniyi nu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yeisu wa dna wo ɓəgbe, “Sima, mi n ɓəhoi lo ma gna ho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Wa gna, “Nyawuyi, gna mi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Aza ngwnu-aba ɓə n ətai shi gyiwyemwigayi ho. Zaknayi ɓəi n ətai shi wo denari tagyi ngwnu-atnu, əzabaayi, shiitnu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Əzaho to ɓə nyì n ɓa, n wo ɓə ɓa shni əwo əta yi gba m, ntulonu gyiwyemwigayi wa kwu gyiwye yi fa ga ɓa. Nsaiye nyika nu ń əɓa ngwnu-aba, n wo ɓa gna wo ye a?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Sima wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi zhninubwo nge, əza n a fa gyiwye ga wo n du nyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yeisu wa gna wo, “Ho la ɓəda znuya dəidəi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Nlonu wa pmyiawye shi nyikwoza yi wa gna Sima, “Ho kwu nyikwoza ye gyewye? Ma lo ɓe əho pwuwa. Ho to ga mi nuwna ntu n əmi apita ɓo m, ama wo kwu əmi apitabwada bwudo n əwo awyenyii, jesnu wo nyi wnu ɓa ya n əwo tukwoyii. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ho to shepma mi, yeye nya m, ama nyikwoza ye, she ma lodna ń ya, wo too fa əmi apitabwada əgbe to ɓo m. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ho to kpe mi tukwo omi m, ama wo kwu əmisnidaí kpe n əmi apitabwada. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ntucenu, mi gna ho nu ge, a kwu əwo aleifyi bəgyé zo wo; ntu əwo yeye yaakwo wu ɓo. Ama əza ń a zo wo aleifyi fyewyi, wo wu yeye fyewyi nu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna nyikwoza yi ge, “A kwu əho aleifyi zo ho.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Azhiɓeyi aje ɓa ya ɓai daɓo n ajei ɓahniɓahni, “Nyika nu gnyi ń əza yei ya, woi myi woi zo əza aleifyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yeisu wa gna nyikwoza yi, “Əho gaiciyaganunui kwo la ho gnyiya, lo n bwugbafui.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyabyeyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ń dəye avnu, Yeisu wa zna laɓa woi gbmi ń zhimi gbmanyi n zhigbai, woi lo aje, woi zhni waazi nabagyi manai Shekwoyi əbemi nya. Atnutnuloyi Awoceaba ɓə kwnusnu n woi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />ɓədo n anyikwoza hoi ń Yeisu ɓə kwnu ɓa azafnu nukwoi ya nyi, ɓədo n anyasnai: Mariyamwu (ń a ɓə yi wo ge Magadalayi nyi) əza ń azafnu nukwoi ngwnu-tnaaba ɓə kwnuya n wo; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Jowana, Kwuza nyikwo, Hiridusu pwuwa aknawnayi; Suzana; ɓədo n azajei bəgyé. Anyikwoza ye ɓə laɓa ɓai ceɓwa jesnu ɓai bmazhni n ənyai ń kwo ɓə kwnu ń əɓa ajegwu.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Deeji yaakwo ye gnyi kwoi yezhi jesnu aza ɓai ɓe da Yeisu, ɓai kwnu ń azhi gbowogbowo, wa ga ɓa ɓəsisi ye: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Fwanuyi ho ɓə gbmiya lo wo bye əwo nyabye, adəho ɓa kaya zhi lo ncei ń zokwoi; a kpe kwo apita, jesnu alú ɓaa ɓa zo tnu. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Adəho ɓa kaya kpe ń apmatala, shi ɓa ɓə pa, ɓa kwu woakawu ntuge ɓa to ɓə n wyetoi m. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Nyabye dəho kwa kaya fyi ń aknawui, aknawuyi ɓa mwa ɓaa kwo gyice. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Dudulonu nyabye dəho kwa kaya fyi ń əknyi manai. Kwa mwa jesnu kwa fyiawye, n du ənya ń a ɓə bye, aɓwa tagyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">She wo ɓə kwu dəye da nlonu, wa la bəgye tu wa gna, “Zahozahoyi ń wo n atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Əwo amwutuyi ɓa nya wo nabagyi ɓəsisi ye awyega. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Wa gna ge, “Ɓəyekpe aɓo aɓwuɓwui Shekwoyi əbemi nya, a kwu ga fye; ama n azaje aba, mi daɓo n ɓai n nabagyi ɓəsisii nu, ntuge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“ ‘Kwo shikwonyi ɓa shiawye lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">ama ɓa taa gyewye lo m;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">kwo shikwonyi ɓa knatnubwa lo, ɓa taa ɓwa əkwo awyega m.’<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Dəye nu zhni ɓəsisi ye awyega: Nyabye nu zhni Shekwoyi ɓədagbma. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ado ń ɓa ɓə kaya zhi n zokwo nyi, aza nu ń ɓa wo Shekwoyi ɓəda, jesnu əzanukwoyi wa ɓe waa ɓədagbma kwnu ɓa ń əɓa adu, nabai n ɓa taa ga gaiciya ɓa pwo m. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Adəyi ń ɓa ɓə kpe ń apmatala nyi, əɓa nu zhni aza ń ɓa ɓə gwo ɓədagbma n agbmadai she ń ɓa ɓə wo, ama ɓa to ɓə n gbegyei m. Ɓa kwu gaiciyaga əsa fyewyi, ama shi mwumwu ɓe, ɓa myiya. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Nyabye ń kwo ɓə kaya fyi ń aknawui nyi, əkwo nu wu aza yi ń ɓa ɓə wo, ama əsa ń ɓa fyilo ɓai gyianyì, aɓəsa anyìgyi nya, nyaɓwa ɓədo n agbmada-yei ɓaa ɓa gyice jesnu to ɓa kwó m. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ama nyabye fyi ń əknyi manai əkwo nu wu aza yi ń ɓa fyi ń ofye jesnu n ədu manai, n ɓa wo ɓədagbma ɓaa kwo shiɓwa, jesnu ntu n bwugbaɓwa ɓo, ɓa ga gyigyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyitila tu n əkwo kwnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Əzaho to lo n wo wna pyitila əná waa kwo sodna ń nyikwnu kwo dna ń gədo snuta m. Ama a ya kwo tu ń əkwo kwnuyi nu, nabai aza ń ɓa lo ɓe nyakwnu nyi, ɓa gye bwuznagna. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ntuge nyaho to ɓwushi lo ń a to ɓə gbmi kwo wu m, jesnu nyaho to pwuanya shi lo, ń a to ɓə gye kwo əwye m, kwo n a to ɓə kpeanyaya wu m. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ntucenu fye zhni ɓənubwo pəceye she fye kna aɓo tnubwa n wu. Əza ń wo ncei lo, a ɓə la ɓə wo; zahozahoyi ń wo to ncei lo m, kwo ədo n wo zhninubwo nge wo ncei lo nyi, a ɓə la gwo wo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu əya n əwo amajeii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nsayii, Yeisu əya ɓədo ń əwo amajeii ɓa ɓe nge ɓa gye wo, ama to ɓa myi ɓa wo vyivyiwyi n woi m, ntu deeji ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Əzaho wa gna wo, “Əho əya n əho amajei ɓa zhi lo ń əbmyi, ɓa ncei pmalo ɓa gye ho əwye.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əmi əya ɓədo n əmi amajei nu nyi, ń aza yii ń ɓa wo Shekwoyi ɓədagbma jesnu ɓai shi kwo ɓwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu la agbmaase nazhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />N əwyihoi Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Yii piyalo nuwna-znudna əkpma dəyi.” Ntulonu ɓa lofyi n əya nuwnanya ɓa lo. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Shi ɓa ɓə fyilo ncei ń əya nuwnanya, waa wnagye. Əse kaláda kwa ɓe kpe n nuwna-znudna, əya nuwnanya kwa tu lo kwoi snúawyé n nuwnai; ɓa ɓə fyilo ń azhnìgye yaakwo nu.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Amwutuyi ɓa lo ɓa kwnu wo agyewyiya ɓa gna, “Dagayi, Dagayi, yi ye ya ɓwunuwna nuu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Wa laka wa gnaknyi əse n nuwna nyaceii; ase ɓa wnazhi, aɓo vnyanya ɓa kwu nazhi. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Wa nya əwo amwutuyi, “Əfye gaiciyaganunui gnyi ń nanu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Dna ń ədnawo n ɓəwowoi, ɓa nya aje, “Nyika nu gnyi əwoi a? Kwo ase n nuwnai ɓa vyi əwo ɓəgbetu lo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga əza n ase nyasnayi kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ɓa piyalo Ageraseniyi səpa, ń kwo kpe gaaga n əkpma dəyii, hoi gbmi ń Gəlili nuwna-znudna əkpma nyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />She Yeisu ɓə gbmitu n shikwogbe, əza n ase nyasnayi wa shegwnu wo, woi gbmi n zhimi. Əsa ɓəə la mwa to woi je aje kpe kwo wa dna ń apyi m, ama wo ɓe dna laɓa ń avnyigwo nu. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />She wo ɓə gye Yeisu, wa sakwu, wa myiya shi ń Yeisu apita aba, woi ɓəwyi n bəgye kalái, “Ho ye knyiɓei nu n mii a, Yeisu, Shekwoyi Duduyi Nugwnu? Mi gyi ho əwye, to tu mi azhnì m!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ntuge Yeisu ɓə la əgbe ga əse yi nge kwo la gbmiya n wo. Kwo ɓə zhni kwa la wo kala n asai mwa bəgyé, kwo ń a ɓə n woi pa shi n agbmai nu n aɓwa n apitai, woi shi ai gwu wo, wo ɓə zhni waa agbma gbeya n əwo nayi, ase kwa lo n woi ń aba pyipyipyii.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yeisu wa nya wo əɓo, “A yi əho əye nge nanu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Wa gna, “Bəgyé,” ntuge ase bəgyé ɓəə kwu lofyi ń wo. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Nlonu ɓa ɓa Yeisu ɓai je ɓa, nge wo to tnu n ɓai ń əɓwo-tnaceshiba m.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Abwulutu gəluce yaakwo ɓə lo ɓai gyi anyagyi ma ń əpe gnagna. Ase ɓa ɓa Yeisu ge wo fa ɓa lofyi ń abwulutu, jesnu waa ye ge ɓa lofyi. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />She ase ɓə kwnu ń əza yi, ɓa lofyi ń abwulutu gəluce, ɓa bwusi shnilo n agəgyigəgyi, ɓa kaya fyi ń nuwna-znudna, ɓa kwu ɓwunuwna.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />She abwulutu knayi ɓə gye əɓo n kwo kwu zhni nyi, ɓa bwusi ɓa lo ɓa wu anabagyi ń əzhimi ɓədo n azhigbai, <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />jesnu aza ɓa kwnuɓe ɓa gye əɓo ń kwo ɓə kwu zhni nyi. She ɓa ɓə ɓe Yeisu aba, ɓa gye əza yi shi ń ase ɓə kwnu n wo nyi, n sase shi ń Yeisu apita aba, n ajei kpe jesnu n dna ń əwohni ací; ədna kwa wo ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Aza yi ń ɓa ɓə kwu əɓo ye gyewye nyi, ɓa gna aza shi əza n ase ɓə fyi n wo ɓə ɓwa kágna n wu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ntulonu, aza vnyanya n Geraseni səpa ɓa gna Yeisu nge wo la əɓa əknyi fa, ntuge ədna ɓə kwu wo ɓa. Wa lodna n əya nuwnanya wa lo wo nya.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Əza ń a ɓə kwnu wo ase ya nyi, wa ɓa nabai wa kwnulo n woi, ama Yeisu wa je wo zeya wa gna ge, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Jezelo apyi, hoi da əɓo n Shekwoyi kwu zhni ga ho nsnu.” Ntulonu əza yi wa lo wa da ń azhimi vnyanya əɓo ń Yeisu ɓə kwu zhni ga wo nsnu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu lá əɓyinyikwoi kala n əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Nsayii she Yeisu ɓə jezeɓe, deeji ɓa zhni wo amaabe, ntuge əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓə zhi n əwo awyetui.<verse eid="LUK 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Nlonu əzaho ai yi wo ge Yarus Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda, wa ɓe wa taya shi ń Yeisu apitabwada aba, woi gyi wo əwye nge wo ɓe əwo pwuwa, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ntuge əwo nyigwnu ɓyigba, ɓyinyikwoyi woi n ayei awoceaba, ɓə shi woi fyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Shi Yeisu ɓə lo ń zokwo, ca ce cewyi deeji ye kwa ye wo fnya. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Njesnu, nyikwoza ho ɓə gnyi ń abaayi ń amizheya nyasnai, woi kwu aye ɓwa ngwnu-awoceaba, ama əzaho to ɓəə myi ń əwo kágna m. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Wa ɓe gnyi ń Yeisu avnu, wa to əwo əjegbe əɓwa, nsayisayii əwo amizheya ɓa zna.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Nyika nu na to mi əɓwa a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">She ɓa ɓə la aɓo na əɓa vnyanya, Byitusu wa gna, “Dagayi, deeji n mwalo ɓai ye ho fnya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ama Yeisu wa gna, “Əzaho n la mi toɓwa; mi kpəlo nge kalá la gbmiya n mi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Nlonu nyikwoza yi, woi gye wo ta myi wa so əwohni to a kpe m, wa gbmiɓe woi vnyi, wa ceakwokwo shi n əwo apitabwada aba. Gnyi ń aza vnyanya abye, wa da ənya ń kwa zhni wo waa to wo əɓwa jesnu ngye shi wa ɓwa kágna nsayisayii.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Nlonu wa gna wo, “Nyigwnu, əho gaiciyaganunui kwo la ho kágna, lo n bwugbafui.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yeisu woi ye gnyi woi daɓo, əzaho wa ɓe woi gbmi ń Yarus pwuwa, Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda. Wa gna, “Əho nyigwnu wo la fyí. To shna nyawuyi gnagna m.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Shi Yeisu ɓə wo ɓəye, wa gna Yarus, “To wodna m, la gaiciya nu ɓwa ga, wo ɓa ɓwa kágna.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Shi wo ɓə si Yarus pwuwa, to wa ye nge zahozahoyi wo lodna ń kwnusnu n woi m akpəge Byitusu, Yohana n Jemyisii, ń əɓyi dadai ɓədo n əyai. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />N əsayii, aza vnyanya ɓə zhi ɓai ciɓwi nu jesnu ɓai zhni bwugbazhiizhii ntu əwo ɓo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:52">Yeisu wa gna, “Fye kwu fa ɓwuci ɓo, wo too fyi m, ama wo wnagye nu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ba ma wo asna, ntuge ɓa ɓə kpe ge wo la fyí.<verse eid="LUK 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ama wa taɓwashi wo ń əɓwa wa gna, “Əmi əɓyi, laka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Əwo zafnu kwa jezeɓe da wo, n əsagbmanyii wa laka gnyiagnyi. Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa ge ɓa ga wo nyaho wa gyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ca wo əwo azamayi, ama wa tugbe nge, ɓa to gna zahozahoyi əɓo n kwo kwu zhni nyi m.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu tnú Awoceaba yi tnutnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />She Yeisu ɓəə la ngwnu-awoceaba yi yìzhi ń aba gbmanyi, wa ga ɓa kalá n ikwoi ɓa kwnu ase ya vnyanya jesnu anyasnai ɓa gwo kágna, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />wa tnú ɓa tnutnu ɓa lo ɓə zhni waazi Shekwoyi əbemi nya jesnu ɓai ka anyasnayi gna. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Wa gna ɓa, “Fye to la nyahonyahoi ntu əzna ɓo m. Fye to la bwusi kwo gwnuma kwo biledi kwo gyiwye kwo əje baayi m. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Pwuwa dəhodəhoi n fya lofyi, fye kwu fyi n ɓo nya əsa n fye ɓə kwnu ń əzhi yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ngye aza to gwo fye m, fya fa əzhi yi, fya lu aɓwutukwnu ya ń əfye apitabwada, kwaa zè ɓəgbmi tu n əɓa tukwo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ntulonu ɓa kwnuya lo ɓa vyi azhigba gbmanyigbmanyi, ɓai da nabagyi manai jesnu azai gwo kágna ń ɓwahoɓwahoi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Nsayii, Hiridusu begyiyi wa kwu aɓo wo vnyanya n ɓa ɓə gnyi ɓai zhni nyi. Ca wó wo ntuge azaho ɓə laɓa ɓai da nge a ɓəə la Yohana laka ń əfyi, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />azaje ɓa gna Iliya nu n la kpeyaɓe, dudulonu, azaje nge sheɓəgwognayi sapa nya ho nu n wo la je gbmiɓe ń wyewyeyii. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ama Hiridusu wa gna, “Mi ɓə la Yohana kpé tukwo. To nyika nu zhni aɓo ye ń mi wo əɓa ɓo nyi a?” Njesnu wa yì əwohni nabai wa gye wo əwye.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza dugwu-atnu nyagyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />She atnutnuyi ɓə jezezhi, ɓa wu Yeisu aɓo n ɓa ɓə kwu zhni nyi. Nlonu wa kwu ɓa ɓà wyiya lo kwnusnu n woi, ɓa lo əzhimi ho ɓahniɓahni, ai yi kwo ge Betsaida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />ama she deeji ɓə wo ce, ɓa vyi wo. Waa ɓa gwo, wa daɓo n ɓai ntu Shekwoyi əbemi ɓo, jesnu wa ká aza yi gna n ɓa ɓə ye kágna.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />N wyesheɓwai, awoceaba yi ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa gna, “Kwu deeji ye gnami nabai ɓa lo azhigba n ɓa shegwnu laɓa nyi ɓədo n azhigbai, ɓə zna nyagyi shni n agyewnabai, ntuge yi zhi n zhabwi nu n ya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye ga ɓa nyaho ɓa gyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi n biledi aknanai shilo n ɓwasnu ngwnu-atnu nu n abmyai ngwnu-aba; akpəge ń yi ɓa lo yii si nyagyi ga deeji ye nu vnyanya.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Azanugbai ɓə nyi ngye dugwu-atnu nu.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Ama wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Fye gna ɓa ɓà kwu sase zhi ń akwui, ngye shiitnu, shiitnu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Əwo amwutuyi ɓa kwu zhni nlonu, jesnu zahozahoyi waa sase. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Shi wo ɓə gwo biledi aknana ngwnu-atnu n abmya ngwnu-aba yii, wa kpe awye wu n əshe, wa sa Shekwoyi ami jesnu wa sa ɓa ya. Nlonu wa ga əwo amwutuyi ɓa, nabai ɓa gnaya ga aza. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa gyi jesnu nubwo kwa kwu ɓa fwu, amwutuyi ɓa kwu awyiwoi n ɓa ɓə ce nyí ɓa kwu nu acekwnu ngwnu-awoceaba.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu gbmiɓo ge Yeisu zhni Masifu nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />N əwyihoi she Yeisu ɓə pmyiyagnyi woi zhniaduwa jesnu əwo amwutuyi ɓə kwnusnu n woi, wa nya ɓa ɓo, “Deeji gna lo ge mi zhni nyika nu a?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Azaho gna Yohana Batizimazhniyi nu, azaje gna nge Iliya; dudulonu azaje, nge sheɓəgwognayi kwokwoi ho nu n wo la jezeɓe n wyewyeyii.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Wa nyaɓo, “Ama əfye ma a, fye gna ge mi zhni nyika nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kirisiti, Shekwoyi nya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu pma əwo əfyi ɓo da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yeisu wa kwnù ɓa ń əwyei bmyibmyiyi ge ɓa to gna zahozahoyi ɓəye m. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Nlonu wa gna, “Ɓəshishi nu Əza Nugwnu wa gyeazhnì aɓo bəgyé nya jesnu abyeda, apirisiti atukwoda ɓədo n owa anyawuyii, ɓa ɓə la əwo aɓo na. Njesnu ɓəshishi nu ai la wo wu, ama n nyipyei tayii ai la wo laka gnyi n wyewyeyii.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa əɓa vnyanya, “Zahozahoyi ń wo ncei pmalo waa zhni əmi mwutuyi, ɓəshishi nu waa əwohni aɓəna, jesnu wa la əwo znudu fyegyifyegyi, wa vyi mi. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ntuge əza n wo ncei pmalo wa gnyi əwohni wyewyeyi, wo ɓə ɓwu kwo nuwna, ama əza n wo ɓa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna ntu əmi ɓo, wo ɓə gnyi kwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Kwo n apmai lo n wunanu, n əza ɓa ɓwa anyì vnyanya, ama wa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna a? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Əzadəhodəhoyi ń wo ɓa wó mi vnyinkwo ɓədo ń əmi aɓədagbmai, Əza Nugwnu ɓə wo əwohni vnyinkwo she wo ɓə jezeɓe dna n əwo latu n Dada latui n amaləka agyigyiyii nyai.<verse eid="LUK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />“Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, azaho gnyiagnyi zhilo ń ya n ɓa taa to əfyi wo m, akpəge ɓa kwu Shekwoyi əbemi gyewye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu bmaznuznu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ń anyipyei nyimwanyimwa avnu shi Yeisu ɓə da aɓo ye, wa kwu Byitusu, Yohana n Jemyis yi n kwnusnu n woi, ɓa gwnukpe n əpe ɓa lo ɓə zhniaduwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Shi wo ɓə dna n aduwazhni, əwo awyeba ɓaa znubma, əwo aje ɓai shenaya ngye əgbmanabmya. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Aza ngwnu-aba, Mwusa n Iliyai, ɓa kpmiyazhi n bmyabmya latu nyai kpe, ɓai daɓo n Yeisui. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Ɓa da əwo kala la ɓo n anyì, ədo n wo ɓə ye wa nu kwo dna n Urishelima nyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Byitusu n əwo anugwnudoi ɓə zhi n agyeawyei n lului, ama əsa ń əgye ɓə la ɓa kpma vnyanya, ɓa gye əwo latu əwye n azai ngwnu-aba n ɓa ɓə kwnu agnyignyi zhi ń woi nyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Shi aza yi ɓə zhi ɓai kwukala n Yeisu aba, Byitusu wa gna wo, “Dagayi, kwo bmyalo ya kwu kpe n ya. Fa ya kpe alubwi ngwnu-ata; gbmanyi əho nya, gbmanyi Mwusa nya jesnu gbmanyi Iliya nya.” (Wo to ɓə kpe əɓo əye n wo ɓə gnyi woi da m.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Woi ye gnyi woi daɓo, ənyì kwa kpeya ɓe kwa kwu pwu ɓa, jesnu ədna kwa wo ɓa, shi ɓa ɓə lofyi n ənyì. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Bəgye kwa gbmiɓe n ənyì kwoi gna, “Əza ye nu zhni əmi Nugwnu, əza ń mi la knyí; fye kna wo tnubwa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />She bəgye ɓə kwu əɓo da, ɓa gye Yeisu n cegnyi əwo gbmanyi nu. Amwutuyi ɓa kwu ɓəye shi ɓahni jesnu to ɓa da zahozahoyi dna n sayi, əɓo n ɓa ɓəə kwu gyewye nyi m.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká əɓyinugbai gna n ase nyasna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ń fyegyizhii, she ɓa ɓə kazhi ɓe n əpe, deeji yaakwo kwa shegwnu wo. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Əzaho dna n deeji wa sáwyi, “Nyawuyi, mi gyi ho əwye, shi əmi nugwnu awye, ntuge əwo nu ɓwa əmi ɓyigba zhni. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Ase wna wo, wa fyiakwu n əsagbmanyii; kwa lo wo dna n kpəkpə, wa pwuafugya. Kwo ta ya wo əɓwa n pye m, jesnu kwo zhni wo agbma lo. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mi kwu əho amwutuyi tnaɓwa nge ɓa gbmi kwo ya, ama ɓa to myi ń əkwo gbmiya m.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əfye cala tnagaiciyaga n aɓoajegbmi nyai, mi ɓa kwnusnu n fyei əsa ngwnu aknyiyi nu a, jesnu mii ɓwa bwugba n fyei a? Ɓe mi n əho nugwnui n ya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Kwo əsa n əɓyi yi ɓə gnyi woi ɓe Yeisu aba, ase ɓa shewoya shi n əknyi, dna n kpəkpə. Ama Yeisu wa gnaknyi ase, wa ka əɓyi yi gna jesnu waa wo ga əwo dada. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ca wo ɓa əɓa vnyanya, ntu ikwo yaakwo Shekwoyi nya ɓo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yeisu pma əwo əfyi əɓo da əɓwa baayi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Shi əzahozahoyi ɓə ye gnyi n ɓəwowoi ntu aɓo vnyanya ɓo n Yeisu ɓə kwu zhni nyi, wa gna əwo amwutuyi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Fye kwu Atnubwakna cewo n əɓo n mi ye ma gna fye nyi: A ɓə la Əza Nugwnu ga dna n aza akwnu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ama to ɓa ɓwa awyega əɓo nya n wo ɓə zhninubwo ncei nyi m. A ɓə n kwoi ɓwu ɓa ɓwuɓwuyi, to ɓa myi ɓa wna əɓo ho tukwo shi m, ntuge ədna ɓə wo ɓa n ɓa ɓá nya wo əɓo yi nyi.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Aɓənakpeaje ɓa laka dna n amwutuyi atasni nge kwo nyika nu n ɓa, ɓə la zhni əza duduyi a. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yeisu woi kpe əɓa aɓonubwozhni ye, wa la əɓyi nawyi wa wo gnyiagnyi ma əwohni. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa, “Əzadəhodəhoyi n wa gwo əɓyi nawyii ye dna n əmi əye, wo la mi gwo; jesnu əzadəhodəhoyi n wa gwo mi, wo la əza gwo n wo ɓə tnu ń mii nyi. Ntuge əza ń wo nu gnagbagbai lo n əfye vnyanya mi; əwo nu zhni duduyi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana wa gna, “Dagayi, yi kwu gye əzaho woi kwnu ase ya dna n əho əye, ya ye ya kpma wo, ntuge wo to kwnusnu lo n yii m.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yeisu wa gna, “Fye to kpma wo m, ntuge əzadəhodəhoyi n wo ta gnyiapaapa lo n əfyei m, wo kwnusnu lo n əfyei.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaapagnyi Asamariyayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Shi əsa ɓə la wo vyivyiwyi ń a ɓa la wo lo ncei n əshemi, Yeisu wa dna bwugba ntna doshna wa lo Urishelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Wa tnu atnutnudayi ɓa kwu gyiabye, ɓa lo ɓa lofyi ń Asamariyayi azhigba, ɓəə kwu aɓo wnaknazhi ga wo; <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ama aza n abaayi to ɓə gwo wo m, ntuge wo ɓə gnyi woi lo Urishelima nu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />She Jemyis n Yohanai əwo amwutuyi ɓə gye dəye, ɓa nyaɓo, “Dagayi, ho ncei pmalo ya yi əná ɓe ncei n əshemi kwa zhni ɓa agbma a?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ama Yeisu wa pmyi, wa gnaknyi ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Nlonu əwo n əwo amwutuyii ɓa lo əzhigba ədo.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu vyivyi əkwo nakwó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Shi ɓa ɓə lo ɓai znazna lo n zokwoi, əzaho wa gna wo, “Mi ɓa vyi ho abahobahoi n ha lo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Acamcam n aɓwoi lo jesnu alú n amai kpəlo, ama Əza Nugwnu too n abai lo n wo ɓa ya əwo tukwo shi m.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Wa gna əzado, “Vyi mi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ama əza yi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi, fa, ma lo mii la əmi dada byi kpa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yeisu wa gna wo, “Fa azafyí ɓa byi əɓa aza afyífyiyi, ama əho da, lo ho zhni waazi Shekwoyi əbemi nya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Dudulonu əzado wa gna, “Dagayi, mi ɓa vyi ho; ama fa, ma jezelo mi kwu əmi apwuwada gnaami kpa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əza to lo ń wo la əɓwa tu n zukwo ofwa nya jesnu wa bmyawye; ń wo kwnuce lo wa zhni tnutnu dna n Shekwoyi əbemi m.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu tnú shiitnaaba-ceaba tnutnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ń dəye avnu Dagayi wa tnu azaje ngwnu shiitnaaba-ceaba, wa tnu ɓa tnutnu ngwnu-aba-aba ɓa kwu gyiabye, lo əzhi dəhodəhoi ń wo ɓə ncei pma wa lo. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Wa gna ɓa, “Afwanyakwu n mwa kwokwo lo, ama atnutnuyi n ɓwasnu lo fyewyi nu. Ntucenu, fye nya Dagayi afwanyakwu nya, wa tnu n atnutnuyii fyi ń əwo afwanyakwu ofwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Fye lo! Əmi nu tnú n fyei ngye aknyi fyi ń acamcam atasni. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Fye to la lagyiita, kwo gwnuma, kwo fya kwu abwada m; jesnu fye to gwo zahozahoyi gnaɓyi lo ń zokwoi m.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“She fye lofyi ń pwuwa, kpmisnuyi fye gna, ‘Bwugbafu kwo ɓe dna n pwuwa ye.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ngye əzaho dnalo n ɓo n wo n əwyei ce n bwugbafu, əfye bwugbafu ɓa shnikpe n əwo; ntolonu m, kwo ɓa jezeɓe da fye. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Fye kwu fyi n ɓo, fyei gyi, fyei sni nyahonyahoi n ɓa ga fye, ntuge tnutnuyi kwnuce lo a gba wo əwo tnutnu gyiwye. Fye to zna laɓa fyei kwnu n pwuwa gbmanyi fyei lo pwuwa ədo m.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />“Əsa n fya lofyi n əzhi aa fye gwo, fye gyi nyahonyahoi n a ga fye. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Fye ká anyasnayi gna n ɓa fyilo n ɓo, jesnu fya gna ɓa, ‘Shekwoyi əbemi kwo la ɓe vyivyiwyi n fyei.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ama she fye lofyi ń əzhi, to a gwo fye m, fye lofyi ń əkwo adnadna fya gna, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Kwo əfye əzhi aɓwutukwnu, yi lu kwo ya nu ngye ɓəkwnukwnù ń əfye aba. Dudulonu ɓəhnihni fye kwu dəye kpe ge: Shekwoyi əbemi kwo la ɓe vyivyiwyi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Əmi nu gna fye, kwo ɓə la Sodom gnawo faafa a fa əzhi yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Owii n hoi, Korazin! Owii n hoi, Betsaida! Ntuge ngye aɓəwowoi n a ɓə zhni fyi n əfye nyi, a ɓəə gna a zhni ɓa fyi ń Taya nu n Sidonii, əsa ye la mwalo shi ɓa ɓə ɓa yeabwi, n fyi n ajekwokwoi n ətnui. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ama kwo ɓə la Taya n Sidonii gnawo faafa n owada aba, a fa əfye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Jesnu əho Kapanam, a ɓə la ho latu n ashebmana a? Aawo, ho ɓə shnilo Akwu nu.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“Əzadəhodəhoyi n wo kna fye ɓəda tnubwa, wo la mi knatnubwa; əzadəhodəhoyi n wo ná fye aɓo, wo la əmi aɓo na; ama əzadəhodəhoyi n wo na mi aɓo, wo na əza nu aɓo n wo ɓə tnú n mii nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Shiitnaaba-ceaba yi ɓa jezezhi n agbmadai ɓa gna, “Dagayi, kwo ase ɓə kwu ɓahni gà fyi n əyi akwnu dna n əho əye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi ɓə kwu gye Shetam woi kaya ngye əgbmanabmya n əshe. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mi la ikwo ga fye fya dna awa n anapisii n apitai, jesnu fya gyi nuwnuyi tukwo kalá vnyanya; nyaho taa wu fye əɓwa m. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Dudulonu, fye to dagbma nge ase ɓa kwu ɓahni gà fyi n əfye akwnu m, ama fye dagbma nge aa n əfye ayei kafyilo n əshemi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />N əsayii, Yeisu, n nunui n agbmada Zafnu Gyigyiyi nyai, wa gna, “Mi ci ho lo, Dada, Dagayi əshemi nya n əknyii, ntuge ho kwu aɓo ye so awyemwayi n aɓəyekpeyii, jesnu honyii la ɓa kpeyawu aɓyi anawyi. Əə, Dada, ntuge ənya nu nyi n kwa da ho ha zhni.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Əmi Dada wo kwu aɓo vnyanya fa fyi ń əmi akwnu. Əzaho to lo n wo kpe əza ń Nugwnu n zhni m, akpəge Dada, jesnu əzaho to lo n wo kpe əza ń Dada n zhni m, akpəge Nugwnu, jesnu ń aza yii n Nugwnu la ɓa knyi waa Dada kpeyawu ɓa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Nlonu wa pmyiawye shi əwo amwutuyi, jesnu wa gna ɓa ɓahniɓahni, “Awye anabəlika nya nu n awyei n ɓa gye əɓo n fye gyewye nyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Nlonu mi gna fye nge, sheɓəgwognayi bəgyé n asui ɓə ncei pma ɓa gye əɓo n fye gyewye nyi, ama to ɓa gye əkwo m, jesnu ɓa wo əɓo n fye wo nyi, ama to ɓa wo əkwo m.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi Samariyayi manai nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />N əwyihoi, owa gnayekpeyi ho, wa laka gnyi nabai wa tu Yeisu mwi. Wa nyaɓo, “Nyawuyi, knyi ɓəshishii nu n mi ɓa zhni nabai mii ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya a?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyiyi nu kafyilo n owa, jesnu fye ba kwo lo n wunanu a?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “ ‘Ye Dagayi əho Shekwoyi n əho ədui vnyanya, n əho wyewyeyi vnyanya n əho akalái vnyanya ɓədo n əho bwugbai vnyanya’; jesnu, ‘Ye n əho kwnuzhiyii ngye əhohni tukwo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho la əɓo dnagbe shi kwo lo, zhni dəye jesnu ho ɓa gyianyì.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ama wo ɓə ncei pma wa bmya əwohni shi, ntulonu wa nya Yeisu əɓo, “Nyika nu zhni əmi kwnuzhiyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe: “Əza ɓə gbmi n Urishelima woi shnilo Jerikwo, avyì azokwojei ɓa znu wo zokwo. Ɓaa aje kpma wo, ɓa lu wo jesnu ɓa kwukala, ɓa fa wo shi n znufyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Pirisiti ho ɓə shnilo woi wna zokwo yi, shi wo ɓə gye əza yi, wa bmá, wa wna zokwo do. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Nlonu cè, Levyiyi ho, əsa n wo ɓə si abaayi, wa gye wo, wa bmá jesnu wa wna zokwo do. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ama Samariyayi, shi wo ɓə dnalo n əzna, wa ɓe aba n əza yi ɓə shi nyi; shi wo ɓə gye wo əwye, wa gye wo snusnu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Wa lo da wo jesnu wa pa wo aci n pəgyii, wa kpe wo omi ɓədo n anamnuwnai. Nlonu wa la wo tu n əwo zhagawyi, wa lo n woi n ashnidna aba, jesnu wa kwu wo wnakna. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Shi əfye ɓə gyi zhi, wa kwnu gyiwye zhnana denari ngwnu-aba, wa gba ashnidna wyekayi. Wa gna wo, ‘Wna wo akna, shi mi ɓə jezeɓe, mi ɓə gba ho əta ənya n ho kwu wu dutui, tu n əwo tukwo.’<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Dna n əɓa ngwnu-ata ye, ho zhninubwo lo nge nyika nu ɓə zhni əza ye kwnuzhiyi, n avyì ɓə znu wo zokwo nyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Owa agnakpeyi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əza n wo ɓə gye wo snusnu nyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yeisu wa gna wo, “Lo hoi zhni nlonu ce.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dna ń Mata n Mariyamwui pwuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Shi Yeisu n əwo amwutuyii ɓə fyilo n zokwo, wa ɓe əzhi, n nyikwoza ho, n a yi wo ge Mata nyi, ɓə gwú əwo pwuwa ya ga wo. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Wo ɓə n madoyii ai yi wo ge Mariyamwu, əwo nu ɓə sase shi n Dagayi apita ba woi kna əɓo tnubwa n wo ɓə da nyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ama bwugba kwaa Mata gnaje ntu tnutnu nyagyizhni nya ɓo vnyanya n wo ɓə gnyi woi zhni nyi. Wa ɓe da Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Dagayi, ho ta gye əho anuwna lo nge əmi mado wo la mi fa gnyi mii zhni tnutnu n əmihnii m? Gna wo nge wo bma mi zhni!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mata, Mata, bwugba kwo la ho wnu, jesnu ho la gnamyi ntu n aɓo bəgyé ɓo, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ama anya n ɓwasnu lo fyewyi nu n ɓa n apmai lo; ɓəhnihnii əɓo ɓwasnu lo gbmanyi nu. Mariyamwu wo la ənya knyí n kwo gnabmya, jesnu a taa myi a gwo wo kwo m.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu nyawu tu ń aduwazhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi zhniaduwa ń əwyihoi ń abaho. She wo ɓə pwo, zaknayi ń əwo amwutuyi wa gna wo, “Dagayi, wu yi aduwazhni, n ɓwasnu she Yohana ɓə wu əwo amwutuyi nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Wa gna ɓa, “Əsa ń fya zhniaduwa, fye gna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“ ‘Dada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">əho əye zhni gyigyiyi nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">əho əbemi kwo ɓe.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Dna n nyipyei dəhodəhoi, ga yi nyagyi nya wyizo.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Zo yi əyi aleifyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">shi əyihni ce yi zo əzahozahoyi abwi ń wo bwu yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Njesnu to ha lofyi n yii ń mwumwu m.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Ń a gna ge ho n nugwnudoi lo, haa lo da wo dna ń sukwo sadu, haa gna, ‘Nugwnudo, ga mi biledi aknana ngwnu-ata ma mwi; <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />əmi nugwnudo, dna n əzna, wo la ɓe əmi aba, minyi to n nyagyii lo ń mi ɓa ga wo m.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Njesnu n a gna nge əza n wo dna n nyakwnu-mi nyi, wo dnaɓəgbe, ‘Tó gna mi gnagna m. Mi la kpakwo lu gwu, əmi aɓyi n əmii yi kwu gwnukpe ń gədo. Mi taa myi ma laka ɓe ma ga ho nyaho m.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Əmi nu gna fye, kwo shikwonyi wo taa laka ɓə ntuge wo zhni əwo nugwnudo nu m, dudulonu ntuge wo la shenugyi ntna vnyinkwo, ɓəhnihni wo ɓə laka wa ga wo biledi shi wo ye ńsnu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ntulonu mi gna fye: “Fye nyaɓo, a ɓa ga fye; fye znashni, fye ɓa ɓwa; fye jeaba, jesnu a ɓa gwu kpakwo ya ga fye. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ntuge zahozahoyi ń wo nyaɓo, wo gwo; əza ń wo znashni, wo ɓwa; jesnu əza ń wo jeaba, a ɓa gwu aba ya ga wo.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Nyika nu lo n fye, adada, n əwo nugwnu ɓa nya wo əbmya ɓo, wa ga wo owa nu ń əkwo əɓwi a? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Kwo ń wa nya wo pisezhi ɓo, wa ga wo napisi nu a? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nlonu, ngye əfye, kwo shikwonyi, fye zhni aɓənukwoizhniyi nu, fye kpəlo shi fye ɓa ga əfye aɓyi anya amanai, fye kwu gna kpekpe nge, əfye Dada n wo dna n əshemi nyi, wo ɓa gna aza yi Zafnu Gyigyiyi gaga nu n ɓa nya wo əkwo əɓo nyi!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu n Byelzebwului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi gbmi əse takpeɓəda nya ya. She əse yi ɓə gbmiya, takpeɓəda yi wa daɓo jesnu ca wo deeji.<verse eid="LUK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ama azaho ń ɓa, ɓa gna, “N Byelzebwulu kalái nu, ase əbeɓyi, ń wo gnyi woi kwnu ase ya ncei.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Azaje ɓa mwi wo ɓai nya wo əznù əɓo n kwo gbmi ń əshemi.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yeisu ɓə kpé əɓa aɓo ɓənubwozhni wa gna ɓa: “Əbemi dəhodəhoi ń kwo la əkwohni gnajeya, kwo ɓa kwu zhniagbma; jesnu pwuwa ń kwo la əkwohni gnajeya kwo ɓaa myiya. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ngye Shetam wo la əwohni gnaje woi snukwnú n əwohnii, əwo əbemi ɓa gnyiagnyi n wuna a? Mi gna fye dəye ntuge fya gná nge, mi kwnu ase ya n Byelzebwulu kalái nu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nsaiye, ngye mi kwnu ase ya n Byelzebwulu kalái nu, n nyikai nu ń əfye, avyiyi, kwnu ɓa ya ncei a? Ntulonu əɓa nu ɓə kwu zè əfye awadayi. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ama ngye mi kwnu ase ya n Shekwoyi ɓwanyii nu, a gye Shekwoyi əbemi n la ɓe əfye aba.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Əsa n əza kaláda, n okwnu akayai gwnuznu; n shi woi gwu əwo pwuwa, əwo nyaɓwa ɓa kwu pwo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ama əsa n əzado ɓe n du wo n akalá, waa je wo ń okwnui, jesnu waa myi n əwo əɓo, wo ɓə gwo əza yi akwnuakaya ń wo kpema ɓa nyi, jesnu woi kwú əwo okwnugyi nyaɓwa wa gnaya.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Zahozahoyi n wo to kwnusnu lo n mii m, wo gnyiapaapa nu n mii, jesnu zahozahoyi n wo ta yezhi lo n kwnusnu n mii m, wo gná anya myi nu.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“She zafnu nukwoi gbmiya n əza, kwo zna laɓa ń zhabwikawu nu, kwoi zna ashnita aba shní, ama n kwo to ɓwa m, nlonu kwa gna, ‘Mi ɓa jezelo pwuwa ń mi ɓə gbmi nyi.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />She kwo ɓə si, kwa gye pwuwa n fnyifnyiiya shi ń anyai wnakna. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Nlonu kwa lo kwa kwu azafnu anukwoi aje ngwnu-tnaaba n ɓa du əkwohni lo n əkpízhni, ɓa lofyi ɓa kwu fyi n ɓo. Əza yi anyìgyi kwaa gna kpmisnui wnuya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Shi Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi da aɓo ye, nyikwoza ho wa gbmi əgbe dna ń deeji wa gna, “Anabəlikada nu n əyai ń wo ɓə ma ho wa shi ho nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo snusnu nu ge, anabəlikada nu n aza yii ń ɓa wó Shekwoyi ɓədagbma ədna jesnu ɓai shi kwo ɓwa nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yunana əznù</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Shi deeji ɓə mwaɓe, Yeisu wa gna, “Cala akpizhniyi nya nu nyi. Kwo nya əznù nu ɓo, ama a taa ga kwo m, kwo gbmanyi, akpəge Yunana əznù. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ngye shi Yunana ɓə la zè əznù ń Aninivayi aba nyi, ntulonu ce, ń Əza Nugwnu wo ɓaa zè əznù n cala ye aba. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Əsu nyikwo Snutakwo nya, ɓə laka gnyi n owadawyi n cala yei, woi znu kwo knyi; ntuge wo ɓə gbmi n anyiceshiba wa ɓe wa wo Sulemanu wyemwa ɓəda; ama nsaiye ənya n kwo du Sulemanu lo, gnyilo n ya. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Aninivayi ɓə kwukazhi n owadawyi n cala yei jesnu ɓai znu kwo əknyi, ntuge ɓa ɓə kwu yeabwi ntu Yunana waazi ɓo; jesnu nsaiye ənya n kwo du Yunana kwo gnyilo n ya.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyitila nayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Əza to lo n wo wna pyitila əná waa kwo sodna m, kwo waa kwo kwnu papa m. Ama a ya kwo tu n əkwo kwnuyi nu, nabai aza n ɓa lo ɓe nyi ɓa gye bwuznagna. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Əho əwye nu zhni pyitila əho nayi nya. Əsa n əho awye bmyalo, əho nayi vnyanya ce nunui lo n bwuznagnai. Ama əsa n ɓa to bmyalo m, əho nayi vnyanya ce n nunui lo n wyegbmai. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Nlonu, nsaiye, la əwyewna n bwuznagna n kwo fyi n əho nyi, to kwa kwu zhni wyegbma m. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ntucenu, ngye əho nayi vnyanya n nunui lo n bwuznagnai, jesnu səpa ho to lo n kwo n wyegbmai fyi m, kwo ɓaa ɓwagnyi ń nunui n bwuznagnai vnyanya nu, ngye shi pyitila kná bwuznagna ya kpe ho nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owii ń Farisiyi tukwo n owa agnayekpeyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Əsa n Yeisu ɓə la pwo ɓəda ɓo, Farisiyi ho wa yì wo nyagyi gyi n əwo pwuwa; ntulonu wa lodna jesnu wa myima n tebwul.<verse eid="LUK 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ama ca wo Farisiyii she wo ɓə gye nge Yeisu to ɓə naɓwa kpa ɓa kpe nyagyi gyi m.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Nlonu Dagayi wa gna wo, “Əfye Afarisiyi zhna bwoɓyi ya n shnapaɓyii n əbmyi, ama n əmi fye nunui lo n fnanai ɓədo n əkpízhnii. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Əfye aza amama! Əza n wo ɓə zhni əbmyi nyi, əwo nu to ɓə zhni əmì ce m? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ama nsaiye, fyè la əɓwa loya ga awyekwoyi, nabai nyahonyahoi n kwo fyi ń əfye əmi nyi, kwo ɓaa zè gyigyiyi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Owii n əfyei Afarisiyi, ntuge fye ga Shekwoyi zaka n əfye afnyitolo snidaí, fya gà agwuɓá, jesnu n əkna anyanunùyii vnyanya, ama fye kwu owafyecei ya, n Shekwoyi yeyei. Fye ɓə ɓa myi fya zhni kpmasnui ama to fya fa kpmisnuyi zhni ɓo m.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Owii n fyei Afarisiyi, ntuge fye ye fya sase kpe n azayaakwo aba ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu ɓədo n gnaɓyi mwamwaga nyai n agnyikwota.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Owii n əfyei, ntuge fye wulo ngye avnyigwo nu ń a too lú m, aza ɓai znazna kpe n kwo to ɓai kpe m.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Zaknayi ń owa agnayekpeyi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Nyawuyi, she ha da aɓo ye, ho kwu yi knyiakpmi cè.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əfye owa agnayekpeyi, owii n fyei, ntuge fye kwu akaya ashnawoi kpe aza ń kwo dnaɓo lo ɓa shnishi, jesnu əfye n əfyehni fye ta dna əfye ɓwanyi lo nabai fya bma ɓa zhni m.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Owii n əfyei, ntuge fye mi sheɓəgwognayi avnyigwo lo, ń əfye azakwoi nu ɓə wu ɓa nyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ntulonu fyei gbmiɓo nge fye la əɓwatu ń aɓo ń əfye azakwoi ɓə zhni nyi; əɓa nu ɓə wu sheɓəgwognayi, jesnu əfye nu mi əɓa avnyigwo n kasnu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ntu dəye ɓo, Shekwoyi, dna n əwo wyemwa, wa gna, ‘Mi ɓa tnu ɓa n sheɓəgwognayii ɓədo n atnutnuloyii; azaho ń əɓa mi, ɓai kwú ɓa wu, ai fyi azaje n awyesnugbegye ɓo.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ntucenu, a ɓə shi cala ye nu əɓwa, ntu sheɓəgwognayi vnyanya ami ɓo, n a la zeya nyi, ənya n kwo laka n anyì yayasa, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />ənya ń kwo laka ń Habyila ami kwoi ɓe Zakariya ami, əza ń a ɓə wu dna ń bəgədi atasni n aba gyigyiyii nyi. Əə, əmi nu gna fye, aɓo shi cala ye nu ntu əɓa aɓəzhnizhni vnyanya ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa agnayekpeyi, ntuge fye la ɓəyekpe nyagwunya lá. Əfye ń əfyehnii, fye too lofyi m, jesnu fyei ta fa aza lo n ɓa ɓə zhii ɓai lofyi nyi nge ɓa lofyi m.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Əsa n Yeisu ɓə gbmiya lo əbmyi, Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii ɓa ya ɓai gnyiapaapa n woi n əwyei bmyibmyii jesnu ɓa nya wo aɓənyanya, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />n zhi ɓai pmi nabai ɓa wna wo n ɓəho ń wo ɓa da.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kwnùkwnù n bwugbakaládnai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Aɓwazhilo, she deeji adugwu bəgyé ɓəə la yezhi, kwa si ɓai pyi ajeya, Yeisu wa ya ɓəda n əwo amwutuyii nu n kpmisnu, woi gna: “Fye la əwyewna n Afarisiyi yisti, ń əkwo nu zhni kwocedna. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Nyaho to lo n kwo pwuanya shì lo, n a to ɓə la kwo gbmiwu m. Kwo n ɓwushi lo ń a to ɓə kwu kwo wu pəipəi m. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Əɓo n fye kwu da fyi ń wyegbma, a ɓə wo kwo n nyipyei pəipəi, jesnu əɓo n fye ɓə da kwo fyi aje n atnubwa fyi n anyakwnumi, a ɓə da kwo kpe ń anyakwnusni.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Əmi anugwnudo, əmi nu gna fye, fye to wo aza yi ədna n ɓa wu nayi nu, ama n dəye avnu, ɓa to n ɓəhoi shnasnu lo n ɓa zhni m. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ama mi ɓa wu fye əza n fye ɓa wo wodna: Fye wo əza ədna n wo ɓa myi wa wu əfye nayi, jesnu ń əkwo avnu, wo n ikwoi lo wa she kwo ya dna ń anápyi. Əə, mi gna fye, fye wo wodna. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />A ta kwnu agbakwolowyi ngwnu-atnu akəɓwo ngwnu-aba nu m? Dudulonu ədoho to lo n ɓa ń Shekwoyi n kwoi zamwi lo m. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ɓəhnihni, əfye tukwoyì vnyanya n babai lo. Fye to wodna m; fye du agbakwolowyi bəgyé lo n apma.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Əmi nu gna fye, əza n wa da əmi əye kpe ɓo pəipəi n aza abye, Əza Nugwnu ɓə da əwo əye kpe ɓo ce ń amaləka Shekwoyi nya abye. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ama əza n wa ná əmi aɓo ń aza abye, a ɓə ná əwohni aɓo n amaləka Shekwoyi nya abye. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nlonu əzahozahoyi ń wa da ɓədagbma nukwoi tu n Əza Nugwnu tukwo, a ɓə kwu aleifyi zo wo, ama zahozahoyi ń wa da atukwopmi ɓəda tu n Zafnu Gyigyiyi tukwo, a to ɓə zo wo aleifyi m.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“She a ɓə lo n fyei ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, abegyiyi n a ikwodai, fye to ɓə gná fyehni gnagna, she fye ɓa gnyi əfyehni kwo əɓo n fye ɓa da m, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />ntuge Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə wu fye əɓo n fye ɓa da n əsayii.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyaɓwayi mama nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Əzaho dna n deeji wa gna wo, “Nyawuyi, gna əmido nge yi la əgwú gna.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Nyiyiza, nyika nu ń la mi dna owadayi kwo əgwú gnáyi n əfye atasni a?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa, “Fye la əwyewna! Fye kwu əfyehni wnashi ntu ń aɓo awyeda n aɓəpwawo dəhodəhoi pya ɓo; ntuge anyìgyi ta vyi shi əza n nyaɓwai lo nsnu nu m.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Njesnu wa gna ɓa ɓəsisi ye, “Nyaɓwayi ho, əwo ofwa ɓə ga wo afwanyakwu n mwa kwokwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Wa zhni ɓənubwo fyi n əwohni, ‘Knyiyi nu n mi ɓa zhni a? Mi too nabai lo n mi ɓa fyi əmi anyagyigyi m.’<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />“Nlonu, wa gna, ‘Əɓo nu nyi n mi ɓa zhni. Mi ɓa adobwi ye ɓaya, jesnu ma mi adnagbmai, nabai ma fyi əmi awyi n mwa kwokwo ye. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Njesnu mi ɓə gna əmihni, “Ho kwu awyi ɓwa n mwa ncei yefyi ntu aye bəgyé ɓo n abye. La snú; gyi, hoi sni jesnu ha dagbma.” ’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />“Ama Shekwoyi wa gna wo, ‘Əza mama! Dna n sukwo ye mi, a ɓa gwo əho wyewyeyi. To gna mi, anya n ho la yezhi əhohni nyi, ɓa ɓə kwu zhni nyika anya nu a?’<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />“Nlai nu n kwo ɓə zhni n əzadəhodəhoyi n wo la nyaɓwa yezhi əwohni, ama ntna nyaɓwa yezhi n Shekwoyi aba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fye to wnubwugba m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi: “Ntucenu, mi gna fye, fye to wnubwugba tu n əfye awyewyeyi ɓo m, ənya n fye ɓa gyi m; kwo ntu n əfye anayi ɓo, ənya n fye ɓa kpe m. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Wyewyeyi kwo du nyagyi lo, jesnu anayi n du aje lo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Fye ka akwasakwasa wye: Ɓa ta bye kwo ɓa dò m, ɓa to n anyagyi yezhibai lo, kwo dobwi m; dudulonu Shekwoyi kpá ɓa. Ai fye du alú lo n apma n mwa! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nyika nu dnalo n fye n wo ɓa ɓe əwohni wyewyeyi snukna gbmanyi ntu n bwugbawnu ɓo a?” <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Shikwonyi fye taa myi fya zhni əɓo ɓyiyi ye m, knyiyi nu zhni fyei wnubwugba ntu aɓo n ɓa ce nyi a?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Fye ka amamawyí əwye n bmana she ɓa mwa n wu. Ɓa ta zhni tnutnu, kwo ɓa she lulu m. Dudulonu əmi nu gna fye, kwo Sulemanu dna n əwohni bmyabmya vnyanya, wo to ɓə kpe aje ngye mamawyi ho gbmanyi n ɓa m.” <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />“Ngye Shekwoyi kpe agbegbe bmana nya aje ń lai nu, n ɓa nyi n naiye, əfye kwa gyi a sheɓaya fyi n əná nyi, wo taa gna əfye nu ajekpekpe m; əfye agaiciyaganunui agbagbaida! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Fye to kwu əfye adu zhi ntu anya ɓo nu ń fye ɓa gyi kwo fya sni nyi m; fye to wnubwugba ntuce m. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ntuge aza anyì nya zna anya ye pya nu shni vnyanya, jesnu əfye Dada kpəlo nge fye n əɓa apmai lo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ama fye zna əwo əbemi shni, jesnu anya ye vnyanya a ɓə kwu ɓa ga fye ɓədo cè.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Gəluce ɓyiyi, fye to wodna m, ntuge kwo dá əfye Dada lo wa ga fye əbemi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Fye kwu əfye nyaɓwa kwnu, fya kwu agyiwye ga awyekwoyi. Fye zna alagyiita shni ga əfyehni n ɓa taa saya m, nyaɓwayezhi n kwo fyi n əshemi n kwo ta shna zo nyi m, aba ń əvyì ta wo vyivyiwyi, jesnu ń anyìmana taa zhni anya agbma m. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ntuge aba ń əho nyaɓwayezhi nyi, ń abaayi nu ń əho ədu ɓa shi cè.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fye kwu zhigwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Fye kwu əfyehni pmá ntu tnutnuzhni ɓo jesnu fya kwu əfye apyitila shi ń anai wna, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />ngye atnutnuyi ń ɓa zhi ɓai pmi əɓa dagayi wa zhi amwula awyefna, nabai əsa ń wo ɓə zhi wa jeaba, ń ɓa ɓə gwu wo kpakwo ya wolowolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Kwo ɓə kwu atnutnuyi yi bmya ń əɓa dagayi ɓə jezezhi wa gye ɓa zhigwu. Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, wo ɓə pmá əwohni wa zhni tnutnu, wo ɓə zhni ɓa ɓai la kpmima ń tebwul jesnu woi ɓe wa gna ɓa nyagyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Kwo ɓə kwu atnutnuyi yi bmya ń əɓa dagayi ɓə gye ɓa zhi n əɓahnii yeyei, kwo n wo ɓə ɓe dna n sukwo sadu nu kwo n fyegyi ɓwai. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ama fye ɓwa awyega ye: Ngye pwuwada ɓəə gna wa kwu kpe əsa n əvyì ɓə ye wa ɓe ncei, wo too ɓə ɓa ye nge a ɓá əwo pwuwa ya a lofyi m. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ɓəshishi nu fyaa əfyehni ye, ntuge Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe n əsai nu ń fye to n əwo əɓoi dnalo m.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Byitusu wa nyaɓo, “Dagayi, ho wu əyi nu ɓəsisi yee, kwo ntu əzahozahoyi ɓo nu a?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, “To, nyikanu zhni anya aknawnayi gbenui n wo cecei, ń əwo dagayi ɓa kwu atnutnuyi fyi ń əwo akwnu, wa ga ɓa nyagyi n əkwo əsai a? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kwo ɓə la zhni əɓo manai nu n tnutnuyi aba, ń əwo Dagayi ɓə jezezhi wa gye wo gnyi woi vyi əwo əɓəgbetu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, “Wo ɓə kwu əwo nyaɓwa vnyanya fyi ń əwo akwnu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ama ń kwa zè ge tnutnuyi gna əwohni, ‘Əmi dagayi wo kwu kalala zhni n jezezhii; wa ya woi lu atnutnuyi aje, azanugbai n anyikwozai, jesnu wa gyi, woi sni, kwoi zhni wo woi fyijeya.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Tnutnuyi dagayi ɓə jezeɓe n əwyii ń wo to n əwo əɓoi dnalo m, jesnu n əsai ń wo ta dnace lo m. Wo ɓə ce wo ya wyiwowyiwo jesnu woi la wo yadna nkwnusnu n atnavyiyii.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Tnutnuyi ń wo kpé əwo dagayi ɓəyé ye, ama to wa pmá əwohni, wa zhni əɓo n wo dagayi yé m, a ɓə fyi wo apmi n aɓwai mwa bəgyé. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ama əza n wo ta kpeye lo m, n wo zhni əɓo ń kwo kwnuce wa gwo tata, a ɓə fyi wo apmi fyewyi nu. Əzahozahoyi ń a la ga wo n mwa, a ɓə tuwye ń wo n mwa; jesnu əza ń a la ənya yaakwo ga wo, a ɓə nya wo ənya yaakwo ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Toge bwugbafu m ama ajegna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Mi la ɓe ma dna əná ń anyì, a wo mi lo, ngye kwo yee la lu wnawna nu kwoi gwo! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ama mi n batizimai lo n a ɓa zhni mi, jesnu mi dnalo n bwugbawnu nya əsa ń kwo ɓə nu ncei! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Fye zhninubwo nge ma ɓe nabai ma ga bwugbafu nu ń anyì? Aawo, əmi nu gna fye ma ɓe n ajegnai nu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ənya ń kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo n abyei, a ɓə gye aza fyi ń pwuwa ngwnu-atnu ń gnajeya, ngwnu-ata ń gwnukpe ngwnu-aba, jesnu ngwnu-aba ń gwnukpe ngwnu-ata. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ɓa ɓə la gnaje, əda ń gwnutu nugwnu, jesnu nugwnu ń gwnutu əda, əyà ń gwnutu nyigwnu jesnu nyigwnu ń gwnutu əyà, əvya ń gwnutu tnáyi, jesnu tnáyi ń gwnutu əvya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awyeknayagaga asa nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Wa gna deeji: “She fye gye ənyì tu ń shnikwó ɓwa, nsayisayii fya gna, ‘Əgbma ye kwa zhi nu,’ n kwnusnu kwa kwu zhi. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Njesnu she əse ci kwoi kwnu ń snutakwo əɓwa, fya gna, ‘Wyepye ye kwa fyi nu,’ n kwnusnu kwa kwu fyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Akwocednayi! Fye kpəlo shi fye ɓa ɓwa awyeknaya əknyi nya n anyìbmanai. Kwo zè n wunanu fyenyi ta kpəlo shi fye ɓa ga awyeknaya əsa ye nya ma a?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Knyiyi nu zhni to fyei kpe əɓo ɓəfyece znu ga əfyehni ma a? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Shi ho lo owa bwokwnu n kwnusnu n əho nuwnuyii, la əhohni yi n əwyei bmyibmyii, fya kwu əɓo wnado lo n zokwo, ntolonu m, əho nuwnuyii ɓa myi wa lo n hoi ń owadayi aba, owadayi woi la ho taya ga bwusiɓyiyida, jesnu bwusiɓyiyida woi la ho sheya dna n zhalu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Mi gna ho, ho to ɓə gbmiya m, akpe ho kwu sisinkəɓwo agyiwye yi nya zo gba vnyanya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Fye yeabwi ntolonu m fya kwu fyí</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Azaho ɓə zhi n ɓo dna nsayii, ń ɓa ɓə daɓo n Yeisu tu Agəliliyi əɓo; ń Byilatusu ɓə gbmí əɓa ami aje n əɓa anyakwnukwnui nyi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye zhninubwo lo nge Agəliliyi ye nu ɓə zhni aleifyizhniyi n du Agəliliyi aje vnyanya, ntuge ɓa ɓə gyeazhnì n wu nlai? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Aawo! Əmi nu gna fye, akpəge fya yeabwi, əfyehni ce vnyanya, a ɓə kwu fye zhniagbma. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Kwo aza yi, ngwnu awocei-nyimwanyimwa, n ɓa ɓə fyí, əsa ń Silowam nyakwnu mikpeaje ɓə myiya kpe ɓa nyi; fye zhninubwo lo nge əɓa ɓəgyi nu ɓə du, a fa azaje vnyanya n ɓa ɓə fyi n Urishelima nyi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Aawo! Əmi nu gna fye, akpəge fya yeabwi, əfyehni ce vnyanya, a ɓə kwu fye zhniagbma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Nlonu wa si ɓəsisi ye: “Əzaho ɓə n gbaayi shnuwnai dna kwoi mwa ń əwo anamzhni, wa lo woi zna əkwo gyigyiyi shni, ama to wa gye nyaho n gyitu m. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ntulonu, wa gna əza ń wo dna woi shi anamzhni awye nyi, ‘Mi kwu aye ɓwa ngwnu-ata nuu, mii ɓe nabai ma ka əgbà gyigyiyi ń gbaayi shnuwna ye, ama mi too gye əkwo gyigyiyi tu m. Znu kwo ya! Knyiyi nu ɓa zhni kwaa gnyi kwoi zhni əknyi agbma a?’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />“Əza yi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Haamwasa, ho yé la kwo fa kpa,’ la əye gbmanyi kpma kwo ga, mi ɓa nyì aba n shegwnu kwo jesnu mii fyi kwo ofwanyágbma. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />N kwo ɓə kwu gyi ń tna, kwo ɓə la bmya! Ntolonu m, ho ɓə znu kwo ya.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu lá nyikwoza zabmazhi kágna n Sibyiwyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />N Sibyiwyii, Yeisu ɓə dna woi wunya ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />nyikwoza ɓə dna n ɓo ń ase ɓəə la wo bmazhi aye ngwnu awocei-nyimwanyimwa. Wo ɓə yatu nu jesnu to woi myi woi kpebye m. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />She Yeisu ɓə gye wo, wa yì wo ɓe ncei ń abye wa gna wo, “Nyikwoza, a la ho kágna ń əho nyasna.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nlonu wa kpe wo aɓwa, jesnu nsayisayii wa kpebye gnyi, wa ci Shekwoyi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda n gnyi n minagyii, ntuge Yeisu wo la əza kágna n Sibyiwyii, wa gna aza, “Anyipyei lo ngwnu-tnanyi nu tnutnuzhni nya. Ntulonu fye ɓe a ká fye gna fyi ń anyipyei yi, ama toge n Sibyiwyii m.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Dagayi wa dna wo ɓəgbe, “Əfye akwocednayi! Əzahozahoyi n fye, ta lo əwo nakwo ya kwo zhagawyi ń əkwo agyiba n Sibyiwyi wa lo wa ga kwo nuwna m? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Nlonu nyikwoza ye, Ibrahim nyigwnu, əza ń Shetam ɓə n woi pashi aye akpamwai ngwnu awocei-nyimwanyimwa, kwo to kwnuce lo a lo wo ya ń ənya ń kwo ɓə n woi pashi, n Sibyiwyii m?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Vnyinkwo kwa kwu wo əwo anuwnuyi vnyanya, she wo ɓə da ɓa ɓəye, ama ca kwu da aza ntu aɓo awowoyi ɓo ń wo ɓə gnyi woi zhni nyi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi mwusta byegye nya n yistii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Nlonu Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Shekwoyi əbemi ń wulo ngye knyiyi nu a? Mi ɓa mwukwodo n knyiyi nu a? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Kwo wulo ngye musta byegye nu, ń əza ɓə la wa bye kwo dna ń əwo əkna. Kwa mwa kwaa zè shnuwna, alú ɓa ɓe ɓa yakpe ń əkwo aɓwala.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Jesnu wa nyaɓo, “Mi ɓa mwi Shekwoyi əbemi do n knyiyi nu a? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Kwo wulo ngye yisti nu ń nyikwoza ɓə sni wa gbmiaje n wyilukwui n mwa, nya əsa ń kwo ɓə la nyagbmi vnyanya.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abwokwnumi pmapmai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Nlonu shi Yeisu ɓə wna zokwo woi lo Urishelima, wa vyi azhiyaakwo n azhigbai, woi wunya. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Əzaho wa nya wo əɓo, “Dagayi, aza ɓwasnu lo fyewyi nu ń ɓa ɓə pwo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Wa gna ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Əmi nu gna fye, “Fye la əfyehni mwákpe fya lofyi ń abwokwnumi pmapmai, ntuge aza mwa bəgyé lo, ń ɓa ɓə ye ɓa lofyi ń kwo, ama ɓa to ɓə myi m. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Əsa ń pwuwada ɓə laka gnyi wa gwu abwokwnumi, fye ɓə kwu zhi ń əbmyi fyei jeaba, jesnu fyei tnaɓwa, ‘Haamwasa, gwu yi abwokwnumi ya.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">“Ama wo ɓə dnaɓəgbe, ‘Mi ta kpe əfye ye lo, kwo aba ń fya kwnu m.’<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />“Nlonu fye ɓə gna, ‘Yì ɓə kwu nyagyi kwnu gyi, ya kwu kwnu sni n hoi, jesnu ha wunya laɓa kpe ń əyi adnadna.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />“Ama wo ɓə dnaɓəgbe, ‘Mi ta kpe fye ye lo kwo aba ń fye kwnu m. Fye la kwu mi kala, əfye aɓənukwoizhniyi vnyanya!’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“A ɓə ciɓwi n ɓo, ai gyi anyikna, she fye ɓə gye Ibrahim, Ishakwu n Yakwuɓwui n sheaɓəgwognayii vnyanya n fyi ń Shekwoyi əbemi, ama əfyeeda n kwnuya zhi ń əbmyi. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Aza ɓə kwnu ɓe ń kpəkwó, n shnikwó, ń snukwó, n snutakwo, jesnu ɓai ɓe ɓa kwu sase kpe ń agbmada nyagyigyi awyefna aba ń Shekwoyi əbemi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ɓəhnihni azaho lo ń ɓa zhni akpmaknayi, ń ɓa ɓə kwu zhni akpmisnuyi, jesnu akpmisnuyi ń ɓa ɓə kwu zhni akpmaknayi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu bwugbawnu ntu Urishelima ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Dna n əsayii Afarisiyi ho ɓa ɓe da Yeisu jesnu ɓa gna wo, “La abaye fa ha lo abado gbowo. Hiridusu ye lo wa wu ho.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye lo fye gna camcam yi, ‘Mi ɓa gwodu mii kwnu ase ya, mii ká aza gna n naiye n nsui, jesnu n nyipyei tayii mii pwo əmi ɓəmwushi.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kwo ń wuna a, ɓəshishi nu ma gwodu lo n naiye, ń nsui ɓədo n nyipyeii ń kwo yatu nyi; ntuge ɓəhnihni sheɓəgwognayi to lo ń wo ɓa fyí tu ń Urishelima əbmyi m!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Urishelima, Urishelima, əho ń ho wu sheaɓəgwognayi jesnu hoi she aza yi akwuta, ń a tnu ho ncei nyi, aɓwa aknyii nu ń mi yi əmihni, ma ye əho aɓyi zhi n aba gbmanyi, shi pise zhni kwa ye əkwo aɓyi fyi n əkwo aɓwase nyi, ama ho ta ye lo m. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Shiawye, a la əho pwuwa fa gnyi ho n gbəloii. Əmi nu gna ho, ho taa je əmi wyegye m, akpəge əsa n ho ɓə gna ge, ‘Anabəlikada nu n əzai ń wo ɓe dna ń Dagayi əye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu dna n Farisiyi pwuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />N Sibyiwyi hoi, she Yeisu ɓə lo nyagyi gyi dna ń Farisiyi zayaakwo pwuwa, ɓa kwu zhi ɓai dna wo əwye pəceye. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Əzaho ɓə gnyi n əwo abye woi gyeazhnì n nayi snusnui n duwyi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yeisu wa nya Afarisiyi əɓo ɓədo n owa gnayekpeyi, “Owa ncei ye lo nge a ká əza gna n Sibyiwyii kwó kwo to ncei ye lo ma a?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ama ɓa kwu cepyi. Ntulonu she wo taɓwashi əza yi, wa ká wo gna jesnu wa kwu wo gnami.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Nlonu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Ngye əzaho n fye ń əɓyii lo kwo nakwo, kwaa kaya dna ń lizhiya n Sibyiwyii, wo taa gbmi kwo ɓə ncei ń əsagbmanyi m?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Njesnu to ɓa ɓwa ɓəho ń ɓa ɓá da m.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />She wo ɓə kwu gye shi azhiɓeyi tnu aseseba adnagbmai kpe ń tebwul, wa si ɓa ɓəsisi ye: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“She əza pa ho amwula awyefna, to lo ho sasetu ń aseseba adnagbmai m, kwo ɓa yezhni nge əza n wo du ho lo n mwamwa, a ɓə kwu kwo pa wo ce. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ngye kwo lo nlonu, əza n wo ɓə pa fye awyefna nyi, wo ɓə ɓe wa gna ho, ‘Ga əza ye əho aseseba.’ Nlonu dna n vnyinkwo, ho ɓə lo aseseba n kwo gnagbagbai. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ama she a pa ho awyefna, lo ho sasetu n aseseba gbàgbài, nabai she awyefnada ɓə ɓe, wo ɓə gna ho, ‘Nugwnudo, ɓe ha gwnulo aseseba adnagbmai.’ Nlonu a ɓə ga ho mwamwa n əho azhiɓeyi aje awye vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ntuge aza yi vnyanya n ɓa mwa əɓahni tukwo nyi, a ɓa gbà ɓa, jesnu aza yi n ɓa gbà əɓahni tukwo nyi a ɓə mwa ɓa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna əza n wo ɓə yi wo nyagyi gyi nyi, “She ho yi aza nyipyeinyagyi gyi kwo wyeshenyagyi gyi, to yi əho anugwnudo, əho azaje, əho əbye kwo əho akwnuzhiyi anyaɓwayi m; n ha zhni nlonu, ɓa ɓə ka hohni yi cè, ntulonu a ɓə kwu əta gba ho. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ama she ho yi nyagyigyi, yi awyekwoyi, azabmazhi, apita shásháida ɓədo n awyebwayii, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />jesnu ho ɓə ɓwa anabəlika. Kwo shikwonyi ɓa taa myi ɓa gba ho əta m, a ɓə gba ho n aɓəfyeceyi əfyikalakwu əsai.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyagyigyi yaakwo nya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />She zaknayi, dna ń aza yi atasni n ɓa ɓə kwnu asese kpe n woi n tebwul nyi, ɓə wo əɓo ye, wa gna Yeisu, “Əza anabəlikada nu ń wo ɓə gyi nyagyi gnyi ń awyefnaba dna ń Shekwoyi əbemi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əzaho ɓə gnyi woi ye əwohni, wa yì nyagyigyi yaakwo, jesnu wa kwu kwo pa azhiɓeyi n mwa bəgyé. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Shi nyagyi gyi yaakwo əsa ɓə la si, wa tnu əwo tnutnuyi woi gna aza yi ń wo ɓəə kwu pa ɓa nyi, ‘Fye ɓe ntuge a kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi zozhni.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />“Ama əɓa vnyanya ngye ɓa pagbe, ɓa ya ɓai ɓe n aɓəzei. Əza kpmisnuyi wa gna, ‘Mi ye ɓwa əknyi si nu, jesnu ɓəshishi nu ma lo mii gye əkwo əwye. Sukwu, fye la əmi əɓwa gbmiya nce.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />“Əzado wa gna, ‘Mi ye ɓwa anakwo ofwanu nya si nu, akwu ngwnu-atnu, mi lo ń zokwo nu mi kwu ɓa tumwi. Sukwu fye la əmi əɓwa gbmiya nce.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />“Əzado wa dudu wa gna, ‘Mi ye ɓwa amwula pa nu, ntulonu mi taa myi n ɓe m.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Tnutnuyi yi wa jezeɓe wa wu əwo pwuwada əɓo ye. Nlonu, pwuwada wa gyi minagyi jesnu wa ga əwo tnutnuyi əgbe, ‘Gbmilo wolowolo ha vyi adnadna n afyefyei əzhiyaakwo nya, lo ho ɓe n awyekwoyii, azabmazhi, awyebwayi n apita sháshái dai.’<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />“Tnutnuyi yi wa gna, ‘haamwasa, əgbe ń ho ɓə ga nyi, a kwu kwo zhni, ama aba ye celo n a ɓə ye fyi aza.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Nlonu Dagayi wa gna əwo tnutnuyi, ‘Gbmi lo azokwo ɓədo n azhigba azokwoi, hoo lo ɓe n ɓai n akalái, nabai əmi pwuwa kwaa nu. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Əmi nu gna ho, zaknayi to lo ń aza yi ń a ɓə kwu kwo pa ɓa nyi, n wo ɓə to əmi nyagyi wo m.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">She mwutuyi ze zokwo kwoná nsnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Adeeji yaakwo ɓə lo ɓai znazna n kwnusnu n Yeisui, she wo ɓə bmyawye shi ɓa, wa gna: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Ngye əza lo ń wo ye wa vyi mi, ama wo ta ye lo wa wnunu n əwo dadai, n əwo əyai, əwo nyikwo n aɓyii, əwo aje n amapwii; əə, kwo əwohni wyewyeyi m; əza yi pya taa zhni əmi mwutuyii m. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Njesnu əza ń wo to lá əwohni znudu shi waa vyi mi m, wo taa zhni əmi mwutuyii m.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Ń a gna nge əzaho ń fye, ncei pmalo wa mi nyakwnu gwnúkpeaje. Wo taa sase shi nu kpa, wa kwu əkwo mimi gyiwye kwaje, wa gye ngye wo n gyiwyei lo n kwnuce ń wo ɓa myi wa gwnu kwo m? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ntuge ń wa shi nyakwnu shnipa, to wa myi waa gwnù kwo m, əzahozahoyi n wa gye kwo, wo ɓa ci wo aɓo, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />woi gna, ‘Əza ye ɓə ya nyakwnu mi, ama to wa myi wa gwnù kwo m.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Kwo n a gna nge, əsu ncei pmalo wa lo okwnu n əsu ədoi. Wo taa sase shi nu kpa, wa gye kwo wo ɓa myi ń okwnusnu n əwo akwnuyii dugwu ngwnu-awo, n əsu ədoi, ń wo ɓe okwnusnu n woi n akwnuyii dugwu shiiba nyi m? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ngye wo taa myi m, wo ɓa fyi aza ɓa lo, ɓai shegwnu əsu dəyi, wo yee ɓe ń zokwo n kpaai, jesnu wo ɓə nya ogwuwnazhi zokwo əɓo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />N ɓwasnu lonu ce, zahozahoyi ń fye, ń wo to kwu nyahonyahoi fa ń wo ncei lo m, wo taa myi wa zhni əmi mwutuyi m.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Snakpegye n bmya, ama ń əkwo apmanya nla kwnuya, a ɓa zhni ń wunanu kwa je əkwo apmanya ɓwa a? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Kwo to n apmai lo ntu əknyi ɓo kwo fnyidakwulu m; a ɓa zè kwo ya nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">“Zahozahoyi ń wo n atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi əknyi ɓwuɓwui nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Nsayii agədu gwoyi n aleifyizhniyii ɓa ɓe ɓai yezhi ɓa kna Yeisu ɓəda tnubwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ama Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii ɓa da aɓəsnaanya, “Əza ye gwo aleifyizhniyi lo jesnu woi kwnu nyagyigyi n ɓai.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Nlonu Yeisu wa si ɓa ɓəsisi ye: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ń a gna nge əzaho lo ń fye n aknyii tagyi, ama gbmanyi n ɓa kwaa wo ɓwi. Wo taa fa ngwnu shiciwagbmanyi ncei ciwagbmanyi zhi ń bmana, wa vyi əknyi ɓwuɓwui yi apita, sai əsa n wa gye kwo əwye m? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nlonu she wo gye kwo əwye, wa la kwo tu n əwo agbegbegye n agbmadai <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />wa lo apyi. Nlonu wo yi əwo anugwnudo ɓədo n əwo akwnuzhiyii wa gna ɓa, ‘Fye dagbma n mii; mi la gye əmi əknyi ɓwuɓwui əwye.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mi gna fye nge, n ɓwasnu nlai nu dna n əshemi, n a ɓə nya agbmada n mwa ntu leifyizhniyi gbmanyi ɓo, n wa yeabwi n du aɓəfyeceyi shiiciwagbmanyi ncei ciwagbmanyi n ɓa to n abwuye apmai lo m.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi kəɓwo ɓwuɓwui nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Kwo n a gna nge, nyikwoza n gyiwye azulufa azhanai lo ngwnu-awo, gbmanyi kwaa wo ɓwi. Wo taa wna pyitila əná, wa fnyi pwuwa ya, wa zna kwo shni pəceye sai əsa n wa gye kwo əwye m? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Əsa ń wa gye kwo əwye ncei, wo ɓa yi əwo anugwnudo ɓədo n əwo akwnuzhiyii wa gna, ‘Fye nya agbmada n kwnusnu n mii; mi la əmi kəɓwo ɓwuɓwui gyewye.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />N ɓwasnu nlonu, mi gna fye, agbmada nya lo n Shekwoyi amaləka abye ntu leifyizhniyi gbmanyi ɓo n wa yeabwi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nugwnu ɓwuɓwui nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yeisu wa gyiabye: “Əza ɓə nyi n wo ɓə n anugwnui ngwnu-aba. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Əza nawyi wa gna əwo dada, ‘Dada, ga mi ənya n kwo ɓa si mi n əho nyaɓwa.’ Ntulonu waa əwo nyaɓwa gnaya ga ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />“Tó əsa kwa shna mwa m, nugwnu nawyii wa ye əwo anya fyi vnyanya n wo ɓə ncei n aba gbmanyi, wa wna əzna lo əknyido ń kpaai, jesnu dna n abaayi wa kwu əwo nyaɓwa zhniagbma fyi ń anyìgyi fasa nya. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Shi wo ɓə kwu nyahonyahoi zo wu, myikwnu nazhii kwa losa n əknyí yi vnyanya, waa lodna n əsnagyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ntulonu wa lo wa gwo tnutnu n əknyí yi da aba; wa tnu n woi n əwo ofwa, wa lo woo kpá abwulutu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Wo ɓə ncei pma wa gyi nyagyii ń abwulutu gyi nyi, ama to a ga wo nyahonyahoi m.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Shi wo ɓə ló əwohni ací, wa gna, ‘Əmi dada n atnutnuyi lo n mwa bəgyé ɓai gyi njesnu kwoi cezhi, ama mi dna nyi n ya, myikwnui wu mi! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mi ɓa laka ma jezelo da əmi dada mii gna wo: Dada, mi kwu leifyi zhni əshemi ɓədo n hoi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mi to ye kwnuce lo a yi mi nge əho nugwnu m; la mi gwo ngye gbmanyi n əho atnutnuyi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ntulonu wa laka n əznai wa lo da əwo dada.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Ama woi ye ɓe n zokwo n kpaai, əwo dada wa gye wo əwye, əwo snusnu kwa wna wo; wa bwusi lo da əwo nugwnu, wa shepma wo wa wna wo shi.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Nugwnu wa gna wo, ‘Dada, mi kwu leifyi zhni əshemi jesnu n hoi. Mi to ye kwnuce lo a yi mi nge əho nugwnu m.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />“Ama əwo dada wa gna atnutnuyi, ‘Fye kwu pye! Fye ɓe n əje manaii fya kpe wo. Fye dna wo ɓwanyinya jesnu fya fyi wo abwada. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Fye ɓe n nakwo bizhimii fya wu kwo. Yi fnawye jesnu ya nya agbmadanya. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ntuge əmi nugwnu ye ɓəə la fyí, ama nsaiye wo la wyewyeyi je ɓwa; wo ɓei la ɓwi, ama a la gye wo əwye.’ Ntulonu ɓa ya agbmada nya.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Aɓwazhilo, nugwnu dnagbmai ɓə tu n ofwa. Shi wo ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n pwuwai, wa wo ai gyianya jesnu ai nyanya. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Ntulonu wa yì zaknayi n atnutnuyi wa nya wo əɓo n kwo ɓə gnyi kwoi zhni. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Əho mado wo la zhi jesnu əho dada wo la nakwo bizhimi wu ntuge wo la zhi da wo n laafyiyai.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Əwo dnagbma wa gyi minagyi to wa ye lodna ɓo n pwuwa m. Ntulonu əwo dada wa gbmilo əbmyi wa tna wo aɓwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ama wa dna əwo dada ɓəgbe, ‘Shiawye! Aye ye vnyanya n mi laɓa mii zhni ho fyenu tnutnu nyi, jesnu mii too znu əho ɓəgbetu gna m. Dudulonu ho too shni mi, kwo əbwui ɓyiyi ga, nge mi nya agbmada ncei n kwnusnu n əmi anugwnudoi m, kpeekpe. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama she əho nugwnu ye, n wo kwu əho nyaɓwa zhniagbma fyi n akaluwa nyi, wa zhi apyi, ho la nakwo bizhimi wu wo!’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Əwo dada wa gna, ‘Əmi nugwnu, ho kwnusnu lo n mii n əsahosahoi, jesnu nyahonyahoi n mi ncei lo əho nya nu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ama kwo kwnuce lo ya nya agbmadanya jesnu ya dagbma, ntuge əho mado ye ɓə la fyí, ama wo n wyewyeyi lo njesnu; wo ɓə la ɓwi, ama a la gye wo əwye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyaknawnayi əwyebwida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi: “Nyaɓwayi ɓə nyi ń a ɓə zhni ai da əwo nyaknawnayi ɓo nge wo zhni əwo nyaɓwa agbma lo. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ntulonu wa yì wo dna ń mi jesnu wa nya wo əɓo, ‘Knyiɓei nu n mi wo tu ń əho tukwo a? Ga nyadokwu əho anyaaknawna nya, ntuge ho to ɓəye gwodu ha wna anyaakna m.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“Nyaknawnayi yi wa gna əwohni, ‘Mi ɓa zhni knyiyi nu nsaiye a? Əmi pwuwada gnyi woi gwo mi tnutnu nu. Mi to n akalái lo ń mi ɓa nu ofwa m, jesnu vnyinkwo wo mi lo n mi ɓá ɓanya nyi; <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />mi kpe əɓo ye lo ń mi ɓa zhni, nabai ń ma tna əmi tnutnu ɓo ń ya; aza ɓə gwo mi dna n əɓa apwuwa.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Ntulonu wa yì zahozahoyi ɓə ncei n wo ɓə n ətai shi əwo dagayi. Wa nya əza kpmisnuyi, ‘Ho n ətai shi əmi dagayi lo aknyi nu a?’<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Zaitu omi agalon tagyi-ciwagbmanyi.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">“Nyaknawnayi wa gna wo, ‘Gwoi əho əta nyakashi əpa, sase shi wolowolo haa kwo zè tagyi-anyi-cei-shiitnu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Nsayi wa nya əzabaayi, ‘Əhohni ncei shi aknyiyi nu a?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Alikama nyamwinya dugwu-gbmanyi.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Wa gna wo, ‘Gwo əho əta nyakashi əpa jesnu haa kwo zè tagyi-nyimwanyimwa.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Əwo dagayi wa kwu nyaknawnayi tnagaiciyazhniyi ci ntuge wo kwu cece gyifyi nya pya wu. Ntuge anyìda ɓa du abwuznagnada lo, n cece ń əɓa ɓəzhni n əɓa ajei. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Əmi nu gna fye, fye zhni apma n anyì nyaɓwai ntuge fya ɓwa anugwnudo ga əfyehni, nabai she kwo ɓə kwu zo, a ɓə gwo fye fyi ń aba nyalonyalo nya.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />“Əzadəhodəhoyi ń a ɓa myi a kpema wo ń aɓo aɓyiiɓyiyii, a ɓa myi a kpema wo n aɓo adnagbmai cè, jesnu əzadəhodəhoyi n wo ta zhni gaiciya lo n aɓo aɓyiiɓyiyii m, wo taa zhni gaiciya n aɓo adnagbmai m. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ntulonu ngye a too myi a kpema ho ntu anyì nyaɓwa aknawna ɓo m, nyika nu ɓa ga ho nyaɓwa hnihnii a? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Nlonu ngye ho to zhni gaiciya n əzado nyaɓwa ɓwashi m, nyika nu ɓa ga ho əhohni nyaɓwa?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Əzaho to lo ń wo ɓa myi wa zhni adagayi ngwnu-aba tnutnu m. Kwo wo wnu gbmanyi ənu, jesnu wa ye n zadəyii, kwo wo ɓa əwohni ga ń gbmanyi tnutnuzhni, jesnu wa ci zadəyi wyegba. Ho taa myi ha zhni Shekwoyi tnutnu hoi gwo gyiwye tnutnu zhni m.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />She Afarisiyi gyiwye yeyi, ɓə wo aɓo ye vnyanya, ɓa kwu zhi ɓai mi Yeisu awyeya. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Wa gna ɓa, “Əfye nu bmya əfyehni zhi ń aza awye, ama Shekwoyi kpe əfye adu əye lo. Ənya n azanyikwoci ga kwo mwamwa kwokwo, kwo zhni ənya asisi nya nu n Shekwoyi awyeba.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyawu ɓəɓe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“A ɓə zhni ai wunya tu Owa n Sheaɓəgwognayi nyai, nya əsa ń Yohana ɓəə ɓe. Ənya n kwo laka nsayi, nabagyi manai Shekwoyi əbemi nya nu ń a zhni kwo waazi lo, jesnu əzahozahoyi n əwohni mwákpe lo wa lodna n kwo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Kwo gna wo lo faafa əshemi ń əknyii ɓa duya, a fa ədo n nyaka gnagbagbai ho ɓa gbmiya n Owa nyi.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Zahozahoyi ń wa wumwula n əwo nyikwoi, waa la nyikwo ədo, wo kwu anagbái zhni, jesnu əza ń wa la nyikwo n wo kwu mwulawu, wo kwu anagbái zhni ce.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaɓwayi n Liyazurui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Nyaɓwayi ho ɓə nyi ń wo ɓə zhni woi kpe aje jebwàda n aje aluweluwei jesnu fyegyifyegyi woi gyianyì agbmada nya. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Nyaɓayi ɓə shi n əwo abwokwnumi əgbe, ai yi wo ge Liyazuru, ń acii kpe ń əwo nayi vnyanya, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />jesnu woi mwi wa gyi nyagyi ń kwo kaya zhi n nyaɓwayi tebwul nyi. Amwi nu ɓə zhni ɓai nyi əwo aci.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Əsa kwa ɓe, shi nyaɓayi yi ɓə fyí, amaləka ɓa ɓe ɓa la wo lo ncei n Ibrahim aba. Nyaɓwayi ce waa fyí, aa wo byi. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Dna n anapyi, aba n wo ɓə dna n azhnìgye nyi, wa kpe əwo əwye wu ń əshe wa gye Ibrahim ń kpaai ń Liyazurui ma wo tu. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ntulonu wa yì wo, ‘Dada Ibrahim, gye mi snusnu ha tnu ń Liyazurui wa da əwo ɓwanyi dna ń nuwna, wa to kwo ń əmi nyitala nabai kwa fu mi nyitala ntuge mi dna gnyi n azhnìgye nu ń əná ye.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Ama Ibrahim wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Nugwnu, pa nge dna ń əho anyìgyisa, ho ɓə kwu əho anyigbmada wo, ama Liyazuru wa gwo azhnìgye, ama nsaiye wo la atnazhni ɓwa ń ya, ama əho n kasnu ho dna ń azhnìgye nu. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Gbowo n dəyei, ɓwokwnu dnagbmai dnalo ń əyi atasni n əfyei, ń a taa myi a znu kwo gnana m, nabai aza yi ń ɓa ncei pma ɓa ɓe əfye aba, ń ɓa taa myi m, kwo zahozahoyi n wo ye wa laka wa piya ɓe əyi aba m.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ngye nlonu, mi gyi ho əwye, dada, tnu Liyazuru tnutnu wa lo əmi dada pwuwa, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ntuge mi n amajei lo ngwnu-atnu. Fa woo kwnù ɓa, nabai ń ɓa to ɓə ɓe azhnìgye aba ye ce m.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Ibrahim wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ɓa ń Mwusai lo n sheɓəgwognayii; ɓa kna ɓa tnubwa.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Wa gna, ‘Aawo, dada Ibrahim, ama n əza gbmi ń əfyi wa lo da ɓa, ɓa ɓá yeabwi.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Wa gna wo, ‘Ngye ɓa taa kna Mwusa tnubwa ń Sheaɓəgwognayii; kwo to ɓə kwnu ɓa awye, kwo əza wo laka ń əfyi wa lo da ɓa m.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Leifyi, Gaiciyaganunui, Tnutnuzhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi: “Anya ń ɓa zhni aza ɓa knyiabwonyi, ɓəshishi nu ɓa ɓe, ama owii n zahozahoyii ń wo nu zhni zokwo dna ń anya yi ɓe ncei nyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kwo ɓə ɓaa wo du aa wyigwokwuta gyidna wo ń bəgye, aa wo sheya dna ń shikwo, à fa ədo ń wo ɓa zhni zaknayi ń aɓyi ye wa cebwonyi nyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ntulonu fye kwu əwyewna əfyehni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Ngye əhozado kwo əho mapwi, wa zhni ho leifyi, gnaknyi wo, jesnu n wa yeabwi, kwu abwizo wo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />N wa bwu ho aɓwa ngwnu-tnaaba nu n nyipyei gbmanyi, jesnu aɓwa tnaaba wa jezeɓe da ho woi gna, ‘Mi la yeabwi,’ ɓəshishi nu ha zo wo abwi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Atnutnuloyi ɓa gna Dagayi, “Ɓe yi gaiciyaganunui!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ngye fye n gaiciyaganunui lo n ɓwasnu cewyi ngye musta byegye, fye ɓa myi fya gna gbaayi shnuwna ye, ‘La shiya jesnu haa shidna n shikwo,’ kwo ɓa vyi əfye ɓəgbetu.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Kwo ń a gna nge zaknayi ń əfye wo ń fyenui tu lo woi nu ofwa, kwo woi kna wo aknyi. Əsa ń wa zhi ofwa ncei, wo ɓa gna fyenu, ‘Ɓe ha sasetu ya kwnu nyagyi gyi’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Wo taa gna wo nu, ‘Zhni mi wyeshenyagyi, la əhohni ye nabai ha vyi mi ɓo ma gyi nyagyi jesnu ma sni; ń əkwo avnu hoi kpé nyagyi gyi jesnu hoi sni m’? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Wo ɓa sá fyenu ami ntuge wo kwu əɓo zhni ń a gna wo nge wo zhni nyi? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ntulonu əfyehni ce, əsa n fye kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi zhni ń a gna fye nge fye zhni nyi, fye gna, ‘Yi zhni atnutnuyi nu ń yi to kwnuce lo m; ya ɓwa əyi tnutnu nu zhni.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga anayiwnu nyasnayi ngwnu-awo kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Nsayii, Yeisu wa znazna dnalo ń əknyigna Samariya nya n Gəlilii, woi wna zokwo lo Urishelima. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Shi wo ɓə gnyi woi lodna ń zhigba, azanugbai ngwnu-awo ń ɓa ɓə ń nayiwnu nyasnai, ɓa ɓe da wo, ɓa kwu gnyiagnyi zhi n tagnyi <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />jesnu ɓa yi wo n bəgye kalái, “Yeisu, Dagayi, gye yi snusnu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Shi wo ɓə gye ɓa, wa gna, “Fye lo fyei wu əfyehni n apirisiti aba.” Nlonu shi ɓa ɓə lo, ɓa kwu kágna ɓwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Zaknayi ń əɓa, shi wo ɓə gye wo la kágna ɓwa, wa jezeɓe, woi ci Shekwoyi n bəgye kalá nyai. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Wa ɓe wa yashi ń Yeisu apita aba wa sa wo ami; wo ɓə zhni Samariyayi nu.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “A to ká aza gna ngwnu-awo nu vnyanya m? Azaje ngwnu-ciwagbmanyi n zhi ń nanu a? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Əzaho to jezeɓe wa ci Shekwoyi m, akpəge zhiɓeyi ye?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Nlonu wa gna wo, “Laka ha lo; əho gaiciyaganunui kwo la ho kágna.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi əbemi əkwo ɓeɓe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />N əwyihoi, Afarisiyi ɓə nya wo əɓo, əsa ń Shekwoyi əbemi ɓə ɓe ncei. Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Shekwoyi əbemi to ɓə ɓe ai gye kwo əwye nu m, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />kwo nge aza ɓə gna, ‘Kwo gnyi nyi ń ya,’ kwo, ‘Kwo gnyi nu ń ɓwayi m,’ ntuge Shekwoyi əbemi dnalo ń əfye atasni nu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Nlonu wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Əsa ɓe lo ń a ɓə wo fye əpwa ngye fye gye nyipyei gbmanyi n Əza Nugwnu anyipyei, ama fye to ɓə gye kwo əwye m. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Aza ɓə gna fye, ‘Wo gnyi nu ń ɓwaayi!’ Kwo, ‘Wo gnyi nyi ń ya!’ Fye to ɓə bwusi fyei vyi ɓa lo m. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ntuge Əza Nugwnu dna ń əwo nyipyei; kwo ɓə wu ngye əgbmanabmya nu, ń kwo bmyana manaa jesnu kwa la əná ya ń anyìbmana; kwa ya ń səpa gbmanyi kwaa gwoya lo ń səpa dəyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ama n kpmisnu, ɓəshishi nu, wo ɓə kwu azhnìgye, aɓo bəgyé nya kpa, jesnu cala ye kwoi la əwo aɓo na.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Ń ɓwasnu shi kwo ɓə nyì, fyi ń Nuhu anyipyei nyi, nlonu cè n kwo ɓə zhni fyi ń Əza Nugwnu anyipyei. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Aza ɓə laɓa ɓai gyi, ɓai sni, ɓai pa amwula jesnu ai ga ɓa ń amwula, nya nyipyei ń Nuhu ɓə lodna ncei n əya nuwnanya. Nlonu nuwna kwa kwnu-akpma jesnu kwa kwu ɓa wu vnyanya.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />“Kwo ɓə ɓwa wu nlai nu fyi ń Lotu anyipyei. Aza ɓə laɓa ɓai gyi, ɓai sni, ɓai si anya jesnu ɓai kwnu anya, ɓai bye anya jesnu ɓai mi anyakwnu. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ama n nyipyeii ń Lotu ɓə fa Sodom nyi, əná n solufoi kwa kwnuɓe ń əshemi kwa wu ɓa vnyanya.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Kwo ɓə ɓwa wu nlai nu ń nyipyeii ń Əza Nugwnu ɓə kpeya ɓe ncei nyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Dna n əwyi yi, əza ń wo tu lo ń əwo nyakwnusni, n nyaɓwai yafyi n əmi, wo to ɓə kashi lo nabai wo kwu ɓa m. N ɓwajesnu nlonu, əza n wo dnalo ń zhabwi wo to ɓə jezelo apyi ntu nyaho ɓo m. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Pa Lotu nyikwo ɓo! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Əza ń wo ye wa shi əwohni wyewyeyi, wo ɓa ɓwu kwo nuwna, jesnu əza ń wa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna, wo ɓə la kwo wnakna shi nu. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Mi gna fye, dna ń sukwoi, aza ngwnu-aba ɓə kpe ɓai wnagye kpe n gədo gbmanyi; ai shni zaknayi jesnu ai fa zaknayi tu. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Anyikwoza ngwnu-aba ɓə fyi ɓai gwo əwyi n kwnusnu, a ɓə la zaknayi ai fa gbmanyi dna. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Azanugbai ngwnu-aba ɓə fyi ń bmana, ai la zaknayi jesnu ai fa zaknayi gnyi.”]<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ɓa nyaɓo, “Ń knyi ɓwayi nu a, Dagayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Aba ń nayi fyifyiyi shi, abaayi nu ń agwulu yezhi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyigbayi gyimayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi ɓəsisi, nabai wa wu ɓa nge ɓa gwo ɓa zhniaduwa ciici jesnu to ɓa bmabwugba m. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Wa gna, “N əzhi ho, owadayi ɓə nyi ń wo to ɓə wo Shekwoyi ədna, kwo wa gye əwo anuwna ń aza aɓonubwozhnii m. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Nyigbayi ɓə dna ń əzhi yi ń wo ɓə la gyima, woi ɓe əwo aba woi tna wo əɓwa, ‘Gwo əmi ɓədá ga mi ń əmi nuwnuyi.’<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Kwaa əsa la to owadayi ye m. Ama n əwyihoi wa gna əwohni, ‘Kwo shikwonyi mi ta wo Shekwoyi ədna, kwo ma gye əmi anuwna ń aza ɓənubwozhnii m, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />dudulonu ntuge nyigbayi ye gna mi gnagna lo ciici, mi ɓa gwo əwa ɓədá ga wo, nabai ń wo taa je ɓe wa gyi mi ce m!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Dagayi wa gna, “Knatnubwa ha wo əɓo n owadayi tnagaiciyazhniyi da lo. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Shekwoyi taa ɓe n ɓədái ga əwo aza knyiknyiyi, ń ɓa ciɓwi kpe wo n nyipyei n sukwoi nyi m? Wo ɓa kwu ɓa fa zhi lonu? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Əmi nu gna fye, wo ɓa zhni ɓa ɓá ɓwa ɓədá n pyepyei. Dudulonu, əsa ń Əza Nugwnu ɓə jezeɓe, wo ɓə gye gaiciyaganunui ye nyi ń anyìi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi Afarisiyi nya n agədu gwoyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Aza yi ń ɓa ɓə n agwumyii ń əɓa ɓəfyecezhni jesnu ɓai ci əzahozahoyi wyegba nyi; Yeisu wa gna ɓa ɓəsisi ye: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Aza ngwnu-aba ɓə gwnulo Dagayipwuwa nabai ɓə zhniaduwa, zaknayi ɓə zhni Farisiyi nu, njesnu zabaayi gədu gwoyi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Farisiyi wa laka gnyi n əwo əɓwai wa zhniaduwa nge: ‘Shekwoyi, mi sa ho ami lo ntuge mi to wulo ngye azaje nu m; avyì, aɓənukwoizhniyi, anagbáizhniyi; kwo ngye gədu gwoyi ye nu m. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mi wnagbeshi anyipyei ngwnu-aba dna ń laadiɓwugyi, jesnu mii gbmi zaka nyahonyahoi nya n mi ncei lo.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Ama gədu gwoyi, wa laka gnyi n kpaai. To wa ye wa kpewyé wu n əshe m, ama wa znu agwu əɓwa wa gna, ‘Shekwoyi gye mi snusnu, mi zhni leifyizhniyi nu.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />“Əmi nu gna fye nge əza ye, toge əzadoyi m, wo ɓə laka n Shekwoyi awyeba wa lo əwo pwuwa ntna əɓəgyi n Shekwoyi aba. Ntuge aza vnyanya n ɓa mwa əɓahni tukwo, a ɓə gba ɓa, jesnu aza n ɓa gba əɓahni tukwo, a ɓə mwa ɓa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu n aɓyi anawyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Aza ɓə zhi ɓai ɓe Yeisu n aɓyii ce, nabai wa kpe ɓa əwo aɓwa. She amwutuyi ɓə gye dəye ɓa gnaknyi ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ama Yeisu wa yì aɓyi ɓe ncei ń əwo aba wa gna, “Fye fa aɓyi anawyi ɓa ɓe əmi aba, jesnu fye to nya ɓa ya m, ntuge Shekwoyi əbemi zhni əɓa pya nya nu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ɓəhnihni mi nu gna fye, zahozahoyi n wo taa gwo Shekwoyi əbemi ngye əɓyi nawyii m, wo to ɓə lodna ń kwo m nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyiwyeda jesnu n Shekwoyi əbemii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Əbegyiyi ho wa nya wo əɓo, “Nyawuyi manai, knyiyi nu zhni ɓəshishi n mi ɓa zhni mii ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyiyi nu zhni hoi yi mi nge əza manai a? Əza manai to lo m; akpəge Shekwoyi gbmanyi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ho kpe aɓəgbetu əye lo: ‘Ho taa zhni anagbái m, ho taa wu əza m, ho taa wyivyi m, ho taa gbmi əɓo katá nya m, ga əho dada mwamwa n əho əyai.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Wa gna, “Əɓa vnyanya ye, mi ɓə ya ɓa ɓwashi mi ye zhni əɓyikasa nu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />She Yeisu ɓə wo ɓə ye, wa gna wo, “Dudulonu ənya gbmanyi ye n hoi celo. Kwnu nyahonyahoi n ho ncei lo, jesnu ha kwu ga awyekwoyi, ho ɓə ɓwa nyaɓwayezhi n əshemi. Nlonu hoi ɓe, ha vyi mi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />She wo ɓə wo əɓo ye, wa ɓwa bwugbawnu n mwa, ntuge wo ɓəi zhni nyaɓwayi yaakwo nu. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yeisu wa shi wo awye jesnu wa gna wo, “Gye kwo dnaɓo lo gyiwyeda woi lodna n Shekwoyi əbemi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ɓəhnihni, kwo gna wo lo faafa lakwnumi kwa du n acibwa a fa əza n wo n nyaɓwai lo woi lodna n Shekwoyi əbemi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Aza ń ɓa ɓə wo əɓo ye ɓa nyaɓo, “To nyika nu ɓə pwo a?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əɓo ń kwo taa yezhni ń zanyikwocii m, kwo yezhni ń Shekwoyii.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Byitusu wa gna wo, “Yi kwu anya fa vnyanya ń yi ɓə ncei, yii vyi ho!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Gaiciya nu ń mi gna fye, əzaho to lo n wo la əwo pwuwa fa, kwo nyikwo kwo amajei n amapwii kwo azakwoi kwo aɓyi, ntu Shekwoyi əbemi ɓo, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />n wo to ɓə ɓwa n aɓwai mwa bəgyé ngye she wa fa nsnu dna ń cala ye, jesnu n cala dəyi ń kwo ɓəlo nyi; wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya m.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu da əwo əfyi əɓwa taayi əɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yeisu wa pmyi Awoceaba zhi n gnagna wa gna ɓa, “Yi gwnulo Urishelima nu, jesnu nyahonyahoi ń sheɓəgwognayi ɓə kwu kafyi ń Əza Nugwnu tukwo, kwo ɓə kwu nu. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />A ɓə la wo taya ga Abyedo, ɓa ɓə kpe wo agyè, ɓai knyi wo akpmi, ɓai knyiaknyi kpe wo; ɓai ɓyewoya ń knalufnyii jesnu ɓai la wo wu. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />N nyipyei tayii, wo ɓə je kala la.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Amwutuyi to ɓa ɓwa awyega ɓəhoɓəhoi nya n ɓəye m. Əkwo ɓətukwo ɓə sosoi ń əɓa awyeba jesnu to ɓa kpe əɓo ye n wo ɓə gnyi woi da m.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wyebwayi nyaɓayi gwo əwo wyebagye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Shi Yeisu ɓə wó vyivyiwyi n Jerikwoi, wyebwayi ɓə sase shi ń zokwogbe woi ɓanya. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Shi wyebwayi ye ɓə wo deeji kwoi duya ń əwo aba, wa nyaɓo ń kwo ɓə dnado. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Ɓa gna wo, “Yeisu Nazeretiyi nu duya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Wa sáwyi, “Yeisu Dawuda Nugwnu, gye mi snusnu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Aza ń ɓa ɓə gyi ń abye nyi, ɓa gnaknyi wo ɓa gna wo nge wo la cepyi, ama wa gna əwyi ɓeɓe nu, “Dawuda Nugwnu, gye mi snusnu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yeisu wa kpegnyi, wa ga əgbe nge a ɓe wo n əza yii. Shi wo ɓə ɓe vyivyiwyi, Yeisu wa nya wo əɓo, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Knyiyi nu n ho ye ma zhni ga ho a?” Wa dnaɓəgbe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Dagayi mi ye ma gyewyeba.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yeisu wa gna wo, “Gwo əho wyebagye, əho gaiciyaganunui kwo la ho kágna.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Nsayisayii, wa gwo əwo wyebagye jesnu wa vyi Yeisu, woi ci Shekwoyi. Shi aza vnyanya ɓə gye ce, əɓahni ce ɓa ci Shekwoyi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Zaka, gədu gwoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yeisu wa lodna ń Jerikwo woi duya. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Zanugbai ɓə gnyi n ɓo ai yi wo ge Zaka; wo ɓə zhni gədu gwoyi tukwoda nu, jesnu wo ɓə n nyaɓwai. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Wo ɓə ncei pma wa gye əza ń Yeisu zhni, ama ntuge wo ɓə zhni əza kpekpegyei nu, to wa myi m, ntu deeji ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ntulonu wa bwusi waa gyilo ń abye wa gwnutu ń gbaayi shnuwna nabai wa gye wo əwye, shikwonyi Yeisu ɓə ye wa duya ń zokwo yi nu.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />She Yeisu ɓə si abaayi, wa kpewyewu ń əshe jesnu wa gna wo, “Zaka, kashi ɓe nsaiye. Ɓəshishi nu mi ɓa shnidna ń əho pwuwa ń naiye.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ntulonu wa kashi ɓe n əsagbmanyii, wa gwo wo n agbmadai.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Shi aza vnyanya ɓə gye dəye, ɓa ya aɓəsnaanya da, “Wo dù wo shnidna n leifyizhniyi pwuwa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ama Zaka wa laka gnyiagnyi wa gna Dagayi, “Dagayi, gyewye! Gnyi n abaye jesnu nsaiye, mi ɓa ga awyekwoyi əmi nyaɓwa tokwnu, jesnu ngye mi la əzaho gyifyi n nyahonyahoii, mi ɓa gba wo kwo əta aɓwa ngwnu-anyi shikwonyi nsnu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yeisu wa gna wo, “N naiye, gnyignyi kwo la lo ɓe pwuwa ye, ntuge əza ye cè, wo zhni Ibrahim nugwnu nu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ntuge Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe nabai wa zna ənya ɓwuɓwui shni nu jesnu wa gnyi kwo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi amyinas ngwnu-awo nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai kna ɓəda ye tnubwa, wa gwodu wa gna ɓa ɓəsisi, ntuge wo ɓəə la wó vyivyiwyi n Urishelimai jesnu aza ɓə zhninubwo nge Shekwoyi əbemi ɓə ye kwa kpeya ɓe n əsagbmanyii nu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Wa gna, “Əbegyiyi ɓə lo əknyido n kpaai nabai a lo ai dna wo əbe jesnu woi jezezhi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ntulonu wa yì əwo atnutnuyi zhi ngwnu-awo, wa ga ɓa amyinas ngwnu-awo. Wa gna, ‘Fye zeaɓwa n gyiwye yei nya əsa ń mi ɓə jezeɓe ncei.’<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />“Ama əwo aknyida ɓə zhi n nuwnui nu n woi, ɓa tnu n azai ɓa vyi wo lo ɓa lo ɓə gna wo, ‘Yi to ncei pmalo əza ye wa gyibe tu ń yi m.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Dudulonu, a ɓə la əbe dna wo, jesnu wa jezezhi apyi. Nlonu wa tnu əwo atnutnuyi ɓo, aza n wo ɓə kwu gyiwye ga ɓa, nabai wa gye gyiba ń ɓa ɓəə kwu gyi n kwoi.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />“Əza kpmisnuyi wa ɓe wa gna, ‘Haamwasa, mi kwu gyiba gyi n əho myinai, amyina ngwnu-awo.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />“Əwo dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ho kwu zhni n bmya, əmi tnutnuyi manai! Ntuge ho la kwnuce a kpema ho ń əɓo ɓyiyi, gyibe tu ń azhi ayaakwo ngwnu-awo.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />“Əzabaayi wa ɓe wa gna, ‘Haamwasa, mi kwu gyiba gyi n əho myinai, amyina ngwnu-atnu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />“Əwo dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ho ɓa gyibe tu ń azhi ayaakwo ngwnu-atnu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Nlonu tnutnuyi ədo wa ɓe wa gna, ‘Haamwasa, əho myina n hoi shi nyi; mi ɓə la kwo pa dna ń əjeɓyii maa kwo soshi. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Əho ədna ɓə wo mi, ntuge əho əɓo n dnaɓo. Ho gbmi ənya aba ń ho to ɓə ya kwo dna m, jesnu ho dò ənya ń ho to ɓə bye m.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />“Əwo dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Mi ɓa da ho owa n əɓoi nu n kwa gbmi n əho əgbe, əho tnutnuyi əkpizhniyi! Ho ɓə kpe ho nya, nge mi zhni əza ɓədnai nu, mii gbmi ənya aba ń mi to ɓə ya kwo dna m, jesnu mii dò ənya ń mi to ɓə bye m? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />To knyiyi nu ɓə zhni to ha ya əmi gyiwye dna ń agyiwye dobwi, nabai əsa ń mi ɓə jezeɓe; n mi ɓə ɓa gwo kwo n gyibai tu ma a?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Nlonu wa gna aza n ɓa ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi vyivyiwyi n ɓo, ‘Fye la əwo myina gwo wo njesnu fyaa kwo ga əza ń wo ń amyinai lo ngwnu-awo nyi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />“Ɓa gna, ‘Haamwasa, wo ń amyinai shnisnu lo ngwnu-awo!’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Əmi nu gna fye nge, əza ń wo ncei lo, a ɓə ga wo ɓe, ama əza yi ń wo to n nyahoi lo m, kwo ənya n wo ncei lo a ɓə la kwo gwo wo. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ama əmi anuwnuyii n ɓa nu, n ɓa to ɓə ncei pma ma gyi əbe tu ń əɓa nyi m; fye ɓe n ɓai ń ya, jesnu fya wu ɓa ń əmi awyeba.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ɓe Urishelima n zhni əsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Shi Yeisu ɓə kwu ɓəye da, wa gyiabye, woi gwnulo Urishelima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Shi wo ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n Betifyeji ń Byetanii tu ń əpe kwnukwnù ń a yi kwo nge Zaitu əpe nyi, wa tnu əwo amwutuyi tnutnu əɓa ngwnu-aba woi gna, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Fye lo əzhi n kwo zhi ń əfye abye nyi, shi fye lofyi ń kwo, fye ɓə gye zhagawyi snáyi n gyignyi n ɓo, ədo ń əzaho too shni kwo gwnu m. Fye lo kwo fya ɓe n kwoi ń ya. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ń əzaho wa nya fye əɓo, ‘Knyiyi nu zhni fyei lo kwo a?’ Fya gna, ‘Dagayi n əkwo apmai lo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Aza yi ń a ɓə tnu ɓa tnutnu lo ń abye nyi, ɓa lo ɓa ɓwa wyegye shi wo ɓə gna ɓa nyi nu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Shi ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai lo zhagawyi snáyi, əkwo adagayi wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei lo zhagawyi snáyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi n əkwo apmai lo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ɓa ɓe n kwoi ń Yeisu aba, ɓa ta aje kpe ń zhagawyi jesnu ɓa la Yeisu tu ń kwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Shi wo ɓə lo n əznai, aza ɓa ta əɓa aje zhi n zokwo.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />She wo ɓə wó vyivyiwyi n abai ń zokwo shnilo ń Zaitu əpei nyi, deeji əwo amwutuyi nya vnyanya, ɓa ya agbmada nya ɓai ci Shekwoyi n abəgyei kwu wu ntu aɓo awowoyi ɓo vnyanya ń ɓa ɓəə kwu gyewye nyi:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Anabəlikada nu n əsui ń wo ɓe dna ń Dagayi əye nyi!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Bwugbafu ń əshemi jesnu n latui ń aba asnadadudui!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Afarisiyi ho n fyi ń deeji ɓa gna Yeisu, “Nyawuyi, gnaknyi əho amwutuyi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əmi nu gna fye nge ń ɓa kwu cepyi, akwuta ɓa ɓəwyi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Shi wo ɓə wó vyivyiwyi n Urishelimai, wa gye əzhiyaakwo yi, wa ciɓwi kpe kwo <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />jesnu wa gna, “Ngye əfye, kwo əfyehni n mi daɓo n fyei nyi; fye ɓə gna fya kwu kpe, nnaiye, ənya ń kwo ɓa ga fye bwugbafu; ama nsaiye, kwo ɓwuɓwui lo ń əfye awyeba. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Anyipyei ɓə ɓe kpe ń fye, əsa ń əfye anuwnuyi ɓə mi agəlu n shé fye gwnu ai znu fye fyi ń səpa dəhodəhoi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Ɓa ɓə lúfye ya zhi ń əknyi, əfye n əfye aɓyii ń ɓa fyilo n əfye gəlu mi. Ɓa to ɓə fa kwuta tu ń ədo əshe, ntuge fye to ɓə kpe əsa ye ń Shekwoyi ɓə ɓe əfye aba n gnyignyii m.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu dna n Dagayipwuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Shi Yeisu ɓə lodna ń Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, wa ya aza yi nyaya ń ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai kwnu anya nyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Wa gna ɓa, “A cei kafyilo, ‘Əmi pwuwa ɓaa zhni aduwazhni pwuwa nu,’ ama fye la kwo zè ‘azokwojeyi nyakwnu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Wyihowyihoi wo ɓə zhni woi wunya dna ń Dagayipwuwa. Ama apirisiti tukwoda, owa anyawuyi n aza atukwodai, ɓə zhi ɓai fa zhi nabai ɓa wu wo. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Dudulonu to ɓa ɓwa zokwo ɓa zhni ce m, ntuge aza vnyanya ɓə kpmima n əwo aɓədagbma nu.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">A nya Yeisu əwo ikwo ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />N wyihoi shi Yeisu ɓə dna woi wunya ń Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí jesnu woi zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya, apirisiti atukwoda ń owa anyawuyii ń kwnusnu n abyedai, ɓa ɓe da wo. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Ɓa gna, “Gna yi, n knyi ikwoi nu ń ho zhni aɓo ye ncei a, nyika nu na ga ho ikwo ye a?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əmihni ce mi ɓa nya fye əɓo. Fye gnà mi: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohana batizimazhni; kwo ɓə gbmi n əshemi nu, kwo əkwo ɓo ɓə pá n zanyikwoci nu a?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ɓa da kwo fyiaje ɓahniɓahni ɓa gna, “N ya gna, ‘N əshemi nu,’ wo ɓa nyaɓo, ‘Knyiyi nu zhni to fyehni ga wo gaiciya ma a?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ama ń ya gna, ‘Ń azanyikwoci aba nu,’ aza vnyanya ɓá knyi yi akwuta, ntuge ɓa ɓə kpe nge Yohana ɓə zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ntulonu ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi ta kpe aba lo n kwo ɓə gbmi m.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yeisu wa gna, “Əmihni ce, mi taa gna fye, kwo n knyi ikwoi nu n mi zhni aɓo ye ncei m.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi afwaɓayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Wa gwodu wa sí aza ɓəsisi ye: “Əza ɓə n anamzhnii dna, waa kwo ga afwaɓayi ho, wa lo aba, waa mwasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />N afwanyakwu əsai wa tnu əwo tnutnuyi ń afwaɓayi aba, nabai ń ɓa ɓə ga wo anam agyigyiyi ho. Ama afwaɓayi ɓa lu wo jesnu ɓaa wo jezeya lo ncei ń aɓwa gbəloi. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Wa tnu tnutnuyi ədohoi, ama əwohni ce, ɓa lu wo, ɓa zhni wo avnyinkwo ɓo, jesnu ɓaa wo jezeya lo ncei ń aɓwa gbəloi. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Wa dù wa tnu ń əza taayii, ɓa kwu wo kpe aci jesnu ɓaa wo gbmiya n ofwa yi.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />“Nlonu anamzhni ofwada wa gna, ‘Knyiɓei nu ń mi ɓa zhni a? Mi ɓa tnu n əmi nugwnui, əza ń mi ye wo; kpesnu ɓa ɓə ga wo mwamwa.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />“Ama she afwaɓayi ɓə tawye ɓa gye wo, ɓa kwu əgbepa. Ɓa gna, ‘Əza ye nu zhni əgwúgyiyi, fye ɓe ya wu wo əgwú ɓə la zè əyi nya.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ntulonu ɓa gbmi wo ya gnyi n anamzhni ɓa wu wo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“To, anamzhni ofwada ɓə zhni ɓa knyiyi nu a? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Wo ɓə ɓe, woi wu afwaɓayi ye, jesnu woi la anamzhni ofwa ga azaje.” She aza ɓə wo ɓəye, ɓa gna, “Shekwoyi wo pəiceya!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yeisu wa ce ɓa awye ceewo wa nyaɓo, “To knyiyi nu zhni əɓo ye awyega ń kwo kafyilo nyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“ ‘Kwuta ń anyakwnumiyi ɓə la əkwo aɓo na nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">əkwo nu la zè ɓwakwonu kwuta a’?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Əzahozahoyi ń wa myiya tu ń kwuta yi, wo ɓaa bmaya wyiwowyiwo; əza ń kwa kaya tu ń wo, wo ɓaa vyiya dugwudugwu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Owa anyawuyi ń apirisiti atukwodai ɓa zna zokwo shni nabai ɓa wna wo nsayisayii, ntuge ɓa ɓə kpe nge wo sí ɓəsisi ye tu ń əɓa tukwo nu. Ama ɓa kwu wo aza ədna.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gədu kwnu ga Kaisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ɓa kwu laɓa ɓai ka wo əwye, ɓa tnu abawyeka-fyaayi tnutnu, ɓa kwu əɓahni zè ngye aza agaiciyada. Ɓa ɓə n awyei tu nge ɓa wna Yeisu nu ń ɓəho ń wo ɓa da, nabai ɓa ta wo ya ga gwomna kalá ɓədo n əwo ikwoi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Ntulonu abawyeka-fyaayi ɓa nya wo əɓo: “Nyawuyi, yi kpəlo nge ho daɓo jesnu hoi wu əɓo ń kwo bmya, ho ta wu kakayi m, ama ho wu Shekwoyi zokwo n kwo lodo n gaiciyanunui nyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Kwo wulo ceewo a gba Kaisa gədu kwo a to gba ma?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Wa kwu əɓa kwocedna gyewye ntulonu wa gna ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Fye wu mi denari. Nyika dogbe nu tu ń kwo n nyakai a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Kaisa nya nu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Wa gna ɓa, “Nlonu fye ga Kaisa ənya ń kwo zhni Kaisa nya, jesnu Shekwoyi, ənya n kwo zhni Shekwoyi nya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ɓa to ɓə myi ɓa wna wo dna n əɓo n wo ɓəə kwu da gnyi ń bəgyé nyi m. Ntuge əwo ɓəgbedna ɓə la ɓa ga ɓəwowo, ɓa kwu cepyi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əfyikalakwu jesnu n amwulapai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Azaho n Asadusiyi, ń ɓa gna nge əfyikalakwu to lo nyi m, ɓa ɓe Yeisu aba n ɓənyai. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Ɓa gna, “Nyawuyi, Mwusa ɓə kwu ka ga yi nge, n əza dnagbma wa fyí jesnu wa fa əwo nyikwo gnyi ntna aɓyi, nge ɓəshishi nu əza yi wa la nyigbayi nabai wa ɓwa əɓyi ga əwo dnagbma. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Nsayii, aza ɓə nyi ngwnu-tnaaba, ɓai kwnu n əyàmi gbmanyi. Əza kpmisnuyi wa la nyikwo waa fyí ntna əɓyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Əzabaayi <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />njesnu, əza taayi waa wo la, kwa ɓwa vyilo nlonu əɓa tnaaba, ɓa kwu fyí ntna əɓyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />N kpmasnu nyikwoza yi ce waa fyí. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />To, nsaiye, dna n əfyikalakwu əsa wo ɓə zhni nyika nyikwo nu a, shikwonyi əɓa tnaaba ɓa ɓə kwu amwula pa n woi nyi a?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Aza cala ye nya, ɓa pa amwula lo jesnu ai kná ɓa amwula. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ama aza ń a kwu gye ɓa kwnuce, ɓai ɓwa aba ń anyì dəyi n ɓa ɓə lo nyi, jesnu dna ń əfyikalakwu əsa ń əfyi, ɓa to ɓə pa amwula ai gna nge a kná ɓa amwula m, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />jesnu ɓa to ɓə shna fyí m; ntuge ɓa ɓə kwu zè ngye amaləka nu. Ɓa zhni Shekwoyi aɓyi nu, shikwonyi ɓa zhni aɓyi akalakwu nya nu n əfyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ama dna ń zhabwi ənagyi nabagyi, kwo Mwusa ɓə kwu wu nge afyífyiyi zhni ɓa kwukala. Ntuge wo ɓə yi Dagayi, ‘Shekwoyi Ibrahim nya, n Shekwoyi Ishakwu nyai ɓədo n Shekwoyi Yakwuɓwu nyai.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Wo to zhni Shekwoyi afyífyiyi nya nu m, ama aza n ɓa zhi n wyewyeyii nyi, ntuge ń əwo aba, aza vnyanya n wyewyeyi lo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Azaho n owa anyawuyi ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Nyawuyi, ho kwu ɓəda n bmya!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Njesnu əzaho to ɓə shna myi wa nya wo ɓəhoɓəhoi m.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyika nugwnu nu n Masifu a?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni ai gna nge Kirisiti zhni Dawuda nugwnu nu a? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dawuda ń əwohni tukwoi, wo ɓə la znuya dna n əpakashi Anyiasasayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“ ‘Dagayi ɓə gna əmi Dagayi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">“La sasetu n əmi ɓwaizhe ɓwa<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />nya əsa ń mi ɓə zhni əho anuwnuyi ɓa kwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">zè əho apitakpeba.” ’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dawuda yi əwo nu ge ‘Dagayi.’ Kwo ɓa zè n wunanu, waa zè əwo nugwnu a?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwnùkwnù ntu n owa anyawuyi ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Shi aza vnyanya ɓə zhi ɓai knatnubwa, Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Fye zhni pəceye n owa anyawuyi. Ɓa ye ɓa zna laɓa n aje ayaakwoi kpe jesnu ɓa ye a ɓyi ɓa əgna zhi n adubayaakwo n mwamwagai, jesnu a ga ɓa asasekpeba adnagbmai fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu n aba mwamwa nyai n awyefnaba. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Ɓa losa anyigbayi apwuwa ɓa pmyi ɓa wu əɓahni n aduwazhni akpamwai. A ɓə tá aza ye pya ń əwyei bmyibmyii.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Nyigbayi nyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Shi Yeisu ɓə kpewyewu, wa gye anyaɓwayi ɓai ya nyaga fyi ń Dagayipwuwa nyaɓwasofyiba. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Wa gye nyigbayi wyekwoyi ce woi ya sisinkəɓwo azhnanai ngwnu-aba fyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Wa gna, “Gaiciya əmi nu gna fye, nyigbayi wyekwoyi ye wo kwu nyaga yafyi n du azaje vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Aza ye vnyanya ɓa knyiknyi nu ń əɓa nyaɓwa ɓanyi ga; ama əwo, dna n əwo awyekwo, wo kwu ga, ənya vnyanya ń wo ncei lo, wa gyianyì ncei.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dagayipwuwa agbmazhni n əznù əsa kpmaknai nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Azaho n əwo amwutuyi, ɓə zhi ɓai da shi a ɓə n Dagayipwuwai zhni nyigwnu gnyi, n akwuta amanai n anyagai, n a ɓə kwu ɓa gyigbe ga Shekwoyi. Ama Yeisu wa gna, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Anya n fye gye ń ya nyi, əsa ɓe lo, ń a to ɓə fa kwuta tu ń ədo əshe m; dəhodəhoi n ɓa, a ɓə la kwo shniya shi n əknyi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ɓa nyaɓo, “Nyawuyi, aɓo ye ɓə zhni n knyi əsai nu a? Jesnu knyiyi nu ɓə zhni əznù nge ɓa ye ɓa zhni nu a?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye la əwye ka nabai ń a taa dna fye kwoce m. Ntuge bəgyé ɓə ɓe fyi n əmi əye, ɓai gna, ‘Əmi nu zhni əwo,’ jesnu, ‘Əsa n la wo vyivyiwyi.’ Fye to ɓə vyi ɓa m. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />She fye ɓə wo akwnusnu anabagyi, n gbuzuii, fye to ɓə wodna m. Aɓo ye n ɓa nyi, kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ɓai kwu zhni kpa, ama anyi zozo əsa to ɓə ɓe nsayisayi m,”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa: “Əbyé ɓə laka da əbyé, jesnu əbemi ɓə laka da əbemi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Əknyi ashnashna yaakwo ɓə zhni laɓa, myikwnu kəsnu dnagbmai ɓə gwnu n anyasnai ń abai gbowogbowo jesnu aɓo adnawo nya ɓədo n aznù ayaakwoi ɓə kwnuɓe n əshemi.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />“Ama to aɓo ye vnyanya ɓai zhni m; ɓa ɓə wna fye, ɓai zhni fye awyesnugbegye əɓo, ɓa ɓə kwu fye taya ga Ayahudiyibwokwnu, ɓai kwu fye fyi n zhalu, jesnu a ɓə ɓe n fyei n asu aba ɓədo n agwomnai, a ɓə zhni fye aɓo ye vnyanya ntu əmi əye ɓo nu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ntucenu fye ɓə kwu zhni əmi aɓəgbmiyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ama fye ɓəə la bwugba dna akalá, to fyei kwu zhi n aɓəsai shi fye ɓə gnyi əfyehni m. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Ntuge mi ɓə ga fye ɓədagbma ɓədo n wyemwai ədo ń əfye anuwnuyi to ɓə myi ɓa na kwo aɓo kwo ɓa gbmi kwo aje m. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Əfye azakwoi, amajei, amapwii, əbye ɓədo n anugwnudoi, ɓa ɓə ɓwu fye jesnu ɓa ɓə kwu azaho wu n əfye atasni. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Aza vnyanya ɓə wnunu n fyei, ntu əmi ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ama əfye tukwoyi gbmanyi to ɓə ɓwunuwna m. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Fye ɓəə kwu myizhi n kalái, fye ɓə ɓwa wyewyeyi.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“She fye ɓə gye akwnuyi ɓa kwu shegwnu Urishelima, fye ɓə kpe nge əkwo agbmazhnisa kwo la wo vyivyiwyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Nlonu fa aza yi n ɓa fyi ń Yahuda əknyi, ɓa ɓə bwusi lo ape, aza yi ń ɓa fyi ń əzhiyaakwo ɓai kwnuya, jesnu aza ń ɓa fyi ń azhigba, ɓa to ɓə lofyi n əzhiyaakwo m. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ntuge əsa ye gnyi n zhni tata nya nu, kwoi nu aɓo vnyanya ń a cei kafyilo. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Anyipyei yi ɓə zhni ədna nya nu ń anubwoda aba n aɓyiya dai! A ɓə gyeazhnì yaakwo dna ń əknyii jesnu minagyi napyei kpe ń aza ye. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />A ɓə wu azaho n əbeyaakwoi jesnu ai kwu ɓa n zhni azhaluda lo ncei ń abye vnyanya aba. Abyedo ɓə la Urishelima dnaya, nya əsa n Abyedo asa ɓə kwu nu.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“A ɓə gye aznù n nyipyei, n əpyai n akpasii. Fyi ń anyì, abye ɓə kwu fyi ń azhnìgye yaakwoi ɓa ɓə kwu jeje ntu ń shikwo aɓəci ɓo n əkwo anuwnadokwoi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Aza ɓə ceafyi ntu azhnìgye yaakwo ɓo, ɓai kwu laɓa kəpmuu to ɓai kpe əɓo ye n kwo ɓəlo tu n anyì m, ntuge a ɓə je anya ashna ń ɓa nyi ń əshebmana nyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Dna n əsayii, ɓa ɓə gye Əza Nugwnu woi ɓe dna n ənyì n kalái ɓədo n latu yaakwoi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />She aɓo ye ɓə ya zhni, fye ɓə la fyehni ye fya kwu myizhi, ntuge əfye gnyignyi kwo la wo vyivyiwyi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Wa da ɓa ɓəsisi ye: “Fye ka gbaayi shnuwna əwye jesnu ń ashnuwnai vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />She ɓa kpmi afnyitolo, fye ɓa gye n əfyehnii, jesnu fya kpe nge gbmama n la wo vyivyiwyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ntulonu, she fye ɓə gye aɓo ye ɓai zhni, fya kwu kpe nge Shekwoyi əbemi kwo la wo vyivyiwyi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, cala ye taa duya m akpəge aɓo ye vnyanya ɓa kwu zhni. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Əshe ń əknyii ɓa ɓə la duya, ama əmi aɓədagbma taa duya m nanyinanyi.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Fye zhni pəceye, ntolonu m, əfye adu ɓə kwu woshna fyi n agbmada anyìgyi, n nyasnii ɓədo n aɓəsai anyìgyi nya, jesnu nyipyei yi kwoi ɓe n əsagbmanyi to fyei dnace m. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Ntuge kwo ɓə ɓe kpe ń aza ń ɓa fyilo ń anyì vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Fye kwu zhigwu ciici, jesnu fya zhniaduwa nabai ń fye ɓə myi fyei kwu pwo aɓo vnyanya ń ɓa ye ɓeɓelo nyi, jesnu n fye ɓə myi fyei gnyiagnyi zhi ń Əza Nugwnu abye.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Nyipyei dəhodəhoi Yeisu ɓə zhni woi wunya dna ń Dagayipwuwa, jesnu n wyeshe dəhodəhoii wa gbmiya lo Zaitu əpe kwnukwnù waa gyifye tu n ɓo, <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />jesnu aza vnyanya ɓa ɓe n labmii ntuge ɓa kna wo ɓəda tnubwa dna ń Dagayipwuwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yahuda wo la ye wa ɓwi Yeisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Nsaiye Awyefna Biledi Tnayisti nya, ń a yi kwo Gnanaznu nyi, kwo ɓəə la wo vyivyiwyi, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />jesnu apirisiti atukwoda n owa anyawuyii, ɓa ɓə laɓa ɓai zna zokwo ho shni ɓa wu Yeisu, ntuge ɓa ɓə wo aza ədna. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Nlonu Shetam wa lodna n Yahuda, ń a ɓə yi wo nge Iskariyoti nyi; zaknayi dna n Awoceaba yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Nlonu Yahuda wa lo da apirisiti atukwoda n Ayahudiyibwokwnu gwuyi atukwodai, wa kwuaɓoaje n ɓai, shi wo ɓa ɓwi Yeisu n wu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />A da ɓá jesnu ɓa kwu ye nge ɓa ɓá ga wo gyiwye. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Waa ye jesnu wa laɓa woi dna əsa wye n kwo ɓa bmya wa ta Yeisu ya ga ɓa to deejii zhi m.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wyeshenyagyi kpmaknayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Nlonu Awyefna nyipyei Biledi Tnayisti nya kwa ɓe, əwyi ń a wu Gnanaznu kwugyasnáyi nyaga ncei nyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yeisu wa tnu Byitusu n Yohanai, woi gna, “Fye lo fyei zhniaba aba ga yi ń yi ɓa gyi Gnanaznu nyagyi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ɓa nyaɓo, “Ho ncei pma yii zhniaba aba əkwo nya n nanu a?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Shi fye lofyi n əzhiyaakwo, əza n nuwna nyikwnui tu, wo ɓə shegwnu fye. Fye vyi wo lo pwuwa n wo ɓəə lodna n kwo nyi, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />jesnu fye gna pwuwada, ‘Nyawuyi nyaɓo lo: Zhiɓeyi nyakwnu gnyi ń nanu, aba ń mi ɓa gyi Gnanaznu nyagyi n kwnusnu ń əmi amwutuyii a?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Wo ɓə wu fye nyakwnusniyi dnagbmai ncei zhniaba gnyi n nunui. Fye zhniaba aba n ɓo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ɓa kwuka, ɓa lo ɓa gye aɓo n ɓwasnu shi Yeisu ɓə gna ɓa nyi. Ntulonu ɓa zhni Gnanaznu nyagyi ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />She əsa ɓə si, Yeisu ń əwo amwutuyii ɓaa kpmima n tebwul. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Jesnu wa gna ɓa, “Mi ɓə ncei pma ma kwnu Gnanaznu nyagyi gyi n fyei ń əwyei bmyibmyiyi, ma kpé azhnìgye. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ntuge mi gna fye, mi to ɓə ye je kwo gyi m, sai əsa ń əkwo ɓətukwo ɓə kwu nu dna ń Shekwoyi əbemi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Shi wo ɓə la bwoɓyi la shi, wa sa Shekwoyi ami jesnu wa gna, “Fye gwo dəye fya gna kwo ya ga aje. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ntuge mi gna fye, mi to ɓə ye je anam wnunuyi gyigyii ye sni m, akpəge Shekwoyi əbemi kwo la ɓe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Njesnu wa la biledi, wa saami jesnu wa sa kwo ya, wa ga ɓa kwo woi gna, “Dəye nu zhni əmi nayi ń a la ga ntu əfye ɓo; fye zhni dəye fyei pa əmi əɓo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />N ɓwasnu lonu, shi ɓa ɓə kwu pwo wyeshenyagyi gyi ɓo, wa la bwoɓyi shi, woi gna, “Bwoɓyi ye nu zhni ɓəgbeshi woiwoyi dna n əmi ami, ədo ń a la zeya ntu ń fye ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ama əza ń wo ye wa kwnu mi nyi, wo n əɓwai kwnudna lo n mii tu ń tebwul ye. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Əza Nugwnu ɓa lo ngye shi a ncei znutu lo ń wu nu, ama owii n əza yi aba ń wo ɓwu wo nyi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ɓa ya aje aɓonya əɓahniɓahni kwo nyika nu n ɓa n wo ye wa zhni ɓəye a?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Aɓənakpeaje ɓa laka fyi n əɓa atasni, kwo nyika nu, ń ɓa, n a zhninubwo nge əwo nu ɓə la zhni əza duduyi a. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Asu Abyedo nya zhni adagayi nu kpe n əɓa aza; jesnu aza yi n ɓa gyi əbe kpe n əɓa tukwo nyi, ɓa yi əɓahni nge Azabmazhniyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama əfyeeda fye taa zhni nlonu m. N əkwo əɓwi, əza yaakwo duduyi ń əfye atasni wo ɓaa zè ngye əɓyi nawyii, jesnu əza ń wo gyi əbe ngye əza ń wo zhni tnutnuyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ntuge nyika nu gna yaakwo zhni lo a, əza nu n wo sasetu n tebwul woi gyi nyagyi nyi, kwo əza n wo gna nyagyi nyi a? Əza nu to ń wo sasetu n tebwul nyi m? Ama mi dnalo ń əfye atasni ngye əza ń wo zhni tnutnuyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Əfye nu zhni aza yi ń fye kwu gnyiagnyi zhi n mii dna n əmi mwimwi. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Mi ga fye əbemi nu, n ɓwasnu shi əmi Dada ɓə dna mi əbemi n akwnu nyi, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />nabai ń fye ɓə gyi, fyei sni kpe n əmi tebwul fyi n əmi əbemi jesnu fyei sase kpe n abeshnikpegye, fyei da Israila abye awoceaba owa.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Sima, Sima, Shetam wo kwu əfye əɓo nya nabai wa pye fye ya vnyanya ngye alikama. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ama mi kwu aduwazhni ntu əho ɓo, Sima, nabai to əho gaiciyaganunui kwoi gbakalá m. Jesnu shi ho ɓə la awye je pmyiɓe da mi, ɓə fyi əho azaje akalá nabai ɓa kwu myizhi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ama wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi, mi n mihnii yeyei lo, ma kwnu zhalu lo n hoi, jesnu ma fyí n kwnusnu n hoi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əmi nu gna ho Byitusu, pisenugba ɓə snu ń kwo cekwu n naiye, hoi la əmi yekpé aɓəna aɓwa ngwnu-ata.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Nlonu Yeisu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “She mi ɓə tnu fye tnutnu ntna lagyiita, gwnuma kwo abwada, fye ɓə kwu gyi nyaho sna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Aawo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Wa gna ɓa, “Ama nsaiye, ngye əza n lagyiitai lo, wo la kwo la, n gwnumai ce; jesnu n ho to n əbeyakwoi lo m, kwu əho aje əbmyi nya kwnu, nabai ha si əbeyakwo gbmanyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />A cei kafyilo: ‘A ɓə n woi ba dna ɓədo n aleifyizhniyii’; njesnu mi gna fye nge ɓəshishi nu dəye kwa nu tu n əmi tukwo. Əə, əɓo n kwo kafyilo ntu əmi ɓo, kwo gnyi kwoi si əkwo nunusa nu nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Amwutuyi ɓa gna, “Gyewye, Dagayi, abe ayaakwo shi nyi ngwnu-aba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo la kwnu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu zhniaduwa tu Zaitu əpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yeisu wa gbmiya lo Zaitu Əpe shi wo zhni wa shnizhni nyi, jesnu əwo amwutuyi ɓa vyi wo. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />She wo ɓə si abaayi, wa gna ɓa ge, “Fye zhniaduwa nabai n fye taa kaya fyi n mwumwu m.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Wa lo n əkpai fyeewyi, wa ceakwokwo shi wa zhniaduwa, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Dada, ngye əho ɓəye nu, akpəge ho la bwoɓyi ye la mi ya; dudulonu toge əmi ɓəye m, ama əho nya nu kwo zhni.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Maləka wa gbmi ń əshemi wa kpeya da wo, wa fyi wo akalá. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Jesnu woi dna gnyi n azhnìgye, wa gna aduwa zhnizhni n əwyei bmyibmyii, jesnu əwo amisa ɓa gbiya zhi n əknyi ngye ami kwolo.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />She wo ɓə laka n aduwazhni aba, wa jezeɓe da əwo amwutuyi, wa gye ɓa zhi ɓai wnagye, n ɓəɓei zhi ntu n bwugbawnu ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei wnagye a? Fye kwukazhi fya zhniaduwa nabai n fye taa kaya fyi n mwumwu m.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A lá Yeisu wna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Woi ye gnyi woi daɓo, deeji kwa yezhi jesnu əza ń a yi wo ge Yahuda nyi; gbmanyi n Awoceaba yi, waa gyiabye, anuwnuyii vyi wo. Wa yegwu Yeisu nabai wa she aɓwa pma wo nugwnudo nya pya, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />ama Yeisu wa nya wo əɓo, “Yahuda, ho kwnu Əza Nugwnu ngye nugwnudo nu?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />She Yeisu amwutuyi ɓə gye əɓo n kwo ɓə ye kwa zhni nyi, ɓa da ge, “Dagayi, kwo yi zhniapma n əyi abe yaakwo a?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Jesnu zaknayi n əɓa, wa znu pirisiti dnagbmai fyenu ənya, waa tnubwa ɓwaizhe nya ka wo ya.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ama Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe ge, “Fye to je əɓəye zhni m!” Jesnu wa to əza yi tnubwa ɓwa, wa ká wo gna.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna apirisiti tukwoda, n Dagayipwuwa abagwuyi atukwodai, ɓədo n abyedai, ń ɓa ɓəə kwu ɓe zhi ntuge ɓa wna wo nyi, “Mi zhni kalákpei tukwoda nu, n fye gnyi fyei ɓe da mi n abeyaakwoi n abwusii? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei nyipyei dəhodəhoi dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, fye to ɓə wna mi n əsa yi m. Ama əfye əsa nu gnyi nyi; ń wyegbma gyibe ncei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu na Yeisu aɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Nlonu ɓa wna wo, ɓa lo n woi n pirisiti dnagbmai pwuwa. Byitusu wa lo woi vyi wo ń tagnyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />She azaho n abaayi, ɓə kwu əná fnyizhi n ashilagyí akpeda atasni, ɓai kwu sase zhi, Byitusu waa sase shi ɓədo n ɓai. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ɓyinyikwoyi tnutnuyi ho, wa gye wo sase shi n əná aba. Wa shi wo awye byiwuu wa gna, “Zanugbayi ye ɓə kwnusnu n woi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ama wa na kwo aɓo. Wa gna, “Nyikwoza, mi ta kpe wo ye lo m.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Əsa fyewyi ce, əzado wa gye wo əwye jesnu wa gna, “Əhohni ce, ho ɓə kwnusnu n ɓai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zanugbayi, əmi nu to m!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />A ɓwa əsa ngye snukna gbmanyi əzado ce wa je kwo əgbemyi, “Ɓəhnihni, əza ye ɓə kwnusnu n woi, ntuge wo zhni Gəliliyi nu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zanugbayi, mi ta kpe əɓo ye lo n ho gnyi hoi da m, kpeekpe!” Woi ye ɓwagnyi woi daɓo, pisenugba kwa cekwu. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Dagayi wa pmyiawye shi Byitusu ceewo. Nlonu Byitusu wa pa ɓədagbma n Dagayi ɓəə kwu da ga wo nyi: “Pisenugba ɓə snu n kwo cekwu n naiye, hoi la əmi yekpé aɓəna aɓwa ngwnu-ata.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Nsayi wa gbmiya lo əbmyi wa ciɓwi bwugbazhii nya.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagwuyi kpe Yeisu agyè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Aza n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai gwu Yeisu nyi, ɓa ya wo agyèkpe jesnu ɓai lu wo. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Ɓa kwu aje wna wo n əwo awyeba njesnu ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Da sheɓəgwogna! Nyika nu naa znu ho ənya a?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Jesnu ɓa gna wo aɓəda nukwoi aje n mwa bəgyé.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gnyi ń Byilatusu abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />She əfye ɓə gyi zhi, bwokwnu abyeda, apirisiti atukwoda n owa anyawuyii, ɓa yezhi ń abagbmanyi, ɓa ɓe n Yeisui ń əɓa abye. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Ɓa gna ge, “Ngye ho zhni Kirisiti nu, gna yi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ń ma gna fye, fye taa ga mi gaiciya m, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />jesnu, ń ma nya fye əɓo, fye taa ɓwa kwo agbma m. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ama ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo abye, Əza Nugwnu ɓə sasetu n Shekwoyi Ikwoda Duduyi ɓwaizheɓwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Əho nu zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye kwu da nge əmi nu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nlonu ɓa gna, “Yi zhi yii ye pmi knyi ɓəgbmii nu n shnasnu a? Yi kwu kwo wo ń əwohni əgbe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Nlonu azadogwnu vnyanya ɓa kwukazhi agnyi, ɓa la wo lo ncei n Byilatusu aba. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Ɓa ya wo aɓəkpe, ɓai gna, “Yi la əza ye wna woi wnu əyi əknyi ya, woi gna, a to gba Kaisa gədu m, jesnu woi yi əwohni nge Kirisiti, əsu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Nlonu Byilatusu wa nya Yeisu əɓo, “Əho nu zhni Ayahudiyi əsu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu da lonu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Nlonu Byilatusu wa dnawyi ga apirisiti atukwoda ɓədo n deejii, “Mi too ɓwa əɓo n a ɓa shiɓwa a da owa n əza yei m.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ama ɓa kwu gyìma, “Wo la aza abwugba kwukazhi agnyi n əwo nyawui dna n Yahudiya vnyanya. Wo ɓə ya kwo dna n Gəlili nu, nsaiye wo la ɓe n ya.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />She Byilatusu ɓə wo əɓo ye, wa nyaɓo ngye əza ye zhni Gəliliyi nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />She wo ɓə kwu wo nge Yeisu ɓə gbmi n Hiridusu əknyi nu, wa tnu n woi n Hiridusu aba, n wo ɓə dna ń Urishelima nsayii ce nyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />She Hiridusu ɓə gye Yeisu əwye, a da wo n mwa, ntuge əsa ɓəə la mwa ń wo ɓə ncei pma wa gye wo əwye. Ntu aɓo ɓo ń wo ɓə kwu wo tu ń əwo tukwo nyi, wo ɓə ń awyetui wa gye wo woi zhni əznù ho. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Wa nya wo aɓo n mwa bəgyé, ama to Yeisu wa dna wo ɓəgbe m. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Apirisiti tukwoda n owa nyawuyii ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi n ɓo, ɓai kpe wo aɓo n əwyei bmyibmyii. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Nlonu Hiridusu n əwo akwnuyii ɓa ci wo aɓo jesnu ɓa kpe wo agyè. Ba kpe wo əje dnagbmai, ɓa je wo zè ya lo ncei n Byilatusu aba. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Hiridusu n Byilatusui yi ɓa ɓə zhni anuwnuyi nu n ajei, nya əwyi yi; ntu əɓo ye ɓo, ɓa kwu zhni anugwnudo.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Byilatusu wa yì apirisiti atukwoda n abegyiyii ɓədo n azai zhi n abagbmanyi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />wa gna ɓa, “Fya ɓe mi ń əza yei, ngye əza nu ń wo fyi azaya, ɓa zhni atukwo gnanakwo ɓo. Mi la wo mwugye ń əfye awye, jesnu mi to gye əɓəho n fye ɓa shiɓwa fya kpe wo aɓo, nabai fya da owa n woi m. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Kwo Hiridusu cè, wo too ɓwa ɓəho shi m, ntuge wo la wo jezeya ɓe yi ncei; ngye she fye gyewye nyi, wo too zhni ɓəho n kwo kwnuce lo n əfyii m. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ntucenu, mi ɓa ta wo njesnu maa wo yaɓwa.” [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />N gnanaznu awyefna sa, kwo ɓə zhni ɓəshishi nu ɓa knyi əza gbmanyi, n wo dna n zhalu, wa lo wo ya ga ɓa.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ama deeji vnyanya kwa ɓəwyi, “A lo n əza yei! A la Barabas yaɓwa ga yi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(A ɓə n Barabas sheya dna ń zhalu ntu tnaɓəgbetuvyi ɓo nu ǹ zawui dna n əzhiyaakwo.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Byilatusu ɓə ncei pma wa ya Yeisu əɓwa, ntulonu wa tna ɓa əɓwa njesnu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ama ɓa gyiabye n akwufyii, “A la wo znudu! A la wo znudu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Wa daɓo əɓwa taayi n əɓai: “Ntu knyiɓei a? Knyi əɓogalai nu n əza ye wo kwu zhni a? Mi to gye əɓəho n wo, n kwo kwnuce lo a znu əfyi owa tu wo m. Ntucenu, mi ɓa ga wo tata jesnu ma ya wo əɓwa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama ɓa fyiakwu n akalái ɓa kwu gyima nge a la wo znudu, jesnu əɓa akwufyi kwaa myignyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ntucenu Byilatusu wa dna bwugba wa zhni əɓo ga ɓa n ɓa ɓə ye nyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Waa əza ye lo ya ga ɓa ń a ɓə n woi sheya dna n zhalu ntu tnaɓəgbetuvyi ɓo n zawui dna n əzhiyaakwo; əza ń ɓa ɓə nya wo nu ɓo nyi, jesnu waa Yeisu ga ɓa she əɓa ɓəmwi ɓə nyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu znuznudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Shi akwnuyi ɓə lo n woi, ɓa wna Sima woi gbmi ń Sireni, əza ń wo ɓə gbmi n afwaba woi lo əzhimi, ɓa tu wo znudu jesnu ɓa zhni wo wa shi kwo woi vyi Yeisu n avnu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Aza bəgyé ɓa vyi wo, n anyikwozai n ɓa ɓə zhi n bwugbazhii jesnu ɓai ciɓwi ɓai fyiakwu ntu əwo əɓo. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yeisu wa pmyiawye wa gna ɓa, “Urishelima anyigwnu, fye to ciɓwi ntu əmi ɓo m, fye ciɓwi ntu əfyehni ɓo ɓədo n əfye aɓyii. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ntuge əsa ɓə ɓe n fye ɓə gna, ‘Anabəlikada nu n alamai, aɓyimaba ń ɓa to ɓə ma aɓyi m nanyinanyi, n aɓeɓei ń a to ɓə kpa aɓyi ncei nyi m!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Nlonu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">“ ‘ɓa ɓə gna ape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">“Fye myiya kpe n yi!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">jesnu ɓai gna apekwnukwnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">“Fye kwu yi byi!” ’<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ntuge ngye aza zhni əɓəye pya lo əsa n shnuwna ye gnyi n shnipwui, knyiɓei nu ɓə zhni əsa n kwo ɓə la woakawu a?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Azaje ngwnu-aba ń ɓa ɓə zhni avyì nu, aa ɓa kwu n kwnusnu n woi əə wu ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />She ɓa ɓə si aba n a yi nge atukwobwe aba, ɓaa wo znudu ń abaayi, n kwnusnu n avyii; gbmanyi tu n əwo ɓwaizhe, gbmanyi tu n əwo ɓwaipmi ɓwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yeisu wa gna, “Dada, zo ɓa abwi ntuge ɓa ta kpe əɓo ye lo n ɓa zhni m.” Jesnu ɓa gná əwo aje n əbashei.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Aza ɓa kwu zhi ɓai shiawye, jesnu abegyiyi ce ɓai kpe wo agyè. Ɓa gna, “Wo ɓə la azaje gnyi, akpəge wo gnyi əwohni; ngye wo zhni Kirisiti, Shekwoyi nya nu, Əza Knyiknyiyi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Akwnuyi ce ɓa ɓe jesnu ɓa kpe wo agyè. Ɓa ga wo anamnuwna mamai <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />jesnu ɓa gna, “Ngye əho nu zhni əsu Ayahudiyi nya, akpəge ho gnyi əhohni.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Wyidna ɓə kakpe n əwo tukwo əshe n əkwo nu ɓə nyi;</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">Əza ye nu Zhni Ayahudiyi əsu.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Zaknayi n avyì yi ń wo ɓə gyitu n ɓo nyi, wa knyi Yeisu akpmi: “Mi ta gna əho nu zhni Kirisiti m? Gnyi əhohni ɓədo n əyii!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ama aɓəkawuzhniyi zabaayi wa gnaknyi wo, wa gna, “Ho ta wo Shekwoyi ədna lo m, shikwonyi yi gwo tata gbmanyi nu m? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Əyi tata dnalo n əfye ntuge yi gwo ənya nu n əyi aɓəzhni gwogwolo ncei. Ama əza ye too zhni əɓonukwoi ho m.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Nlonu wa gna, “Yeisu, ɓəə pa əmi ɓo, əsa n ho ɓə lodna ncei n əho əbemi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi gna ho gaiciya, n naiye ho ɓa kwnusnu n əmii dna n paradisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Nyipyei atukwogwnu əsa nu ɓə gnyi, jesnu wyegbma kwaa ɓə kpe n əknyii vnyanya, nya snukna ngwnu-ata nyipyei nya, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ntuge nyipyei ɓə la fa wo ɓo. Jesnu, əjesa n a ɓə ncei kna n Dagayipwuwa nyi, kwa gnajeya ngwnu-aba. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yeisu wa yì n bəgye kalá nyai, “Dada, dna ń əho akwnu nu ń mi dna əmi zafnu.” She wo ɓə da əɓəye, wa dna əsnu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Bəzhetagyida woi kwu gye əɓo ń kwo kwu zhni nyi, wa ci Shekwoyi wa gna, “Ɓəhnihni əza ye ɓə zhni ɓəfyeceyi nu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />She aza vnyanya ń ɓa ɓəə la yezhi ɓa gye əɓo ye nyi, ɓə gye əɓo n kwo ɓə zhni, ɓa zè agwu aɓwa njesnu ɓa gaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ama aza yi vnyanya ń ɓa ɓe kpe wo əye, du ɓədo ń anyikwozai n ɓa ɓə ya wo vyi n Gəlili nyi, ɓa kwu zhi n tagnyi, ɓai gye aɓo ye.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu byibyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Nsaiye əza ɓə nyi ai yi wo ge Yusufu, wo ɓə dna n abwokwnuda, wo ɓə zhni əza manai nu jesnu gaiciyazhniyi, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />əza n wo to ɓə əɓwai dna n əɓa ɓəznu ɓədo n əɓa aɓəzhnii m. Wo ɓə gbmi n Arimatiya nu, Yahudiyi əzhi jesnu əwo n əwohni tukwo, wo ɓə gnyi woi pmi Shekwoyi əbemi nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Wa lo da Byilatusu, wa nya Yeisu nayi ɓo. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Nlonu wa shni kwo shi n əknyi, wa kwu kwo wna aje luweluwei jesnu waa kwo la dna n vnyigwo n a ɓə ncei fna dna n kwuta, ədo n a to ɓə shni əza byidna ń kwo m. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Əwyi yi ɓə zhni nyipyei aɓəzhnizhi nya nu, njesnu Sibyiwyi ɓə ye kwa si nu.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Anyikwoza n ɓa ɓə kwnu ɓe n Yeisui ɓai kwnu n Gəlili nyi, ɓa vyi Yusufu, ɓa lo ɓa gye vnyigwo njesnu shi a ɓə ya əwo nayi dna n kwo. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Nlonu ɓa lo apyi ɓa vyi anyasnidaí ɓo n əmi asnidaíi. Ama ɓa kwu snu n Sibyiwyii ntu ɓəvyi aɓəgbetu nya ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu wo la laka n əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Dna n nyipyei kpmisnuyi laadi yi nya, n labmilabmii, anyikwoza ɓa kwu anyasnidaí n ɓa ɓəə la zhniaba zhi nyi, ɓa lo vnyigwo. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ɓa gye kwuta ń pmyipmyii ya ń vnyigwo, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />ama she ɓa ɓə lofyi, to ɓa gye Dagayi Yeisu nayi shi m. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ɓai ye zhi n ɓəwowoi ɓəye nya, n əsagbmanyii ɓa gye aza ngwnu-aba ń ma ɓa zhi, n ajei kpe ɓai bmyana ngye əgbmanabmya. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Anyikwoza yi ɓai ye zhi n ədnai, ɓa yakwnu n awyei wu n əknyi, ama aza yi ɓa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei zna əza wyewyeyi shni ń afyífyiyi aba a? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Wo to dnalo n ya m; wo la laka! Fye pa əɓo n wo ɓə gna fye woi ye kwnusnu n fyei ń Gəlili: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Ɓəshishi nu a ɓə lá Əza Nugwnu ga dna n aleifyizhniyi akwnu, ə la wo znudu, dna nyipyei taayi, a ɓə la wo laka jesnu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Nlonu ɓa pa əwo aɓədagbma ɓo.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />She ɓa ɓə zhí avnyigwo, ɓa da Awocei-gbmanyi aɓo ye vnyanya, n azajei vnyanya, n ɓa ce nyi.<verse eid="LUK 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Mariyamwu Magadalayi, Jowana, Mariyamwu Jemyis əya n azajei ń kwnusnu ń ɓai nu ɓə gna atnutnuloyi aɓo ye. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ama to ɓa ga anyikwoza ye gaiciya m, ntuge əɓa ɓədagbma ɓə wu ngye əɓo tnatukwogyii nu. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ama Byitusu wa laka, wa bwusi lo vnyigwo. Shi wo ɓə ya awye shi, wa ɓwa ajebwe nu wyegye n yakpe, jesnu wa jezelo woi zhni əɓonubwo fyi ń əwo mi, əɓo ń kwo ɓəə kwu zhni nyi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Znazna lo Imawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Dna n əwyi yi, əɓa ngwnu-aba ɓə lo ń zokwo ɓai znazna lo əzhigba ń a yi kwo nge Imawus nyi, ń kwo ɓə nyi ngye amyalu ngwnu-tnaaba n əkpa ənya n kwo laka ń Urishelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ɓa ɓə lo ɓai daɓo n ajei nu, kpe n aɓo vnyanya ń ɓa ɓəə kwu zhni nyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Shi ɓa ɓə lo ɓai daɓo jesnu ɓai taaza kpe ń aɓo ye tukwo, Yeisu n əwohnii, wa ɓe da ɓa, wa kwnu znazna n ɓai; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />ama to a ye nge ɓa kpe wo əye m.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye lo fyei da knyiɓei nu n ajei lo ń əzna ye a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Ɓa kwu kpezhi kpa ń awyei mafyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Zaknayi n ɓa, ai yi wo ge Kileyopas, wa nya wo əɓo, “Əho nu ɓwa zhiɓeyi zhni dna n Urishelima, n ho ta kpe aɓo ye lo n ɓa kwu zhni fyi ń anyipyei ye nyi m?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Wa nyaɓo, “Aknyiɓəi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Aɓo tu n Yeisu Nazeretiyi tukwo. Wo ɓə zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu, əwo ɓədagbma ɓədo ń atnutnui ɓə ń kalái dna n Shekwoyi abye ɓədo ń aza abai vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Apirisiti atukwoda ń əyi abegyiyii ɓaa wo taya ga nabai a znu əfyi owa tu wo, jesnu ɓaa wo znudu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ama yi ɓəə la əwye tu nge əwo nu zhni əza ń wo ɓə ye wa ɓe Israila n shnashnai. Njesnu knyiɓei nu ce a, nnaiye nu zhni nyipyei taayi she aɓo ye ɓə zhni vnyanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Əɓo ń kwo la je ɓe, anyikwoza n əyi atasni ɓa kwu ɓəwowo gna yi. Ɓa lo vnyigwo n labmii nnaiye, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ama to ɓa gye Yeisu nayi ye shi m. Ɓa jezezhi ɓanyi gna yi nge ɓa kwu ɓəwyegye amaləka nya gyewye, n ɓa gna nge wo n wyewyeyii lo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Nlonu əyi azaje ho, ɓaa lo vnyigwo ɓanyi ɓwa wyegye shi anyikwoza ɓə da nyi nu, ama ɓa to gye Yeisu nayi əwye m.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Wa gna ɓa, “Gye fye zhni amama nu, jesnu fye ta pyelo n gaiciyagai ń aɓo vnyanya n sheɓəgwognayi ɓə kwu da nyi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Kwo to ɓə zhni ɓəshishi nu Kirisiti wa gyeazhnì aɓo ye nya, wa kpəlo dna ń əwo latu m?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nlonu Yeisu wa kna ɓa awyeya ənya n kwo kafyilo n anyakagyigyiyi ntu əwohni ɓo; ənya n kwo ya ń Mwusa kwoi lo Sheaɓəgwognayi aje vnyanya.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n əzhigbai n ɓa ɓə lo kwo nyi, Yeisu wa zhni ngye wo ye wa gwodu lo n abyei. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ama ɓa gyi wo əwye n əwyei bmyibmyii, “La wnagye n əyi aba, ntuge wyeshe kwo la ga she; nyipyei kwo la ga zo.” Ntulonu wa kwnulo waa dna n ɓai.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />She wo ɓə sasetu ń kwnusnu n ɓai ń tebwul, wa shni biledi, wa sa Shekwoyi ami, waa kwo saya, jesnu wa ya ɓa kwo gná. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Nlonu əɓa awye ɓaa gwuya, ɓa kwu kpe ge əwo nu tu, jesnu waa ɓwuwye ń əɓa awyeba. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ɓa nya aje aɓo, “Əyi adu to ɓə pyena fyi ń əmì; woi ye ɓe woi daɓo n yii, yi ye ɓe ń zokwo, jesnu əsa ń wa gwu Anyakagyigyiyi ya ga yi nyi m?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ɓa kwuka n əsagbmanyii ɓa jezelo Urishelima. Ɓa lo ɓa gye Awocei-gbmanyi n aza yii n ɓa ɓə kwnusnu nyi n gwnudo zhi n abagbmanyi, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ɓai gna, “Gaiciya nu! Dagayi wo la laka jesnu wo la kpeya da Sima.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Nlonu əɓa ngwnu-aba ɓa daɓo ń kwo ɓə zhni n zokwo, jesnu shi ɓa ɓə kpe ge Yeisu nu tu, əsa n wo ɓə sa biledi ya ncei nyi.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu kpeya da amwutuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ɓai ye ɓwazhi ɓai daɓo ye, Yeisu n əwohnii wa kpeya dna n əɓa atasni, wa gna ɓa, “Bwugbafu kwo kwnusnu n fyei.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ca wo ɓa jesnu ɓa vnyi, ɓai zhninubwo nge ɓa gye nyasnuɓwuyi nu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Wa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei wnubwugba a, jesnu knyiyi nu zhni fyei fyi abwugba ngwnu-aba n əfye mii a? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Fye shi əmi aɓwa awye n əmi apitai. Əmi nu n mihnii! Fye to mi əɓwa fya gye; nyasnuɓwuyi to n nayi gyi n asnukwnui, ngye shi fya gye mi ncei gyi nyi m.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />She wo ɓəə kwu dəye da, wa wu ɓa əwo aɓwa n apitai. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Njesnu əsa n ɓa ɓə ye zhi to ɓai ga ce gaiciya ntu agbmada ɓo n ɓəwowoi, wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye n nyahoi lo ń ya n a ɓa gyi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ɓa ga wo əbmya pisai ɓyiyi natuyi, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />jesnu wa gwo kwo wa gyi kwo ń əɓa awyeba.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Wa gna ɓa, “Əɓo nyi ń mi ɓə gna fye mii ye kwnusnu n fyei: Nyahonyahoi n kwo kafyilo ntu əmi ɓo ń Mwusa owa ń sheaɓəgwognayii ń Anyisasayii, ɓəshishinu kwa nu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Nlonu wa gwu əɓa abwugba ya nabai n ɓa ɓá ɓwa Anyakagyigyiyi awyega.<verse eid="LUK 24:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Wa gna ɓa, “Əɓo nyi n kwo kafyilo: Kirisiti ɓə gyeazhnì jesnu woi laka ń əfyi ń nyipyei taayii, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />jesnu nge a ɓə zhni waazi abwuye nya, ntu n aleifyi zo ɓo, dna n əwo əye ga abye vnyanya, kwoi ya ń Urishelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Fye zhni aɓəkwnuyi nu aɓo ye nya. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Mi ɓə tnu fye n ɓəgbeshii əmi Dada nya; ama fye kwu kpefyi n əzhiyaakwo kpa, nya əsa n a ɓə kwu fye pwi n kalái n kwo kwnu n əshe nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gwnugwnu lo əshemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />She wo ɓəə la ɓa kwnuya lo ncei vyivyiwyi ń Byetanii, wa kwu əwo aɓwa wu ń əshe jesnu wa kpe ɓa anabəlika. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Woi ye gnyi woi kpe ɓa anabəlika, wa fa ɓa jesnu a la wo gwnulo ncei n əshemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Nlonu ɓa ga wo mwamwa, ɓa jezelo Urishelima n agbmada yaakwoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Nlonu ɓa kwu fyi n Dagayipwuwa ciici, ɓai ci Shekwoyi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>